1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ashkenazi Jewish per DNA test results for grandson [https://www.geni.com/people/George-R-R-Martin/6000000081001962237#/tab/discussion George RR Martin], whose admixture showed 22.5% Ashkenazi Jewish.
