2 CONT From https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2021/11/22/how-your-family-tree-could-catch-a-killer
2 CONT
2 CONT > CeCe Moore identified Chaim Yossel Perlmutter as George Martin’s grandfather. He was born in 1896 in Poritzk, a shtetl in what is now northwestern Ukraine. … Joseph died before turning fifty, from liver disease. He and his wife 
2 CONC never had children, but a niece and a nephew remembered him as a kindhearted uncle. Moore ended her presentation with a photo of his gravestone—a beautifully carved, well-tended monument. A Hebrew inscription began, “Here is burie
2 CONC d an upright man, our teacher, the master.”
2 CONT
