1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/17739972/person/548598169/story Ancestry tree]
2 CONT
2 CONT >Louis Aloysius Martin was born in 1896 in Naples, Napoli, Italy, the son of Ms. Martin and Mr. Martin (Mazzaccola). He married Grace Dorothy Jones and they had a child together. He also had one son and one daughter from another r
2 CONC elationship. He had one brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Names: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >“We know that his birth name was Aloysius Mazzucola/Massacola (unsure of the exact spelling for both first & last name). Went by Louie (unsure of exact spelling) could have possibly gone by Al. Last name was change to Martin when
2 CONC  he immigrated to the U.S.”
2 CONT
