1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Madaline Gassman Crosby died Wednesday, March 18, 2015 at home, surrounded by her family. She was 92. She is second cousins with the father of https://www.geni.com/people/George-R-R-Martin/6000000081001962237 and s
2 CONC he looks like him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Bayonne, she resided in East Brunswick for many years.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a communicant of Our Lady of Peace RC Church, North Brunswick.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was predeceased by her husband, Harvey Crosby, Sr. in 1987, and by her son, Harvey Crosby, Jr last month.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are three sons, Donald and his wife Linda Crosby of Jackson, Robert and his wife Brenda Crosby of Spotswood, Thomas and his wife Shari Crosby of Somerset, and Gary and his wife Patricia Crosby of Milltown; two daughters,
2 CONC  Joyce and her husband Kenneth McEwan of Toms River, and Kathleen and her husband Ross Pennington of Old Bridge; a daughter in law, Carol Crosby of Jackson; 19 grandchildren and 17 great grandchildren.
