2 CONT ****			i. Sir Randle Brereton of Ipstones, Shoclach and Malpas (a 1522, Chamberlain of Chester)
2 CONT ****			  m. Eleanor Dutton (dau of Piers Dutton of Hatton)
2 CONT ****			The following comes from Visitation (Cheshire, 1613, Brereton of Wettenhall) with support from Visitation (Cheshire, 1580, Brereton of Eccleston).
2 CONT ****			  partner unknown
