1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-40001/familysearch-family-tree?itemId=912445243&action=showRecord FamilySearch Family Tree] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: '
