2 CONT ----------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Colie're (Collyer) and Joyce Scrimshaw
2 CONT 1. James Collyer, born about 1538 in Stone, Staffordshire, England, died about 1597 in London,  England, married Jane Needham, born about 1542 in London, England and died about 1637 in  London, England.
2 CONT 2. Richard Collyer, born about 1539 in Stone, Staffordshire, England.   Date of death unknown.
2 CONT 3. Margaret Collyer, born about 1540 in Stone, Staffordshire, England.
2 CONT 4. Thurston Collyer, (My Direct Ancestor) was born about 1542 in Stone, Staffordshire, England,  died 1593 in Brentford, Middlesex, England, married Elizabeth Tunstall (sometimes spelled  Turnstall), born 1542 in Thurland, Lancash
2 CONC ire, England and died about 1570 in Brentford,  Middlesex, England.
2 CONT 5. Isabella Collyer, born about 1546 in Stone, Staffordshire, England.  Date of death unknown.
2 CONT 6. Cecelia "Cecily" Collyer, born about 1550 in Stone, Staffordshire, England.  Date of death  unknown.
2 CONT [Sources and Citations:  Devon, England, Extracted Parish Records;  Staffordshire Arts and Museum Service; "Robert Terrell Collier" by Vaughn Ballard;  Multiple published stories on Ancestry.com, Rootsweb, and other internet sites
2 CONC ;  Family Data Files on Ancestry.com.]
