2 CONT '''The Ambrose Clare for whom a headright was granted to Samuell Griffin, 6 Aug 1662. He was granted (de jure) 300 acres in James City, Co., VA, 15 Oct 1664, after he m Anne, widow of original grantee, Jonathan Townsend. He was th
2 CONC e Ambrose for whom a warrant was issued, 1 Oct 1674, to the Sheriff of New Kent Co., VA, due to his non-appearance in court. He m (1) UNKNOWN, date & place unknown; & (2) Anne Townsend, before 15 Oct 1664, James City Co., VA. His 
2 CONC will, 28 May 1686, was proved in London, admin given, 10 Nov 1697, to Richard Parke, attorney for Anne, who by then had married Thomas Tea in Virginia.'''
