2 CONT http://www.geocities.ws/Heartland/Cliffs/6573/sothy.html 2.    Mary Sothey (1.Richard1) born 1600, Essex, England, married (1) Nov 1, 1619, in Saffron, Walden, Essex, England, Thomas Pidge, born 1583, Essex, England, (son of Nicho
2 CONC las Pidge and Johane (?)) died Dec 30, 1643, Roxbury, Suffolk, MA, married (2) Aug 3, 1645, Michael Metcalf, died Dec 24, 1664.  Mary died Feb 12, 1672, Roxbury, Suffolk, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Thomas Pidge:
2 CONT *        +3.     i    Mary Pidge born Feb 11, 1620.
2 CONT *           4.     ii    Ann Pidge buried: Mar 9, 1627, Saffron, Walden, Essex, England.
2 CONT *           5.     iii   Sarah Pidge buried: Aug 26, 1629.
2 CONT *           6.     iv   Hannah Pidge.
2 CONT *           7.     v    Thomas Pidge buried: Jul 25, 1632, Saffron, Walden, Essex, England.
2 CONT *           8.     vi   Thomas Pidge born c. 1635, Roxbury, MA, died Sep 1660, Dedham, Norfolk, MA.
2 CONT *           9.     vii  Sarah Pidge born c. 1638, Roxbury, MA, married Dec 7, 1656, in Dedham, Norfolk, MA, Thomas Metcalf, born Dec 27, 1629, St. Edmundsbury, England, (son of Michael Metcalf and Sarah Elwyn).
2 CONT *           10.    viii  John Pidge born c. 1640, Roxbury, MA.
2 CONT *           11.    ix   Martha Pidge born Mar 12, 1643, Roxbury, MA.
2 CONT
