2 CONT NICHOLAS, Newbury, perhaps br. of the preced. (Christopher) came in the James from Southampton, with w. Lucy, arr. at Boston 3 June 1635, is call. in the ship's clearance, "of the Devizes, linen weaver," had Sarah, b. 12 June 1640
2 CONC , and two more ds. He d. 6 Dec. 1677 ; and his wid. Lucy d. 26 Jan. 1679. 
2 CONT Original individual @P2203498617@ (@MS_NHFETTERLYFAMIL0@) merged with @P2203432164@ (@MS_NHFETTERLYFAMIL0@)
1 NOTE Came on the "James", arriving in Boston on 3 Jun 1635 . He is called in the ship's clearance "of the Devises, linen weaver." Ancestor of Pres. Franklin Pierce. He settled in Newbury. His will was dated  18 June 1674 and proved 26 
2 CONC March 1678. His inventory came to £242:11:6
