2 CONT ********							Sr Robt Needham of Shenton Kt ob. 20 H. 7 [bought Shavington 1506; Sheriff 1529]. = Agnes da. to John or Jenkin Manwaring of Pever in [com.] Chest'r. ; ch: Maude (m. Tho. Venables), Jane Anne (m. Sr Andrew Corbett),
2 CONC  '''Tho. (m. Agnes Hope & Ann Talbott)''', John, Robert Needham.
2 CONT *********'''								Tho. Needham of Shenton ob. in vita patris. = Agnes da. to . . . .  Hope. ; ch:''' Agnes Needham;''' = Ann da. to Sr John Talbott of Grafton Kt. ; ch:''' Robert (m. Francis Aston), John, Margrett (m. Richard St
2 CONC eventon), Margery Mary (m. Geo. Conney) Agnes (m. Sr Richard Bulkley & . . . .  Cranage), Joane, Anne Needham.
