2 CONC ton], 1st Baron Brereton, and 1st dau. of Sir William Brereton, of Brereton, co. Chester''', and had issue:
2 CONT **		1. Mary Egerton (bur. 21 Mar 1669 at Stoneleigh, co. Warwick), mar. 11 Nov 1610 Thomas [Leigh], 1st Baron Leigh, and had issue
2 CONT **		2. Vere Egerton (d. 4 May 1629; bur. in the Booth Chapel, Bowdon Church, co. Chester), mar. 1619 William Booth, of Dunham Massey, co. Chester (dvp. 26 Apr 1636; bur. in the Booth Chapel, Bowdon Church, co. Chester), 1st son an
2 CONC d heir ap. of Sir George Booth, 1st Bt., of Dunham Massey, co. Chester, by his second wife Katherine Anderson, dau. of Sir Edmund Anderson, Chief Justice of the Common Pleas 1582-1605, and had issue
2 CONT **		3. Elizabeth Egerton (dsp.), mar. John Dutton (dvp. 1608), only son of Thomas Dutton, of Dutton
