2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN PEABODY1 was born about 1590 in St. Albans, Hertford Co., England. He probably came to the Plymouth Colony in 1635 or 1636, for his name appears on the list of freemen of the colony dated March 7, 1636/37, and he was admitted
2 CONC  and sworn with others whose names were on that list on Jan. 2, 1637/8. He married Isabel Harper, sister of Thomas Harper of London, England. 
2 CONT
