2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # John Leveson
2 CONT # Nicholas Leveson, b. 1494, d. 15 Oct. 1539.  Married Denyse Bodley.
2 CONT # James Leveson, b. abt 1502, d. 23 Oct. 1545.  Married 1) Alice Wrottesley 2) Margery Offley.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
