2 CONT '''     Sir Richard Leveson, Vice Admiral of Prestwood was born on 7 May 1457 at Kinver, Staffordshire, England.1 He married Hillaria Bradbury''', daughter of William Bradbury and Margaret Rockhill, '''circa 1480 at of Prestwood, 
2 CONC Ellastone, Staffordshire, England.1 Sir Richard Leveson, Vice Admiral of Prestwood died on 7 October 1503 at Leveson Hall, Wolverhampton, Staffordshire, England, at age 46.'''1
