2 CONT # The Wallop family and their ancestry, Vol. 2.  page viewer 273, page number 487, chart # 604.   < [https://www.familysearch.org/library/books/viewer/206419/?offset=0#page=273&viewer=picture&o=search&n=0&q=leveson FamilySearch] >
