2 CONC Thomas Bradbury, mercer, of London; Lord Mayor 1509. > Nichols Leveson, of Haling, Kent; Sheriff of London 1534; d. 1539.  m. Dioysia, da. of Thomas Bodley, citizen of London, by Joan, sister of John Leche, vicar of Walden; foundr
