1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Sarah Wood
2 CONT * Born 10 Oct 1642 in Roxbury, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT * Died 29 Dec 1678 at age 36 in Braintree, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT * Daughter of Nicholas Wood and Mary (Pidge) Wood
2 CONT * Sister of Mary (Wood) Thurston, Elizabeth (Wood) Morse, Jonathan Wood, Mehitabel (Wood) Morse, Bethia (Wood) Cutter and Eleazer Wood
2 CONT * Wife of Thomas Bass — married 4 Oct 1660 in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT * Mother of Abigail Bass, Samuel Bass, Sarah (Bass) Thayer, Mary Bass, John Bass and Mehitable Bass
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT Marriage 4 Oct 1660 Medfield, Norfolk, Massachusetts[1][2][3] 
2 CONT Husband: Thomas Bass Wife: Sarah Wood
2 CONT
2 CONT # Child: Abigail Bass
2 CONT # Child: Samuel Bass
2 CONT # Child: Mary Bass
2 CONT # Child: Sarah Bass
2 CONT # Child: John Bass
2 CONT # Child: Mehitable Bass
2 CONT
