2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==Elizabeth Wood==
2 CONT * BIRTH: ABT 1645, Dorchester, Suffolk, MA 
2 CONT * DEATH: 26 Jun 1682, Medfield, Suffolk, MA [1576] 
2 CONT * Parents Unknown. She was not daughter of Nicholas WOOD and Mary PIDGE 
2 CONT *  It is unclear whether her maiden name was Wood or Moore or just unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE: 
2 CONT # 10 Feb 1664, Sudbury, Middlesex, MA [5741] [5743] to Samuel MORSE (1639-1717); his 1st wife
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Samuel and Elizabeth (Wood) Morse were:
2 CONT # Samuel, born 1665; 
2 CONT # Elizabeth, March 21, 1668; 
2 CONT #  Hannah, August 31. 1669. died young; 
2 CONT # Ruth, March 21, 1672; 
2 CONT # Joseph, 1674; 
2 CONT # Joshua, April 2. 1677, mentioned below; 
2 CONT # Eleazer. August 10, 1680; 
2 CONT # Benoni, June 19, 1682, died 1704. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://books.google.com/books?id=nfhSZxL8bTEC&lpg=RA11-PA491&ots=WuEURynuFk&dq=samuel%20morse%201639&pg=RA11-PA491#v=onepage&q=samuel%20morse%201639&f=false Historic Homes and Institutions and Genealogical and Personal .].., Vo
