1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jonathan, s. of Nicholas Wood and Mary Pidge, b. Jan. 3, 1651-2 at Medfield, Mass. and died Feb. 21, 1675-6 when slain by Indians during the King Philips War. The Medfield vital records reflect his birth and death 
2 CONC with the notation of the reason for his death. He was married and had one recorded child.
