2 CONT *'''Mary Metcalf Fisher
2 CONT *'''Birth: 	Nov., 1660  Dedham, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT *'''Death: 	Dec. 16, 1727  Medfield, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT *'''Mary was born in Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts in November, 1660 and baptized there on the 25th. She was the daughter of''' Thomas and Sarah Pidge Metcalfe. '''She married John Fisher in Medfield, Norfolk County, on June 8, 1
2 CONC 683. Mary and John had at least eight children, all born in Medfield, the last in 1703. Mary died in Medfield on December 16, 1727. There was only one cemetery in use in Midfield at the time of Marey's death, Vine Lake Cemetery, s
2 CONC o that is most likely the place where she is buried. It is a very large cemetery with many unmarked graves.
