2 CONT 3↑ 3.0 3.1 3.2 3.3 3.4 3.5 3.6 The Record of Births, Marriages and Deaths, and Intentions of Marriage, in the Town of Dedham, 1635-1845, Don G. Hill editor, Dedham, MA, 1886
