1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Bullard was son of Robert Bullard the brother of William Bullard. Robert Bullard married Ann Martyn. Benjamin's lineage is covered in NEHGR 146:279-80, 154:172-88 and Kempton Anc 1:198-206. He married firs
2 CONC t Martha Pidge, He married second (and last) Elizabeth Ellis. He *never* married Sarah ___. And his wife Martha's maiden name was *not * Thorpe. Please do not edit relationships - read the sources which correct inaccurate older ge
2 CONC nealogies below. Children with first wife Martha Pidge:
2 CONT
