2 CONT # Samuel Bullard 1667 - 1727
2 CONT # Benjamin Bullard 1670 - Bef 1753
2 CONT # Hannah Bullard 1672 - 1750
2 CONT # Eleazer (1) Bullard 1676 - Bef 1681 (died young)
2 CONT
