2 CONT Benjamin Bullard's first wife, Martha Fairbanks/Pidge By: John M. Kingsbury The following has been adapted from Bullard Newsletter, # 168, May 9, 1996, published by the Bullard Memorial Farm Association. The Bullard Farm in Hollis
