1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LDTH-FD7/samuel-bullard-1667-1727
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Samuel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Samuel Bullard was born on 26 December 1667, in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Benjamin Bullard Sr, was 33 and his mother, Martha Pidge, was 25. He married Deborah Atherton in June 1691, in Sherb
2 CONC orn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters. He lived in Medfield, Norfolk, Massachusetts, United States in 1667. He died on 11 December 1727, in She
2 CONC rborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 59, and was buried in Old South Cemetery, Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
