1 NOTE {geni:about_me} IDENTITY: Investigate> Norcliffe's 'Visitation of Yorkshire in the years 1563 and 1564' page 86 calls her (the wife of Richard Dalton) Catherine daughter of Sir Thomas Venables, Knight."
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''The Visitations of Yorkshire in the Years 1563 and 1564: Made by William ...     By William Flower
2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=pjMEAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA394&lpg=PA394&dq=dorothy+hilton+1563&source=bl&ots=V957x6rW7I&sig=QTLYEYcfE7e4_bC5Kio5BoVTfyY&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwju9suQ1vfJAhVJ2GMKHbOBBcs4FBDoAQgeMAE#v=onepage&q=dalton&f=fa
2 CONC lse
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/visitationsyork00britgoog
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/visitationsyork00britgoog#page/n97/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg.85
2 CONT **	Dalton.
2 CONT *Sir Rychard Dalton  of Byspam in Lancashyre, Knight. = ; ch: Sir Robert (m. . . .  Latham), Sir John (2 son.) Dalton
2 CONT **Sir John Dalton Knight 2 son. ; ch: B (Pg.86 Sir Pyter Dalton Knight. = . . . .  doughter of . . . .  ; ch: John Dalton.)
2 CONT **Sir Robert Dalton son & heyre of Sir Rychard Dalton Knight. = . . . .  doughter of Sir Thomas Latham. ; ch: A (Pg.86 Sir John (m. . . . .  Hussey) Dalton)
2 CONT ***https://archive.org/stream/visitationsyork00britgoog#page/n98/mode/1up
2 CONT ***Sir John Dalton Knight. = . . . .  doughter of Sir Henry Hussey Knight. ; ch: Sir John (m. . . . .  Pylkyngton.) Dalton
2 CONT ****Sir John Dalton Knight son & heyre to Sir John. = . . . .  doughter of Sir Rychard Pylkngton. ; ch: '''Sir Rychard (m. Kateren Venables)''', Robert (m. Margaret . . . .  ) Dalton.
2 CONT *****'''Sir Rychard Dalton''' Knight son & heyr to Sir John. '''= Kateren doughter of Sir Thomas Venables, Knight. ; ch:''' Ales (m. William Gryffyth), other doters Dalton
2 CONT ******Ales '''doter of Sir Rychard Dalton'''. = William Gryffyth of Penryn in Carmarthenshyre. ; ch: Sir William, Jennet Gryffyth.
2 CONT *****Robert Dalton of Bispayne, 2nd son. = Margaret doughter of . . . . ; ch: William (m. Elsabeth Beaconsall), John (3rd son.), Rychard (m. doughter of Fleming) Dalton
2 CONT ****** .... etc. _________________
2 CONT *'''The John Dalton book of genealogy
2 CONT *http://archive.org/details/johndaltonbookof00dalt
2 CONT *http://archive.org/stream/johndaltonbookof00dalt#page/2/mode/1up
2 CONT **THE VISITATION OF YORKSHIRE
2 CONT *1-Sir Rychard of Byspam, in Lancashire, Knight
2 CONT *2-A-Sir Robert Dalton, son and heyre of Sir Rychard Dalton Knight, Married ...... daughter of Sir Thomas Latham
2 CONT *3-A-Sir John Dalton Knight, Married ...... daughter of Sir Henry Hussey Knight
2 CONT *4-A-Sir John Dalton, Knight, son and heyre of Sir John, Married ...... daughter of Sir Rychard Pylkyngton
2 CONT *They had two sons
2 CONT *5-A-Sir Rychard Dalton
2 CONT *5-A-Robert Dalton, second son
2 CONT *'''5-A-Sir Rychard Dalton, Knight son and heyre''' to Sir John, '''Married Kateren daughter of Sir Thomas Venables Knight
2 CONT *6-A-Ales '''doter of Sir Rychard Dalton'''—Married William Gryffyth of Penkyn in Carmarthenshyre
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT *	1-Sir William Gryffyth
2 CONT *	2-Jennet
2 CONT *'''6-A-Sir Rychard and Kateren Venables, had other doters
2 CONT *5-A-Robert Dalton of Bispayne, second son of Sir John 4A Married Margaret .... etc. _________________________
2 CONT *	'Dalton01'
2 CONT *Sir Richard Dalton of Bypsam, Lancashire
2 CONT **     1. Sir Robert Dalton
2 CONT **       m. _Latham (dau of Sir Thomas Latham)
2 CONT ***          A. Sir John Dalton
2 CONT ***            m. _ Hussey (dau of Sir Henry Hussey)
2 CONT ****               i. Sir John Dalton
2 CONT ****                 m. _ Pilkington (dau of Sir Richard Pylkyngton)
2 CONT *****'''                    a. Sir Richard Dalton 'of Apethorpe'
2 CONT *****'''                      m. Katherine Venables''' (dau of Sir Thomas Venables)
2 CONT ******                         (1) Ales Dalton
2 CONT ******                           m. William Gryffyth of Penryn
2 CONT ******                         (2)+ other daughters
2 CONT *****                    b. .... etc.
2 CONT *Main source(s): Visitation (Yorkshire, 1563-4, Dalton), Commoners (vol i, Dalton of Thurnham)    
2 CONT *From: Stirnet.com
2 CONT * http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/dalton01.php _________________
