2 CONT *'''Sir William Needham 
2 CONT *'''M, b. circa 1450
2 CONT *Father     Thomas Needham b. c 1405
2 CONT *Mother     Maud Brereton b. c 1430
2 CONT *'''     Sir William Needham was born circa 1450 at Cranach, Cheshire, England. He married Isabel Bromley, daughter of Sir John Bromley and Joane Hexstall, circa 1475.
2 CONT *'''Family      Isabel Bromley b. c 1455
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Robert Needham, Sheriff of Shropshire & Cheshire+ b. c 1476, d. 4 Jun 1556
2 CONT **Margaret Needham+ b. c 1480 
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2324.htm#i69849 Source: [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry: A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families in unknown series (n.p.: n.pub., 2013). 
2 CONT __________
2 CONT *'''Sir William Needham1 
2 CONT *M, #341814
2 CONT *Last Edited=12 Mar 2009
2 CONT *'''     Sir William Needham is the son of Thomas Needham and Maud Brereton.1,2 He married Isabel Bromley, daughter of Sir John Bromley.2
2 CONT *'''     Sir William Needham lived at Granage, Cheshire, England.2
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir William Needham and Isabel Bromley
2 CONT ** 1.Sir Robert Needham+1 d. 1556
2 CONT *Citations
