2 CONT *******'''						Sr Wm Needham Knight. = Isabell da. & cohae. to Sr John Bromley Kt. (Sr John Bromley Knight maried Jane dau. & heire to Wm Hartall Hexstall.) ; ch:''' (Pg.372 Margrett (m. Tho. Whittington), Sr Robt (m. Agnes Manwa
2 CONC ring) Needham)
