2 CONT *****(1)	Sir Robert Needham of Shavington & Shenton, Sheriff of Shropshire (d 1556)
2 CONT ***** 	BP1934 does not name Robert's wife. Visitation (Shropshire) identifies her as Agnes, dau of John/Jenkin Manwaring of Pever. Visitation (Cheshire, 1580, 'Needham of Shevinton & of Cranage'), which provides some support for a
2 CONC  few generations, identifies her as Anne, dau of _ Manwaring of Baddeley. Lodge identifies her as Agnes, dau of John Manwaring of Baddeley.
2 CONT ***** 	m. Agnes Manwaring (dau of John or Jenkin Manwaring)
