1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir John Manwaring, Sheriff of Flintshire1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT *'''M, #11586, b. circa 1470
2 CONT *Father      John Manwaring, Esq.2,3,6 b. c 1448, d. 8 Jul 1495
2 CONT *Mother     Maud Legh2,3,6 d. a 1512
2 CONT *'''     Sir John Manwaring, Sheriff of Flintshire was born circa 1470 at of Over Peover, Cheshire, England; Age 45 in 1515.2,3 He married Katherine Honford, daughter of John Honford, Esq. and Margaret Savage, circa 1491; They had
2 CONC  13 sons (Sir Randall; Edmund; John; Peter; Philip; Edward; Robert; Thomas; George; Henry; Nicholas; William; & William) and 2 daughters (Margaret; & Katherine, wife of William Newton).2,7,3,4,5 Sir John Manwaring, Sheriff of Flin
2 CONC tshire left a will on 4 March 1516; Buried at Over Peover, Cheshire.2,3,5 His estate was probated on 18 November 1516.2,3,5
2 CONT *'''Family      Katherine Honford b. c 1472, d. 1529
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Edmund Manwaring
2 CONT **John Manwaring
2 CONT **Piers Manwaring
2 CONT **Philip Manwaring, Esq. d. 11 Apr 1573
2 CONT **Edward Manwaring
2 CONT **Robert Manwaring
2 CONT **Thomas Manwaring
2 CONT **George Manwaring
2 CONT **Henry Manwaring
2 CONT **Katharine Manwaring2 d. 1529
2 CONT **Sir Randall Mainwaring+2,3,5 b. c 1495, d. 6 Sep 1557
2 CONT **Margaret Manwaring b. c 1508
2 CONT *Citations
