2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 557.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 278.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 208.
2 CONT * 5.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 283.
2 CONT * 6.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 282.
2 CONT * 7.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 716.
