1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Anne Talbot1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''F, #90639, b. circa 1515
2 CONT *Father      Sir John Talbot, Sheriff of Shropshire1,5,3,6 b. c 1491, d. 10 Sep 1549
2 CONT *Mother     Margaret Troutbeck1,5,3,6 b. c 1494, d. a 11 Jul 1521
2 CONT *'''     Anne Talbot was born circa 1515 at of Albrighton, Shropshire, England.1 Marriage banns for Anne Talbot and Thomas Needham, Esq. were published on 1 February 1526; They had 2 sons (Robert, Esq; & John) and 5 daughters (Mar
2 CONC garet, wife of Richard Steventon; Mary, wife of George Coyney; Agnes (Anne), wife of Sir Richard Bulkeley, & of Lawrence Cranage, Gent; Joan; & Anne).1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''Family      Thomas Needham, Esq. b. 1510
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Robert Needham, Esq., Sheriff of Shropshire+1,3 b. 1535
2 CONT **Agnes Needham+1,3 b. c 1547
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 707.
2 CONT * 2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 175.
2 CONT * 3.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 206.
2 CONT * 4.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 127.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 174-175.
2 CONT * 6.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 126-127.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3017.htm#i90639 _____________
2 CONT *'''Anne Talbot1
2 CONT *F, #341841
2 CONT *Last Edited=12 Mar 2009
2 CONT *'''     Anne Talbot is the daughter of Sir John Talbot.1 She married Thomas Needham, son of Sir Robert Needham.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Needham.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Anne Talbot and Thomas Needham
2 CONT ** 1.Robert Needham+1 d. 18 Dec 1603
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2159. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p34185.htm#i341841 ________________________
2 CONT *'''Anne TALBOT
2 CONT *'''Born: 1515, Grafton, Worcestershire, England
2 CONT *Father: John TALBOT (Sir)
2 CONT *Mother: Margaret TROUTBECK
2 CONT *'''Married: Thomas NEEDHAM of Shavington (Sir) (b. ABT 1510 - d. 1560) (son of Sir Robert Needham and Agnes Mainwaring) ABT 1534, Shavington, Shropshire, England
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Robert NEEDHAM (Sheriff of Shropshire)
2 CONT **2. Thomas NEEDHAM
2 CONT **3. John NEEDHAM
2 CONT **4. Margaret NEEDHAM
2 CONT **5. Margery NEEDHAM
2 CONT **6. Agnes NEEDHAM (b. 1546 - d. Jan 1623)  (m. Sir Richard Bulkeley)
2 CONT **7. Jane NEEDHAM
2 CONT **8. Anne NEEDHAM
2 CONT **9. Dorothy NEEDHAM
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/TALBOT.htm#Anne TALBOT2 ___________________
2 CONT *Sir Richard BULKELEY of Beaumaris and Anglesey, Knight
2 CONT *Born: ABT 1515, Baron Hill, Beaumaris, Anglesey, Wales
2 CONT *Died: 7 Sep 1572
2 CONT *Father: Richard BULKELEY of Beaumaris
2 CONT *Mother: Catherine GRIFFITH
2 CONT *Married 1: Margaret SAVAGE
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Richard BULKELEY of Beaumaris (See his Biography)
2 CONT **2. John BULKELEY
2 CONT **3. Thomas BULKELEY
2 CONT **4. Rowland BULKELEY
2 CONT **5. Charles BULKELEY
2 CONT **6. Jane BULKELEY
2 CONT **7. Daniel BULKELEY
2 CONT **8. Margaret BULKELEY
2 CONT *Married 2: Agnes NEEDHAM (b. 1546 - d. Jan 1623) (dau. of '''Thomas Needham of Cranage and Anne Talbot''')
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **9. Elizabeth BULKELEY
2 CONT **10. Mary BULKELEY
2 CONT **11. Arthur BULKELEY
2 CONT **12. Tristam BULKELEY
2 CONT **13. George BULKELEY
2 CONT **14. Edward BULKELEY
2 CONT **15. Lancelot BULKELEY of Dublin
2 CONT **16. Grissel BULKEKEY
2 CONT **17. Agnes BULKEKEY
2 CONT **18. Phoebe BULKEKEY
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/Bios/RichardBulkeley1.htm ____________________________
2 CONT *Sir Gilbert Talbot of Grafton, KG (1452 – 16 August 1517 or 19 September 1518) was an English Tudor knight, a younger son of John Talbot, 2nd Earl of Shrewsbury and 2nd Earl of Waterford, and Elizabeth Butler. .... etc.
2 CONT *He married firstly Elizabeth Greystoke, daughter of Ralph de Greystoke, 5th Baron Greystoke and 7th Baron Boteler of Wem, and had three children:
2 CONT ** Sir Humphrey Talbot, who died in the Holy Land
2 CONT ** Sir Gilbert Talbot of Grafton, Worcestershire (died 22 October 1542), married Anne Paston, daughter of Sir William Paston (died 1496) and Lady Anne Beaufort, daughter of Edmund Beaufort, 2nd Duke of Somerset and Eleanor Beaucha
2 CONC mp, and had three daughters:
2 CONT *** Elizabeth Talbot, who married Sir John Littelton, son of Sir William Littelton and his second wife, Mary Whittington, daughter of William Whittington, by whom he had seven sons and two daughters.[4]
2 CONT *** Margaret Talbot
2 CONT *** Mary Talbot, who married Thomas Astley, esq. of Patshull, and had two sons [5]
2 CONT **Eleanor Talbot, wife of Geoffrey Dudley, younger son of Edward Sutton, 2nd Baron Dudley and Cecily Willoughby, ancestors of the Dudleys of Russell's Hall
2 CONT *He married secondly Etheldreda, called Audrey, Cotton, daughter of William Landwade Cotton of Landwade, Cambridgeshire, and had one child:
2 CONT ** Sir John Talbot of Albrighton, Shropshire (1485 - 22 October 1542 or 10 September 1549), married firstly Margaret Troutbeck, daughter of Adam Troutbeck of Mobberley, Chester, and had three sons and five daughters; he married se
2 CONC condly Elizabeth Wrottesley (died 10 May 1558), daughter of Walter Wrottesley of Wrottesley Hall, Staffordshire (died 1563), and Elizabeth Harcourt and had four sons and four daughters:
2 CONT ** By the first marriage:
2 CONT *** Sir John Talbot of Grafton, Worcestershire, and of Albrighton, Shropshire (died 6 June 1555), married Frances Gifford or Giffard, daughter of Sir John Gifford or Giffard, and had one son:
2 CONT **** Sir John Talbot of Grafton, married Catherine or Katharine Petre, daughter of Sir William Petre, and had issue
2 CONT ***'''Anne Talbot (born 1515), married Thomas Needham (born 1510)
2 CONT *** Dorothy Talbot, married John Skyrmshire of Norbury, Cheshire (died 1569), and had issue
2 CONT **By the second marriage:
2 CONT *** Sir John Talbot of Salwarpe, Worcestershire (died 9 December 1581), married 13 September 1574 Olive Sherrington, daughter of Sir Henry Sherrington of Lacock, Wiltshire, and had four children:
2 CONT **** Sherrington Talbot of Salwarpe, Worcestershire (died c. 1642), married firstly Elizabeth Leighton, daughter of Sir Thomas Leighton of Feckenham, Worcestershire, Governor of Jersey and Governor of Guernsey, and Elizabeth Knoll
2 CONC ys (born 1549), and had two sons, and married secondly Mary Washbourne, daughter of John Washbourne of Wichinford, Worcestershire, and had two sons:
2 CONT ***** Sherrington Talbot or Sheringham Talbot (died c. 1677), married 13 October 1627 Jane Lyttelton, sister of Sir Thomas Lyttelton, 1st Baronet, and had one son:
2 CONT ****** Sir John Talbot of Laycock, Keighley, Yorkshire, married Barbara Slingsby, daughter of Sir Henry Slingsby, 1st Baronet, and had two daughters:
2 CONT ******* Anne Talbot
2 CONT ******* Barbara Talbot (c. 1671 - 31 January 1763), married 11 July 1689 Henry Yelverton, 1st Viscount de Longueville
2 CONT ***** Sir Gilbert Talbot, unmarried
2 CONT ***** William Talbot of Stourton Castle, Staffordshire (died 27 March 1686), married Mary Doughty (died c. 1661), daughter of Thomas Doughty of Kinver, Staffordshire, and of Whittington, Staffordshire, and had three children:
2 CONT ****** Frances Talbot
2 CONT ****** Catherine Talbot
2 CONT ****** Rt. Rev. William Talbot, Bishop of Durham
2 CONT ***** George Talbot of Rudge, Shropshire, married and had one daughter:
2 CONT ****** Catherine Talbot
2 CONT **** Thomas Talbot of Worvill, Shropshire, married Magdalen Wyvill, daughter of Sir Marmaduke Wyvill, and had one son:
2 CONT ***** Robert Talbot of Worvill, Shropshire, married Anne Sheldon, daughter of William Sheldon of Broadway, Worcestershire, and had three sons:
2 CONT ****** George Talbot
2 CONT ****** Thomas Talbot of Worvill, Shropshire
2 CONT ****** Gilbert Talbot
2 CONT **** John Talbot of Badgworth, Somerset (born between 1575–1581), married Mary Trimnel, daughter of Thomas Trimnel of Okeley, Worcestershire, and had one son:
2 CONT ***** John Talbot of Okeley, Worcestershire (born aft. 1591)
2 CONT *From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gilbert_Talbot_(soldier) ____________________
2 CONT *'''The Visitation of Shropshire; v.29 (1889) Part II.
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n94/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg.371
2 CONT **	Needham of Shavington. Pg.371-372
2 CONT *John Needham of Needham co. Derb. 4 E. 3. = ; ch: Tho. Needham
2 CONT **	Tho. Needham of Needham in com. Derb. = ; ch: Will'm (m. Alice Cranage), Thomas Needham.
2 CONT ***		Thomas Needham of Needham 47 E. 3. = ; descendants Vide Derby.
2 CONT ***		Will'm Needham 49 E. 3. = Alice da. & heir to . . . .  Cranage of Cranage in Chester. ; ch: Rob't Needham
2 CONT ****			Rob't Needham of Cranage ob. 8 H. 4. = ch: Robert (m. Dorothy Savage) Needham.
2 CONT *****				Robert Needham ob. 27 H. 6. = Dorothy da. to Sr Jo. Savage Kt of ye Garter. ; ch: Hugh, William, Sr John (m. Margery Mannering), Agnes (m. John Starkey), Robert, Thomas (m. Mawde Brereton) Needham.
2 CONT ******					Sr John Needham Justice of the King's Bench & Chester 2 sonn of Robert ob. 1480 [Judge of Common Pleas 1457; Judge of King's Bench 1472]. = Margery da. to Randall Mannering widow to Will'm Bromley of Cheverton [Shraward
2 CONC ine ?].
2 CONT ******					Thomas Needha' of Shenton in co. Salop. = Mawde da. to Sr Wm Brereton of Brereton Kt. ; ch: Sr Wm (m. Isabell Bromley) Needham.
2 CONT *******						Sr Wm Needham Knight. = Isabell da. & cohae. to Sr John Bromley Kt. (Sr John Bromley Knight maried Jane dau. & heire to Wm Hartall Hexstall.) ; ch: (Pg.372 Margrett (m. Tho. Whittington), Sr Robt (m. Agnes Manwaring) 
2 CONC Needham)
2 CONT ********https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n95/mode/1up
2 CONT ********Pg.372
2 CONT ********							Margrett vx. Tho. Whittington of Pountley who had 6 da.s
2 CONT ********							Sr Robt Needham of Shenton Kt ob. 20 H. 7 [bought Shavington 1506; Sheriff 1529]. = Agnes da. to John or Jenkin Manwaring of Pever in [com.] Chest'r. ; ch: Maude (m. Tho. Venables), Jane Anne (m. Sr Andrew Corbett),
2 CONC  Tho. (m. Agnes Hope & Ann Talbott), John, Robert Needham.
2 CONT *********'''								Tho. Needham of Shenton ob. in vita patris.''' = Agnes da. to . . . .  Hope. ; ch: Agnes Needham; '''= Ann da. to Sr John Talbott of Grafton Kt. ; ch:''' Robert (m. Francis Aston), John, Margrett (m. Richard St
2 CONC eventon), Margery Mary (m. Geo. Conney) Agnes (m. Sr Richard Bulkley & . . . .  Cranage), Joane, Anne Needham.
2 CONT **********									Robert Needha' of Shenton [Sheriff 1565]. = Francis da. to Sr Edward Aston of Tixall Kt. ; ch: Elizab., Mawde (m. Jo. Aston), Margery Mary (m. Thomas Onslow & Sr Rob't Vernon), Ann (m. Rob't Powell), Jane (m. Ja
2 CONC mes Collyer), Thomas (m. Mary (wid. of Sr Robert Salisbury) Bagenhall), Sr Rob't (m. Ann Doyley & Joane Lacye) Needham.
2 CONT ***********										Sr Rob't Needham of Shenton Kt Viscount Kilmory in Ireland 1624 [Sheriff 1607]. = Ann da. to . . . .  Doyley widow to . . . .  Willmott. ; = Joane da. to John Lacye of Borseton in com Som'sett. ; ch: Francess 
2 CONC (m. Sr Rowland Cotton), Robert (m. Francess Andersonne & Elianor (wid. to Gilbert [Lord] Gerrard) Dutton), Elianor (m. Sr Wm Owen) Needham.
2 CONT ************										Robert Needham. = Francess da. to Sr Henry Andersonne of London Kt. ; ch: Robert, Frances (m. Tho. Cotton), Elianor Needham; = Lady Elianor da. & heire to Jo. Dutton wid. to Gilbert Lo. [Lord] Gerard. ; ch: C
2 CONC harles (2 sonn.) Needham _________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 707.
2 CONT
