2 CONT * [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 159.
2 CONT * [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 207.
2 CONT * http://www.members.shaw.ca/jmream/needham.html
2 CONT * http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1558-1603/member/bulkeley-sir-richard-1524-72
