2 CONT Hillary Wyllenhall (c. 1455 - 1503) was born in Willenhall, Staffordshire, England to Sir John Hillary-Hillaria Wyllenhall and Alice Masters. She married Richard Leveson in England in 1500 and they had at least seven sons and four
2 CONC  daughters. 
