2 CONC =119779694&pid=2407
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane Byar was the 2nd wife of William Newby after the death of his first wife Isabel Turner
2 CONT
2 CONT They were married in 1701
2 CONT
