2 CONT Timothy Cleare was a North Carolina colonist.Timothy was a Friend (Quaker)Quaker records & court records, say he d. in November 1724, the tenth being the apparent date on his will & the date in Perquimans MM records. Perquimans Co
2 CONC unty was then a precinct of Albemarle Co., NC. He is believed to have had three wives: Mary, Elizabeth, and Hannah. Winslow gives Elizabeth as the second wife by whom he had no children and states that her maiden name is unknown.
2 CONT # He married Mary Bundy after 4 Jun 1685. Mary passed away in 1694. 
2 CONT # He then married an Elizabeth _____________, the widow of ________ Perry, whose date of death is not recorded but would be by 1702. 
2 CONT # He married third Hannah (Lawrence) Snelling 1 Mar 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT His death is recorded 10 Nov 1724 at Perquimans, North Carolina.
