1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Katherine Griffin
2 CONT *b. 16 MAR 1664/65  Northumberland, Virginia 
2 CONT * D: 24 SEP 1728  Richmond, Henrico County, Virginia
2 CONT * Daughter of Col. Samuel Griffin of Northumberland County 
2 CONT *Married 1) William Fauntleroy 2) David Ridley 3) David Gwyn
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~marshall/esmd48.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Col. William4 Fauntleroy (Moore3, John2, William1) was born in 1650 at Rappahannock Co., VA. He married Katherine Griffin, daughter of '''Col. Samuel Griffin and Sarah''', by 14 Dec 1678; 1st husband. He died before 14 Sep 1686.
2 CONT
2 CONT He resided at 'Naylor's Hole', Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Griffin was born on 16 Mar 1664/65. She married David Gwyn circa 1690; 2nd husband. She married David Ridley before 6 Feb 1694; 3rd husband. She died on 24 Sep 1728 at Richmond Co., VA, at age 63. She left a will on 20 S
2 CONC ep 1728; proved 6 Nov 1728.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known children of Col. William4 Fauntleroy and Katherine Griffin were as follows:
2 CONT *   5.  i.   Moore5 Fauntleroy, born 9 Jan 1679; married Margaret Micou.
2 CONT *      ii.   Griffin Fauntleroy was born on 13 Apr 1681 at Northumberland Co., VA. He married Ann Bushrod, daughter of Thomas Bushrod and Ann. He married Elizabeth Taylor. He died in 1715.
2 CONT *    6.  iii.   Col. William Fauntleroy, born 31 Mar 1684 at 'Naylor's Hole', Richmond Co., VA; married Apphia Bushrod.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://homepages.rootsweb.com/~marshall/esmd176.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Katherine Griffin (Samuel1); b. 16 Mar 1664; m. Col. William Fauntleroy, son of Col. Moore Fauntleroy and Mary Hill, 14 Dec 1678; 1st husband; m. Maj. David Gwynn; 2nd husband; m. David Ridley before 6 Feb 1694; 3rd husband; d
2 CONC . 24 Sep 1728 at Richmond Co., VA, at age 64.
2 CONT
2 CONT Col. William Fauntleroy was born in 1650 at Rappahannock Co., VA. He resided at 'Naylor's Hole', Lancaster Co., VA. He died before 14 Sep 1686.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maj. David Gwynn resided at Richmond Co., VA. He left a will; proved 22 Feb 1702/3. He died in 1703.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT #Elizabeth Gwynn
2 CONT #Sarah Smith (born Gwynn)
2 CONT #Katherine Brockenbrough (born Gwyn)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation Five
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Moore5 Fauntleroy (William4, Moore3, John2, William1) was born on 9 Jan 1679. He married Margaret Micou, daughter of Paul Micou, in 1696. He died in 1739 at Richmond, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known children of Moore5 Fauntleroy and Margaret Micou include:
2 CONT
2 CONT *      i.   Judith6 Fauntleroy married Landon Carter Jr., son of Col. Landon Carter and Elizabeth Wormeley. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She resided at Richmond Co., VA.
2 CONT
