1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/MT5B-D3Y/bethiah-thurston-1672-1744
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethiah Thurston
2 CONT Female
2 CONT 30 April 1672–2 March 1744
2 CONT •
2 CONT MT5B-D3Y
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Bethiah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Bethiah Thurston was born on 30 April 1672, in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, John Thurston, was 37 and her mother, Mary Wood, was 29. She married Captain Seth Chapin on 25 
2 CONC March 1691, in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 6 daughters. She died on 2 March 1744, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Coloni
2 CONC al America, at the age of 71, and was buried in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
2 CONT
