1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Deacon Thomas Bass' brother, John Bass, married Ruth Alden, daughter of John and Priscilla Mullins Alden.  Thomas married, first, on October 4,1660, Sarah Wood.  He married, second, on November 30,1680, at Braintre
2 CONC e, Massachusetts, Susanna (Bates) Blanchard, widow of Nathaniel Blanchard.  His children by his first marraige were:  Abigail Bass, Samuel Bass, Mary Bass, John Bass and Mehitable Bass. 
