2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Wood, daughter of Eleazer and Dorithy Wood was born November 25, 1692 in Sherborn, Massachusetts.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Williams and Abigail Wood were married February 4, 1719-20 in Sherborn, Middlesex Co., Massachusetts.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliezer Wood Williams, son of Samuell and Abigail was born January 5, 1720-21 in Sherborn and Dorrity Williams, d. of Samuell and Abigail was born July 8, 1722 in Sherborn.[3] Additional children named in her husband Samuel's will
2 CONC  are: son Samuel Williams, son Seth Williams, son Noah Williams with grandson Noah Williams, daughter Hannah Hall, daughter Abigail King, daughter Prudence White, daughter Ann Snell, daughter Katherine Earll, and a granddaughter B
2 CONC ethiah Williams.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
