2 CONT "Samuel Whiting BIRTH	20 Dec 1649 Dedham, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA DEATH	4 Dec 1727 (aged 77) Dedham, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	 Old Village Cemetery Dedham, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA PLOT	xii, 2
2 CONC  MEMORIAL ID	21096885  Parents: Nathaniell & Hana Whiteing Marriage: Samuell Whiting and Sarah Metcalf married 23d 9th 1676 (Dedham) Family Members: Parents: Nathaniel Whiting 1609–1683, Hannah Dwight Whiting 1625–1714.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings	 Timothy Whiting 1654–1728,	 Abigail Whiting Draper 1663–1721, John Whiting 1665–1732,	 Jonathan Whiting 1667–1728,	 Ann Whiting Herring 1673–1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: HERE LYES ye BODY OF MR. SAMUEL WHITING AGED [78 YEARS, DIED decR. ye 4th 1727] Gravesite Details bottom portion of stone is no longer visible"
