2 CONC calf." Samuel5 Fisher: b. Medfield, Sept. 29, 1685, d. Wrentham, Jan. 19, 1769, was the son of John4 Fisher, 1661-1755, and his wife Marys Metcalf (Thomas1), bpt. Dedham, Nov. 25, 1660, d. Medfield, Dec. 16, 1727, m. Medfield, Jun
2 CONC e 8, 1683. Mary2 Metcalf was the sister of Samuel2 Metcalf, b. Dedham, Sept. 17, 1668, d. in Canada."). . link
