2 CONC Mary Metcalf, b. Medfield 29 Sep 1685, d. Wrentham 19 Jan 1769, m. 16 Dec 1707 Mary Rockwood. Will dated 17 Jun 1761, probated 24 Feb 1769, son John executor, his father's widow, four daughters, son Samuel, son Nathan.")
2 CONT * 4. Don Hill Gleason, A memorial volume. The record of baptisms, marriages and deaths, and admissions to the church and dismissals therefrom, transcribed from the church records in the town of Dedham, Massachusetts. 1638-1845 Als
2 CONC o all the epitaphs in the ancient burial place in Dedham, together with the other inscriptions before 1845 in the three parish cemeteries (Dedham, Mass.: Dedham Transcript Press, 1886) Vol. 2 (Also referred to as Volume to of the 
