2 CONT She had one child with John born at Medfield:
2 CONT #Rebecca Fisher Born 9 Oct 1713.  Married  John Baxter.  (Son of Joseph Baxter and Mary Fiske).
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Fisher-13815
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT John Fisher was born to John and Mary (Metcalf) Fisher Sept 9, 1687 at Medfield, Massachusetts. He died at Medfield Feb 2, 1713.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Rebecca Wheelock, daughter of Eleazar and Mary (Chenery) Wheelock of Medfield.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Rebecca had one known child:[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Fisher, b Oct 9, 1713; d July 30, 1796; m John Baxter of Medfield Oct 12, 1732.
2 CONT After John Fisher's death, 
2 CONT Rebecca married 2nd Jeremiah Adams of Medfield, in 1715.[1][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Fisher (1687 - 1713)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===John Fisher===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 9 Sep 1687 in Medfield, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Fisher and Mary (Metcalf) Fisher
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Samuel Fisher, Mary (Fisher) Turner, Judith (Fisher) Turner and Hannah (Fisher) Morse
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Rebecca (Wheelock) Adams — married about 1712 in Medfield, Massachusetts [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Rebekah (Fisher) Baxter
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 2 Feb 1713 at age 25 in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 4 Nov 2022 | Created 6 Nov 2017
2 CONT
2 CONT
