2 CONT Samuel Tingley III
2 CONT Male
2 CONT 6 October 1689–24 June 1765
2 CONT •
2 CONT MCH2-CNM
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Samuel
2 CONT When Samuel Tingley III was born on 6 October 1689, in Rehoboth, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Samuel Tingley II, was 23 and his mother, Martha, was 21. He married Hannah Pidge on 15 December 1713, in Attlebor
2 CONC o, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 24 June 1765, in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 75, and was buri
2 CONC ed in Newell Burying Ground, Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
