1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth 1730Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States Posted by patruiz61 Comment
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1759Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States Posted by patruiz61 Comment
2 CONT
2 CONT Death 1817Sackville, Westmorland, New Brunswick, Canada Posted by patruiz61 Report abuse Comment
2 CONT
2 CONT Residence Canada
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Notes: Resource of Tingley Genealogy at: http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~tingley/ Which describes the descendancy of the Tingley's in America from the earliest progenitor of the name, Palmer Tingley, who came from Kingsto
2 CONC n-on-Thames, England , (born 1614) and came to Ipswich, Massachusetts, from London on 8-Apr-1635. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Of Sackville, N.S., now N.B., born Dec. 31, 1730 at Attleboro, MA. died June 17, 1817 at Sackville, NB, Canad marriage published Oct. 6, 1759, married Nov. 22, 1759, Jemima, daughter of Benjamin and Jemima (Briggs) Crabtree, of At
2 CONC tleboro, MA12, bo rn Aug. 7, 1737 at Attleboro, MA. died Apr. 9, 1807 at Sackville, N.B. Josiah served in the French War and went to Nov Scotia in 1763, to accept a land grant. He apparently was a loyal soldier of the Crown in the
2 CONC  Revolution and helped repel the Re bels from Nova Scotia. He was a farmer in that section now called Middle Sackville, N.B. Josiah and Jemima are buried side by side in the Four Corners Cem. at Upper Sackville, N.B.
2 CONT
2 CONT Got the following list of children from rootsweb.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  i. 	Josiah TINGLEY
2 CONT
2 CONT ii	Levinia TINGLEY was born 20 Oct 1762 in Attleboro, Bristol Co., MA, USA. Levinia married Ichabod THROOP.
2 CONT
2 CONT  iii	Daniel TINGLEY was born 30 Nov 1764 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada. Daniel married Abigail OULTON.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv	Jemima TINGLEY was born 4 May 1767 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada. Jemima married John FILLMORE on 1785 in , , New Brunswick, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT v	William TINGLEY was born 9 Jan 1869 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada. William married (1) Elizabeth HORTON. (2) Charlotte KING on 24 May 1832.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi	Mary TINGLEY was born 6 May 1771 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii	Mary TINGLEY was born 25 Jul 1773 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii	Agreen TINGLEY was born 3 Dec 1776 in Middle Sackville, Westmorland Co., New Brunswick, Canada. Agreen married Elizabeth SEAMAN on 18 Dec 1800.
