2 CONT Noah Fuller Sr. was born on 12 Feb 1683 in Rehoboth, Bristol, Massachusetts to parents Jonathan Fuller and Elizabeth Wilmarth.[1] He married Rachel Pidge on 21 Feb 1711 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts. Children: Noah, Stephen
2 CONC . He died on 12 Jan 1715 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
