2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Tabitha was born in 1670. She is the daughter of Mathew Edwards and Mary Poole. Reading:[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Tabitha and Daniel Pond were married about 1690[2]. No record of that marriage yet found in Vital Records of Reading nor Dedham, however.
2 CONT
2 CONT Susanah, d. of Daniel and Tabitha Pond, was borne April 23, 1690', [3] She seems to have been their only child.
2 CONT Daniel Pond died, sometime before his father's death in February 1997-8.
2 CONT Tabitha then seems to have married Benjamin Bullard, between 1998 and 1702.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Tabitha and Benjamin Bullard had children in Sherborn: [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin (b. Mar 4, 1702-3),
2 CONT Jonathan (b. Oct 24, 1706),
2 CONT Seth (b. Feb 17, 1708-9),
2 CONT
2 CONT and reportedly another son, name unknown,  and perhaps a daughter or two, no birth record yet found.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Edwards-15426
2 CONT
