2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Benjamin Bullard, Jonathan Bullard, Seth Bullard and Mary (Bullard) Haven
2 CONT
2 CONT Died about 1772 in Holliston, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay [uncertain]
