1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William and Abigail had nine children:
2 CONT 1) Abigail - born June 13, 1686 Newbury, married Samuel Bartlett of Newbury
2 CONT 2) Batt - born July 4, 1688, married 1st Hannah Sibly/Sible of Salem December 4, 1712 Newbury, 2nd Jemina George of Amesbury May 29,      1730, he died 1750
2 CONT 3) William - born 1690, 1st married Sarah____,2nd Ruth Emery April 24, 1716 Newbury, he died 1762
2 CONT 4) Jonathan - born September 7, 1692, married Rebecca Chase December 5, 1716, he died January 26, 1717
2 CONT 5) Joseph - born November 25, 1694 Newbury, married Mary Noyes July 25, 1717
2 CONT 6) Stephen - born February 14, 1697/8, married Rebecca Chase December 14, 1721, moved to Rehoboth, MA
2 CONT 7) Margaret - born February 21, 1698/9, she died September 25, 1701
2 CONT 8) Sarah - born July 4, 1701, married Ezekiel Moulton of Hampton July 4, 1727, she died August 7, 1783
2 CONT 9) Mary - born August 2, 1705, married  _______ Morse
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
