2 CONT 1 John Warner
2 CONT
2 CONT b. ca. 1671, Farmington, CT; d. ca. 1740, Suffield, CT; son of Daniel Warner & Sarah Roe; m. 1692/93, prob. Suffield, CT, Elizabeth Mighel; dau. of John Mighill & Sarah Batt; b. say 1666.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * 2‑1 John Warner, b. 1 May 1694, Suffield, CT; m. (1) Elizabeth Trumble; m. (2) Elizabeth French.
2 CONT * 3‑2 Sarah Warner, b. 7 Sep 1696, Suffield, CT; m. Joseph Grimes.
2 CONT * 4‑3 Eleanor Warner, b. 15 Apr 1698, Suffield, CT; m. Thomas Hoskins.
2 CONT * 5‑4 Daniel Warner, b. 23 Jul 1700, Suffield, CT; m. Elizabeth Adams.
2 CONT * 5 Samuel Warner, b. 3 Feb 1702/03, Suffield, CT; d. 28 Oct 1704, Suffield, CT.
2 CONT * 6‑6 Elizabeth Warner, b. 27 May 1705, Suffield, CT; m. Samuel Taylor.
2 CONT * 7‑7 Samuel Warner, b. 19 Aug 1707, Suffield, CT; m. Mehitable Sheldon.
2 CONT
