2 CONT *'''     Thomas Needham was born circa 1405 at of Shavington, Shropshire, England. He married Maud Brereton''', daughter of Sir William Brereton and Philippa Hulse, '''circa 1448.
2 CONT *'''Family     Maud Brereton''' b. c 1430
2 CONT *'''Child	
2 CONT **Sir William Needham+ b. c 1450
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2324.htm#i69854 
2 CONT ____________________________
2 CONT *'''Thomas Needham1
2 CONT *M, #341815
2 CONT *Last Edited=12 Mar 2009
2 CONT *'''     Thomas Needham is the son''' of Robert Needham and Dorothy Savage.2 '''He married Maud Brereton''', daughter of Sir William Brereton.2
2 CONT *'''     He lived at Granage, Cheshire, England.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Thomas Needham and Maud Brereton
2 CONT **Sir William Needham+1
2 CONT **Robert Needham2
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2159. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p34182.htm#i341815 
2 CONT ________________
2 CONT *Dorothy SAVAGE
2 CONT *Born: ABT 1366 / 1385
2 CONT *Father: John SAVAGE
2 CONT *Mother: Margaret DANYERS
2 CONT *Married: Robert NEEDHAM of Cranage (son of William Needham and Alice Cranage)
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **'''1. Thomas NEEDHAM (b. ABT 1398) (m. Maud Brereton)
2 CONT **2. Alice NEEDHAM (m. Robert Cholmley)
2 CONT **3. Hugh NEEDHAM
2 CONT **4. William NEEDHAM
2 CONT **5. Agnes NEEDHAM (m. John Starkey)
2 CONT **6. Robert NEEDHAM (d. 1448) (m. Dorothy ?)
2 CONT **7. John NEEDHAM (d. 1480) (m. Margery Mannering)
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/SAVAGE.htm#Dorothy SAVAGE1 
2 CONT ___________________
2 CONT Dorothy SAVAGE
2 CONT Born: ABT 1366 / 1385
2 CONT Father: John SAVAGE
2 CONT Mother: Margaret DANYERS
2 CONT Married: Robert NEEDHAM of Cranage (son of William Needham and Alice Cranage)
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT 1. '''Thomas NEEDHAM (b. ABT 1398) (m. Maud Brereton)'''
2 CONT 2. Alice NEEDHAM (m. Robert Cholmley)
2 CONT 3. Hugh NEEDHAM
2 CONT 4. William NEEDHAM
2 CONT 5. Agnes NEEDHAM (m. John Starkey)
2 CONT 6. Robert NEEDHAM (d. 1448) (m. Dorothy ?)
2 CONT 7. John NEEDHAM (d. 1480) (m. Margery Mannering)
2 CONT From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/SAVAGE.htm#Dorothy%20SAVAGE1
2 CONT _____
2 CONT '''Maud BRERETON'''
2 CONT Born: 1402
2 CONT Died: 1438
2 CONT Father: William BRERETON (Sir)
2 CONT Mother: Alice CORBETT
2 CONT '''Married: Thomas NEEDHAM (son of Robert Needham and Dorothy Savage)'''
2 CONT '''Children''':
2 CONT 1. William NEEDHAM (Sir) (b. 1438 - d. 1498) (m. Isabel Bromley)
2 CONT From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/BRERETON1.htm#Maud_BRERETON2
2 CONT _______
2 CONT *'''The Visitation of Shropshire; v.29 (1889) Part II.
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n94/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg.371
2 CONT **Needham of Shavington. Pg.371-372
2 CONT *John Needham of Needham co. Derb. 4 E. 3. = ; ch: Tho. Needham
2 CONT **Tho. Needham of Needham in com. Derb. = ; ch: Will'm (m. Alice Cranage), Thomas Needham.
2 CONT ***Thomas Needham of Needham 47 E. 3. = ; descendants Vide Derby.
2 CONT ***Will'm Needham 49 E. 3. = Alice da. & heir to . . . . Cranage of Cranage in Chester. ; ch: Rob't Needham
2 CONT ****Rob't Needham of Cranage ob. 8 H. 4. = ch: Robert (m. Dorothy Savage) Needham.
2 CONT *****Robert Needham ob. 27 H. 6. = Dorothy da. to Sr Jo. Savage Kt of ye Garter. ; ch: Hugh, William, Sr John (m. Margery Mannering), Agnes (m. John Starkey), Robert, '''Thomas (m. Mawde Brereton)''' Needham.
2 CONT ******Sr John Needham Justice of the King's Bench & Chester 2 sonn of Robert ob. 1480 [Judge of Common Pleas 1457; Judge of King's Bench 1472]. = Margery da. to Randall Mannering widow to Will'm Bromley of Cheverton [Shrawardine ?
2 CONC ].
2 CONT ******'''Thomas Needha' of Shenton in co. Salop. = Mawde da. to Sr Wm Brereton of Brereton Kt. ; ch:''' Sr Wm (m. Isabell Bromley) Needham.
2 CONT *******Sr Wm Needham Knight. = Isabell da. & cohae. to Sr John Bromley Kt. (Sr John Bromley Knight maried Jane dau. & heire to Wm Hartall Hexstall.) ; ch: (Pg.372 Margrett (m. Tho. Whittington), Sr Robt (m. Agnes Manwaring) Needha
2 CONC m)
2 CONT ********https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n95/mode/1up
2 CONT ********Pg.372
2 CONT ********Margrett vx. Tho. Whittington of Pountley who had 6 da.s
2 CONT ********Sr Robt Needham of Shenton Kt ob. 20 H. 7 [bought Shavington 1506; Sheriff 1529]. = Agnes da. to John or Jenkin Manwaring of Pever in [com.] Chest'r. ; ch: Maude (m. Tho. Venables), Jane Anne (m. Sr Andrew Corbett), Tho. (
2 CONC m. Agnes Hope & Ann Talbott), John, Robert Needham.
2 CONT *********Tho. Needham of Shenton ob. in vita patris. = Agnes da. to . . . . Hope. ; ch: Agnes Needham; = Ann da. to Sr John Talbott of Grafton Kt. ; ch: Robert (m. Francis Aston), John, Margrett (m. Richard Steventon), Margery Mar
2 CONC y (m. Geo. Conney) Agnes (m. Sr Richard Bulkley & . . . . Cranage), Joane, Anne Needham.
2 CONT **********Robert Needha' of Shenton [Sheriff 1565]. = Francis da. to Sr Edward Aston of Tixall Kt. ; ch: Elizab., Mawde (m. Jo. Aston), Margery Mary (m. Thomas Onslow & Sr Rob't Vernon), Ann (m. Rob't Powell), Jane (m. James Colly
2 CONC er), Thomas (m. Mary (wid. of Sr Robert Salisbury) Bagenhall), Sr Rob't (m. Ann Doyley & Joane Lacye) Needham.
2 CONT ***********Sr Rob't Needham of Shenton Kt Viscount Kilmory in Ireland 1624 [Sheriff 1607]. = Ann da. to . . . . Doyley widow to . . . . Willmott. ; = Joane da. to John Lacye of Borseton in com Som'sett. ; ch: Francess (m. Sr Rowla
2 CONC nd Cotton), Robert (m. Francess Andersonne & Elianor (wid. to Gilbert [Lord] Gerrard) Dutton), Elianor (m. Sr Wm Owen) Needham.
2 CONT ************Robert Needham. = Francess da. to Sr Henry Andersonne of London Kt. ; ch: Robert, Frances (m. Tho. Cotton), Elianor Needham; = Lady Elianor da. & heire to Jo. Dutton wid. to Gilbert Lo. [Lord] Gerard. ; ch: Charles (2 
2 CONC sonn.) Needham 
2 CONT _________________________
2 CONT 'Needham2'
2 CONT Families covered: Needham of Cranach (Cranage, Cravach or Crevach), Needham of Kilmorey, Needham of Shavington, Needham of Shenton
2 CONT [This page was initially named Needham1. It was renamed following a review in which earlier generations and a senior line of the family were found.]
2 CONT William de Nedeham of Chester (a 1375, judge)
2 CONT m. Alice de Cranach (dau/heir of William de Cranach or Cranage)
2 CONT *1.	Robert Nedeham of Cranach (d 1407) this generation reported by Visitation but not mentioned by either BP1934 or Lodge
2 CONT ** 	A.	Robert Nedeham of Cranach or Cranage 'of Sherington' (Shavington) (d 1448-9)
2 CONT ** 	Lodge identifies Robert's wife Dorothy as a dau of Sir John Savage of Clifton by Catharine, dau of Thomas Stanley. The Savage records suggest that she was 3 generations earlier, which is supported by the dates.
