2 CONT *** 	'''Lodge identifies Thomas's wife Maud as a dau of Sir William Brereton of Brereton by Maud, dau of John Dutton of Dutton & widow of Sir William Booth of Dunham. We do not see such a wife for a Sir William Brereton.'''
