2 CONT ***     i. Thomas Bodenham of Rotherwas (b 1544, dsp 1583)
2 CONT ***     ii. Sir Rogert Bodenham of Rotherwas (b 1545) m. (1682) Bridget Baskerville (dau of Sir Humphrey Baskerville of Erdisley Castle)
