2 CONT '''Jane Whittington'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	25 Mar 2020
2 CONT F, #191885, '''b. circa 1500'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Thomas (John) Whittington1 b. c 1465, d. 1 Jun 1525
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Elizabeth Croft1 b. c 1469, d. 29 Mar 1527
2 CONT '''     Jane Whittington was born circa 1500 at of Hengastel, Monmouthshire, Wales.1 She married Sir Roger Bodenham''', son of Sir Thomas Bodenham and Jane Hungerford, '''circa 1534 at of Pauntley, Gloucestershire, England.'''1
