2 CONT
2 CONT When Robert de Legh V, Esq of Adlington was born on 24 March 1409, in Adlington, Cheshire, England. He married Isabel Legh of Hooton de Stanley in 1424, in Cheshire, England. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 7 daughter
2 CONC s. He died on 21 January 1479, in his hometown, at the age of 69, and was buried in Prestbury, Cheshire, England.
2 CONT
