1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6. Sir Laurence Warren, knight, known to be living in 1459 but died before his father (1474). + Isabel daughter of Sir Robert Legh of Adlington, knight, married before 1459. She later married Sir George Holford of 
2 CONC Holford, knight, in 1475. This couple had two sons, John and William.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Isabel Leigh1,2 
2 CONT *'''F, b. 1440
2 CONT *Father     Robert Legh, Esq.2 b. 3 May 1410, d. 29 Jan 1479
2 CONT *Mother     Isabella Stanley
2 CONT *'''     Isabel Leigh died at Leigh, Cheshire, England. She married Sir Laurence Warren, son of John Warren, Esq. and Isabel Stanley. Isabel Leigh was born in 1440 at Adleynton (Adlington), Cheshire, England. She married Sir Georg
2 CONC e Holford, Sheriff of Cheshire, son of Sir Thomas Holford and Maud Bulkeley, in 1475.2
2 CONT *'''Family 1      Sir George Holford, Sheriff of Cheshire b. c 1456, d. a 1524
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **George Holford d. a 1507
2 CONT **Constance Holford
2 CONT **Sir John Holford, Sheriff of Flintshire, Justice of the Peace for Cheshire+3,2 b. 1482, d. c 1546
2 CONT *'''Family 2       Sir Laurens Warren b. c 1425, d. b 1475
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **John Warren+ b. c 1455, d. 9 Jan 1518
2 CONT **William Warren+ b. c 1460, d. 1 May 1496
2 CONT **Richard Warren+ b. c 1465
