2 CONT ***'''   9. Sir George Halford of Halford, knight m. Isabel (8) 9th Lineage, widow of Lawrence Warren of Pointon in Cheshire, and dau. of Robert Legh of Adlington. He was sheriff of Cheshire 1524. He bore the Lostock coat of arms 
2 CONC in his seal, "to wit a grey hound, over which, corner-ways on the dexter angle of the escutcheon, on a helmet, wreath, and mantle, a greyhound's head couped." Written about the seal, "S. Georgil Holford Mililtis." He had children 
2 CONC 2 sons and a daughter leitimate and 4 sons and a dau. illegitimate.
