2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Legh-71
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen was daughter of Robert de Legh of Adlington, Cheshire, and his wife, Mabel / Isabel, daughter of Sir William de Stanley.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen married John Pygot of Chetwynd, Shropshire, who was born in 1434.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen and John had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Robert Pigott of Chetwynd, sheriff of Shropshire in 1517, married Margaret, daughter of Sir John Blount of Kinlet;[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
2 CONT
