2 CONC ad two sons and six daughters: Sir Robert Thomas Jane, wife of James Collier and Mr Radcliffe Anne, wife of Robert Powell Mary, wife of Thomas Onslow and Sir Robert Vernon Maud, wife of John Aston Elizabeth Dorothy, wife of Richar
