2 CONT * 14. Vis. Salop, 133; A.E. Corbet, Fam. of Corbet, 214-19, 226; C142/303/141; 142/554/66; Salop RO, 322/5/3/7-9, 11.
2 CONT * 15. C219/35/2/37; 219/37/195; CJ, i. 693a, 695a, 775a; Salop RO, 322/12/1; C. Russell, PEP, 158-62; T. Cogswell, Blessed Revolution, 170-4.
2 CONT * 16. Procs. 1625, pp. 206, 422; C219/40/224.
