1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Sherburne who is recorded as living at Little Mitton Hall in 1651 with his wife Katherine, the daughter of Richard Lathom of Parbold in Lancashire. Their eldest son, Thomas Sherburne inherited the Manor, but
2 CONC  died without issue a few years later on 15 August, 1664, passing the estate to his younger brother, Richard, who died a year later, also without issue, in 1665, shortly after selling the Manor of Little Mitton to Alexander Holt (
2 CONC see below.) 
2 CONT
