2 CONT
2 CONT *    2b. Thomas Booth (b. 1661; dvp. 24 Aug 1687)
2 CONT
2 CONT *    3b. Nathaniel Booth, Treasurer of Gray's Inn (b. 1662; dsp. 9 Oct 1745), mar. Jane Dixon, dau. and      cohrss. of Henry Dixon, of Hilden Park, co. Kent
