2 CONC chmarsh, co. Northampton, by his wife Sidney Montagu, sister of Edward [Montagu], 1st Earl of Sandwich, and only dau. by his first wife of Sir Sidney Montagu, of Hinchingbrooke, co. Huntingdon, and had issue:
