1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT '''Margeria Venables''' was born in 1639 in England, United Kingdom. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757655062 Johannis (John) Shaw] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757655157 Anne Shaw]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margeria married [https://www.geni.com/profile-1167123 Thomas Venables] on January 6, 1661, in Sandbach, Cheshire East, England, United Kingdom. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-6589204 Abraham Venable]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737841724 John Venables]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 8, 1700 in maybe, Sandbach, Cheshire East, England, United Kingdom. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * https://www.ancestry.com/genealogy/records/margeria-shaw_9206309
2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~jacgray/ps07/ps07_469.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1643 in Cheshire, England (unattested).
2 CONT
