2 CONT line Emily, born Feb. 15, 1807. Sarah Ann, born in Salem,
2 CONT
2 CONT March 24, 1810. George Frederick, born . Jeremiah
2 CONT
2 CONT Peabody died in Boston, Aug. 5, 1839. Catharine (Kimball) Peabody died .
