2 CONT the State of Massachusetts, II, 1910; Charles Henry Pope, Pioneers of Massachusetts, 1900; Peabody Genealogy,
2 CONT 1867; Peabody Genealogy, 1909; Walter Muir Whitehill, Captain Joseph Peabody, 1962; John William Linzee, History of
2 CONT Peter Parker and Sarah Ruggles, 1913; Melvin Gilbert Dodge, Ballard Genealogy, 1942; Doris Palmer Buys, Walter
2 CONT Palmer of Charlestown and Rehoboth, Massachusetts, and Stonington, Connecticut, 1986; Family History Library; H.
2 CONT Franklin Andrews, History of the Andrews Family, 1890; Nora E. Snow and Myrtle M. Jillson, Snow Estes Ancestry I,
2 CONT 1939; Juliet Porter, Porter Pedigree, 1907; Clarence Winthrop Bowen, History of Woodstock, Connecticut VII, 1943;
