1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William BRADBURY [Parents] 1, 2 was born 1476 in Littlebury, Essex, England. He died Jun 1546 in Littlebury, Essex, England and was buried 15 Jun 1546 in Littlebury, Essex, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Robert Bradbury (d 1489) & Anne Wyant
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE: Wife / mother recording problem.  See details below.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT William married Joan on 1501 in Littlebury, Essex, England. Joan 1, 2 was born 1481 in Littlebury, Essex, England. She married William BRADBURY on 1501 in Littlebury, Essex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternately:
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elisabeth45 in England. She was born in England, and died August 13, 1536 in Essex, England46. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		M	i	 William BRADBURY 1, 2 was born 1502 in Littlebury, Essex, England. He died Sep 1550 in Littlebury, Essex, England.
2 CONT *  		F	ii	 Philippa BRADBURY 1, 2 was born 1504 in Littlebury, Essex, England.
2 CONT *  		M	iii	 Matthew BRADBURY Esquire was born 1507 and died 10 Jun 1585.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
