1 NAME Thomas /Jocelyn/ of Hyde Hall & High Roding
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN Jocelyn
2 NSFX of Hyde Hall & High Roding
2 _MARNM Josselyn
2 NICK Jocelyn
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1506
2 ADDR
3 CITY Loddington
3 STAE England
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 OCT 1562
