2 NICK widow Bodley
1 NAME Joane Leche, Dame Bradbury
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1450
2 ADDR
3 CITY Wellingborough
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 11 APR 1530
2 PLAC London,,Middlesex,England
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 26 APR 1530
