2 CONT '''Sir Nicholas Leveson, Alderman of London'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	28 Feb 2020
2 CONT M, #191356, '''b. circa 1405, d. 1 September 1459'''
2 CONT '''     Sir Nicholas Leveson, Alderman of London was born circa 1405 at of Wolverhampton, Staffordshire, England.1 He married Maud (Matilda) Prestwood circa 1429 at of Prestwood, Ellastone, Staffordshire, England.1 Sir Nicholas Le
2 CONC veson, Alderman of London died on 1 September 1459 at Prestwood, Ellastone, Staffordshire, England.'''1
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Maud (Matilda) Prestwood''' b. c 1409
2 CONT '''Child'''	
2 CONT *Sir Richard Leveson+1 b. c 1431, d. 1 Sep 1459
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1.[S11597] Ancestry.com, Information submitted by bjdonell.
