1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile is part of the Moore Name Study.
2 CONT Johnne Moore, son of Johnne Moore and Jonet Arnot, was baptized on 14 Apr 1635 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Jane Clare (born about 1640 in Aucheneraw, Scotland; daughter of William Clare and Mary (Corey) Clare). Their son was William Moore (~1670–<1732).
2 CONT
2 CONT John died about 1715, aged 79.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ "Scotland Births and Baptisms, 1564-1950," database, (FamilySearch Record: X1YZ-N9Z : accessed 31 March 2024), Johnne Moore baptism on 14 Apr 1635 (born 4), son of Johnne Moore & Jonet Arnot, in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland; 
2 CONC citing Digital film/folder number: 7; FHL microfilm: 1066662.
