2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LVXK-FNX
2 CONT Brief Life History of William Henry'''
2 CONT
2 CONT William Moore of Perquimans County, North Carolina, wrote his will on 6 February 1727, and it was proved on 31 October 1732.  He named his wife, Elizabeth, and these children:
2 CONT (1) son William Moore [II]
2 CONT (2) son John Moore, who did not have heirs in 1727
2 CONT (3) son Joshua Moore, who did not have heirs in 1727
2 CONT (4) son Samuel Moore, who did not have heirs in 1727
2 CONT (5) son Truman Moore, who did not have heirs in 1727
2 CONT (6) daughter Jane Moore, who did not have heirs in 1727
2 CONT (7) daughter Elizabeth Moore
2 CONT
2 CONT William Moore also bequeathed a tract of land to his cousin, Robert Bogue.
