1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary Clare (Bundy)''' was born in 1663 in Perquimans County, North Carolina, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-10811980 William Bundy, IV] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-10812035 Elizabeth Bundy (Norton)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-94067420 Timothy Clare] on June 7, 1685 in Perquimans, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-12984156 Mary Mayo Newby (Clare), (twin)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-115940415 Elizabeth Winslow (Clare), (twin)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739380840 Ann Newby (Clare)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739380839 Timothy Clare]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-120995254 Jean Robinson Jessop (Cleare)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739380797 Sarah White (Clare)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 30, 1694 in Perquimans County, North Carolina, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.heirsandroots.com/MyFamilies/Winslow.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mary Bundy[9] was born about 1665 in RI. She married Timothy Clare on 07 Jun 1685 in Perquimans MM, Perquimans Co., NC. She died on 30 Dec 1694 in Perquimans Co, NC.  p. 3-4, Vol. I, NC, Hinshaw's Quaker Geneal., Perquimans MM min
2 CONC ., ad ditions: 1685, 4, 6. Timothy Clare, ltm Mary Bundy 1695, 12, 5. Comm. to visit Timothy for non-attendance of mtg. 1702/3, 1, _ . Timothy m. Hannah Snelling p. 301, "No. Carolina Hist. & Gen. Reg.", Misc. Items Taken From Loo
2 CONC se Papers Among the Records of Albemarle Co. at Edenton: Rent Roll of Land in Albemarle Co. Names of Parties and their res idence, without date, but prior to 1700: Timothy Cleare, Perquimans River, 473 acres. p. 3-4, Vol. 1,
2 CONT
2 CONT NC Hinshaw's Quaker Gen., Perquimans MM min., additi ons  !p. 3, additions, Hinshaw's Quaker Records, Vol. 1, NC Mary Bundy: 1685, 4, 6. dtr. William, ltm Timothy Clare
