2 CONT Born c 1662, the d/o William & 1st wife, Elizabeth (Unknown) Bundy, she m. Timothy, 7 Jun 1685, pursuant to his 6 May 1685 Declaration of Intent.
2 CONT She d. in what was then Perquimans Precinct of Albemarle Co. 
2 CONT children with Timothy, born in Perquimans Precinct, are:
2 CONT 1. Mary (21 Feb 1685/86-?)
2 CONT 2. Elizabeth (21 Feb 1685/86-?)
2 CONT 3. Ann (10 Nov 1687-d. y.)
2 CONT 4. Timothy (14 Sep 1689-d.y.)
2 CONT 5. Jean Cleare Jessop (1691–1737)
2 CONT 6. Sarah (24 Dec 1693-?)
