2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L7BF-DW5
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mary Bundy was born about 1665, in Perquimans, North Carolina, British Colonial America, her father, William Bundy, was 26 and her mother, Elizabeth Norton, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Timothy Cleare on 7 June 1685, in Perquimans, North Carolina, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 5 daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died on 30 December 1694, in her hometown, at the age of 30, and was buried in Perquimans, North Carolina, British Colonial America.
