2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary Mayo Newby (Clare), (twin)''' was born between April 21, 1685 and February 21, 1686 in (Quaker dates are confusing), Perquimanns County, North Carolina. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-94067420 Timothy Clare
2 CONC ] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-56281921 Mary Clare (Bundy)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-12984150 Edward Mayo, Jr.]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530827 Ann Newby (Mayo)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-78561574 Elizabeth Mayo] '''IN PROGRESS!'''; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34633437945 Joseph Mayo, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538093 Joseph Newby] on May 8, 1726 in Perquimans County, North Carolina. No Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She died between October 27, 1739, and December 27, 1739, in Perquimans County, North Carolina. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''1. Mary Clare, twin''', born 21da 12mo 1685; 
2 CONT # married/1, to Edward Mayo (2) (See Mayo Family, Part VIII, below) [https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~myfriendsthelambs2/genealogy/part8/other/mayo-henley.html] 
2 CONT # married/2 on 3d 6mo 1726 Joseph Newby, born 27 September 1693, son of Gabriel Newby and Mary Toms. (See [https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~myfriendsthelambs2/genealogy/part2/other/newby.html Newby Family, Part II]) 
2 CONT http://www.heirsandroots.com/MyFamilies/Winslow.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mary first married Edward Mayo (2), son of Edward Mayo Sr. and Sarah Maaga as his second wife.
2 CONT (He was married/1 about 1701/2 to Elizabeth ____.)
2 CONT He was married/2 on 4 February 1729/30, in Perquimans County, North Carolina, to '''Mary Clare''', daughter of Timothy Clare and Mary Bundy, (See: Clare Family), who was born 21da 12mo 1685;
2 CONT
2 CONT The Quaker record of Perquimans Monthly Meeting lists the first four children separately from the next three, who were listed under Mary. From this one would assume that they were married between 1713 and 1716, however, one record
2 CONC  states they were married in 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward (2) died 16th of 8mo 1724. 
2 CONT After Edward's death, Marry married for a second time to Joseph Newby, son of Gabriel Newby and Elizabeth Tom. 
2 CONT ----
