2 CONT 4. Colonel William4 Fauntleroy (Moore3, John2, William1) was born in 1650 at Rappahannock County, Virginia. He married Katherine Griffin, daughter of Colonel Samuel Griffin and Sarah, by 14 December 1678; 1st husband. He died befo
2 CONC re 14 September 1686. He resided at 'Naylor's Hole', Lancaster County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Griffin was born on 16 March 1664/65. She married David Gwyn circa 1690; 2nd husband. She married David Ridley before 6 February 1694; 3rd husband. She died on 24 September 1728 at Richmond County, Virginia, at age 63. S
2 CONC he left a will on 20 September 1728; proved 6 November 1728.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known children of Colonel William4 Fauntleroy and Katherine Griffin were as follows:
2 CONT *    5.  i.   Moore5 Fauntleroy, born 9 January 1679; married Margaret Micou.
2 CONT *         ii.   Griffin Fauntleroy was born on 13 April 1681 at Northumberland County, Virginia. He married Ann Bushrod, daughter of Thomas Bushrod and Ann. He married Elizabeth Taylor. He died in 1715.
2 CONT *    6.  iii.   Colonel William Fauntleroy, born 31 March 1684 at '''Naylor's Hole','' Richmond County, Virginia; married Apphia Bushrod.
2 CONT
