1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moore5 Fauntleroy (William4, Moore3, John2, William1) was born on 9 Jan 1679. He married Margaret Micou, daughter of Paul Micou, in 1696. He died in 1739 at Richmond, VA
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT 1739, 3 Mar: Moore FAUNTLEROY wrote his will. Named wife Margaret, son Moore; daughter Elizabeth BROCKENBROUGH's son William Fauntleroy BROCKENBROUGH; daughters Margaret, Katherine, Mary, Sarah GRIFFIN, Judith; sister Elizabeth TA
2 CONC YLOE. To wife the chariot and horses; son Moore my silver tankard that has my coat of arms upon it; brother-in-law John TAYLOE, Esq., and John and Paul MICOU executors. (7) 1739: By his will, he left to his son Moore FAUNTLEROY "T
2 CONC he Manner Plantation whereon I now live and all the lands thereto adjoining commonly called the "Island" that was my Mother's Joynter." (4b) 1739, 10 Apr: Will proved, Richmond Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * Ryland, Elizabeth Hawes. “Paul Micou, Chyrurgeon.” The William and Mary Quarterly, vol. 16, no. 2, 1936, pp. 241–246. JSTOR, http://www.jstor.org/stable/1918803. Accessed 29 June 2021.
2 CONT * https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Margaret_Micou_%282%29
2 CONT * http://homepages.rootsweb.com/~marshall/esmd48.htm#id1618
2 CONT *http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=va3&h=14090&indiv=try&o_vc=Record:OtherRecord&rhSource=70635 
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~marshall/esmd48.htm#id1618 Fauntleroy Family]
2 CONT * http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=adgedge&id=I1870 
2 CONT
