2 CONT * Marriage 2 John TAYLOE b: 15 FEB 1687 Married: 1715
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Gwynn and Stephen Lyde:
2 CONT #David Lyde (1713-1729)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Gwynn and John Tayloe:
2 CONT #William Tayloe,   b. 8 Jul 1716, Richmond County, Virginia d. 8 May 1726, Richmond County, Virginia
2 CONT #John Tayloe II was born 28 May 1721 in VA, and died Apr 1779 in VA. He married Rebecca Plater 11 Jul 1748 in Richmond County, Virginia. She was born 6 Aug 1731, and died 22 Jan 1787.
2 CONT #Elizabeth "Betty" Tayloe was born 1721, and died 1760. She married Richard Corbin 1737, son of Gawin Corbin and Jane Lane. He was born 1714, and died 1790.
2 CONT #Anne Corbin Tayloe was born 25 Aug 1723, and died AFT 1764. She married Mann Page 5 Dec 1747, son of Mann Page of Rosewell and Judith Carter. He was born 1718 in Rosewell, Gloucester Co. VA
2 CONT
