2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT these notes are from Annis Breland who sent info via email..4-4-2000 based on information in Barksdale Family History and Genealogy by Captain John A. Barksdale, pub. 1840. It traces the family back to William the Conqueror, which
2 CONC  soulds a bit fantastic at firs.. Captiain John was a lawyer and built a relatively plausible case for the lineage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Starts with Wiliam 1629-1694 was born in England and immigrated to VA around 1660. Wife's name unknown. the Williams son William born ? died Charlotte Co. VA. married Sarah Collier, dau. of Isaac Collier and Sarah Lockey (b Eng. d
2 CONC ied 1688 York Co. VA.) emigrated from Eng. 1651. Children of William and Sarah (don't have all dates) A. Nathaniel, may have died around 1790 in Halifax Co. VA B. Henry (? d.1788? maybe Henry CO. VA. C. John ? d. 1796 D. Hickerson
2 CONC  ? d. 1794+ E. William ? d.1796 F. Daniel ? 1789 G. COLLIER b. 1715 in St, Paul's Parrish Hanover Co. d. 1774 Charlotte Co. VA, married Sarah Randoph daughter of Henry Randolph and Elizabeth Epps around 1742 ?.
2 CONT
