2 CONT Brief Life History of Seth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Captain Seth Chapin was born on 4 August 1668, in Braintree, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Josiah Chapin, was 30 and his mother, Mary King, was 29. He married Mary Read on 20 May 1689, in Men
2 CONC don, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. He died on 1 April 1746, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 77, and was buried in Massachusetts Bay Colony, Bri
2 CONC tish Colonial America.
