2 CONC id Chapin [half] and Hannah (Chapin) Holbrook [half]
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Read) Chapin — married 23 May 1689 in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap [uncertain]
2 CONT Husband of Bethiah (Thurston) Chapin — married 25 Mar 1691 in Braintree, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT Husband of Mary (White) Chapin — married 8 Nov 1742 in Mendon, Worcester, Province of Massachusetts Baymap [uncertain]
