2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When Deacon John Chapin was born on 13 May 1698, in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Captain Seth Chapin, was 29 and his mother, Bethiah Thurston, was 26. He married Darcus Wood in 1
2 CONC 718, in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 31 August 1777, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 79
2 CONC , and was buried in Vernon Grove Cemetery, Milford, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States.
