2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Chapin was born on May 13, 1695, in Mendon, Massachusetts, to Bethiah Thurston, age 22, and Seth Chapin, age 26.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Dorcas Wood and they had at least eight children together:
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorcus (1720 - 1792)
2 CONT Josiah (1722 -1722)
2 CONT Bethiah (1724 - 1763
2 CONT Japheth (1726 - 1797)
2 CONT Joshua (1728 - 1801
2 CONT John (1730 - 1815)
2 CONT Solomon (1733 - 1813)
2 CONT Peter (1736 -????)
2 CONT Dorcas died in 1767 and he then married Ruth Day Bullard on September 10, 1768, in Sherborn, Massachusetts. She was the widow of John Hill and Benjamin Bullard.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 3, 1770, in his hometown, having lived a long life of 75 years, and was buried in Milford, Massachusetts, in the Vernon Grove Cemetery.
2 CONT
