1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Medfield births: MORSE Jemima, d. Joshua and Mary, Mar. 16, 1708-9. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Boston marriages: Henry Adams & Jemima Mors of Medfield Married By Sam. Checkley Esq. J. P. on Aug. 15, 1726.
2 CONT
2 CONT Medfield deaths: ADAMS, Jamima, wid. Henry Esq., Feb. 15, 1785. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to A genealogical history of Henry Adams, of Braintree, Mass., 1898, Jemima was the daughter of Joshua Morse and Elizabeth Penniman, who m. in Braintree, 1699. But Elizabeth Penniman died in 1703 and Joshua married, 2nd,
2 CONC  Mary Paine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jemima and Henry had 11 children.
2 CONT
