1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Find a Grave contributor Trisha:
2 CONT
2 CONT I think she is the daughter of Joseph Bullard and his wife Sarah, born Nov. 15, 1674. This Rachel married Sept. 28, 1702, Benoni Morse, s/o Samuel and Elizabeth Wood, who was born June 19, 1682 and died Nov.30, 1704; but I haven't
2 CONC  been able to prove that she married Isaac Chenery after.
2 CONT
2 CONT It would be possible that she married Isaac Chenery abt 1708 and had two sons, Ephraim in 1710 and Isaac in 1711. But I haven't been able to find any marriage record, and if she died Mar. 14, 1769 that would make her 94 Years, 3 M
2 CONC onths, 27 Days.
2 CONT
2 CONT Grave inscription reads:
2 CONT
2 CONT  In memory of Mrs. Rachel (wife of Mr. ??? Chenery) who Died March 15th 1769 in ye 96th year of her  age
