1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rebecca Adams was buried in Millis Cemetery, East Medway, Norfolk Co, MA.12 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married
2 CONT * (1) John Fisher. John Fisher died 2 Feb 1712/13, inbMedfield, Norfolk Co, MA.2 
2 CONT *  (2) Jeremiah Adams 22 Dec 1715, in Medfield, Norfolk Co, MA.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Wheelock-739
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca was born on November 2, 1692 in Mendon, Massachusetts Colony to Eleazer Wheelock and Mary Chenery. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Wheelock married first John Fisher of Medfield, about 1712. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She had one child with John born at Medfield:
2 CONT #Rebecca Fisher Born 9 Oct 1713.  Married  John Baxter.  (Son of Joseph Baxter and Mary Fiske). On December 22, 1815, Jeremiah Adams married Rebecca (Wheelock) Fisher, the widow of John Fisher, in Medfield. [2][3] She was the daug
2 CONC hter of Eleazer Wheelock and Mary Chenery.
2 CONT
2 CONT [3] Rebecca Wheelock and Jeremiah Adams had two children born at Medway:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Abigail Adams, Born 20 Jul 1717, married John Swift (Son of John Swift and Sarah Tileston)
2 CONT #Elisha Adams, [4] Born 19 Feb 1719, married Rachel Daniel (Daughter of Jeremiah Daniell and Hannah Partridge)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=62654783 Find A Grave Memorial# 62654783]
2 CONT **Notes for Jeremiah Adams: Patten, Malcom Clark,Patten Genealogy, Powell and Taylor Publishing Company, 1990, p. 127
