1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stories from the History of Sackville (Dr. William C. Milner)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1812 , Sackville, New Brunswick, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT An effort was made to erect a schoolhouse in Middle Sackville on John Fawcett's Land, where Moses Delesdernier had lived. The leading subscribers were Robert Fawcett, Simon Outhouse, John Fawcett and John Ogden. Other subscribers 
2 CONC were Nathaniel Kimball, Richard Wilson, Peter Neilly, George Lawrance, William Lawrence, James Lawrence, Agreen Tingley, Thomas Burnham, Christopher Atkinson, George L. Kinnear, Simon Mahoney, Henry Ogden and Edwin Atkinson. The a
2 CONC ttempt was abandoned.
