2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Eleazer
2 CONT
2 CONT When Eleazer Holbrook was born on 26 February 1705, in Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Eleazer Holbrook, was 44 and his mother, Sarah Pond, was 25. He married Deborah Bullard on
2 CONC  4 April 1728, in Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 5 daughters. He lived in Sherborn, Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States in 1705. 
2 CONC He died on 20 May 1775, in Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 70.
