2 CONT Ruth Rice formerly Day aka Hill, Bullard, Chapin edit
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Day Jr. and Ruth (Puffer) Day edit
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Day, Caleb Day, Israel Day, Ebenezer Day, Hannah Day, Daniel Day and Ichabod Day add sibling
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Hill — married 19 Nov 1733 in Wrentham, Suffolk, Massachusetts map icon at age 26
2 CONT Wife of Benjamin Bullard — married 12 Aug 1762 in Holliston, Middlesex, Province of Massachusetts Bay map icon at age 54
2 CONT Wife of John Chapin  — married 10 Sep 1768 in Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony map icon at age 60
2 CONT Wife of Ezekiel Rice — married 8 Jan 1772 in Sherborn, Massachusetts map icon at age 64 add/edit spouses
2 CONT Mother of James Hill Sr , Caleb Hill , Ruth (Hill) Cheney , Hannah (Hill) Richardson , Ebenezer Hill  , Abigail (Hill) Daniels and John Hill VI add/edit children
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 husbands and 7 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT All seven of Ruth's children were born during her 25+ year marriage to her first husband, John Hill. They lived in Sherborn. After he died, she married Benjamin Bullard of Holliston in 1762; he died 4 years later. Third, she marri
2 CONC ed Deacon John Chapin of Mendon in 1768, when she was about sixty and he was seventy years old. Last, she married Ezekiel Rice in Sherborn in 1772.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Hill and Ruth Day:
2 CONT
2 CONT James Hill, born 13 August 1734
2 CONT Caleb Hill, born 17 August 1736
2 CONT Ruth Hill, born 22 April 1739
2 CONT Hannah Hill, born 16 October 1741
2 CONT Ebenezer Hill, born 8 July 1744
2 CONT Abigail Hill, born 4 February 1746/47
2 CONT John Hill, born 28 April 1750
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. John Hill of Dorchester, Mass., 1633, and Five Generations of His Descendants. Edited by Joseph Gardner Bartlett. Boston, 1904. p. 15 (info on marriages) http://books.google.com/books?id=FRYPAAAAYAAJ
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Sherborn/DeathsH.shtml#p205 Massachusetts Vital Records Project Vol 1, p. 206. Sherborn Deaths: John Hill died in Sherborn Oct. 29, 1761. Not certain that this is the same person, but no 
2 CONC other John Hill is recorded as dying in Sherborn within twenty years. This time frame also fits with Ruth's last child being born in 1750, and her remarriage in 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Sherborn/MarriagesC.shtml. Massachusetts Vital Records Project Vol 1, p. 114. Sherborn Marriages: "CHAPIN (John MR) Dea. of Mendon and wid. Ruth Bullard (Hill. MR), Sept. 10, 1768."
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Framingham/aMarriagesR.shtml#RICE Massachusetts Vital Records Project Framingham Marriages "[Rice,] Ezekiel and wid. Ruth Chapin of Sherborn, Jan. 8, 1772. In Sherborn." and Vital records
2 CONC  of Framingham, Massachusetts, to the year 1850, Boston, Mass, 1911. p. 363 https://archive.org/details/vitalrecordsoffr00fram/page/363/mode/1up
2 CONT
