1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/GL33-283/jonathan-bullard-jr-1734-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jonathan
2 CONT When Jonathan Bullard Jr was born on 21 October 1734, in Sherborn, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Jonathan Wright Bullard, was 27 and his mother, Sarah Hill, was 24. He married Mary Barb
2 CONC er on 16 November 1761. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 29 September 1824, in Hancock, Hillsborough, New Hampshire, United States, at the age of 89, and was buried in Pine Ridge Cemetery, Hanco
2 CONC ck, Hillsborough, New Hampshire, United States.
