2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Hill, daughter of Ephraim and Hannah, was born on Feb 4, 1725 in Holliston, Massachusetts. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Hill married Samuel Daniel in Medway, Massachusetts on 7 Jan 1743. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Keene, New Hampshire on March 19, 1819 at age 95 and a widow. [3]
