1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Paul Morse 1700 – 1760 and Sarah Sheffield 1708 – 1806. She married Joseph Bennett 1731 –. They had three children recorded in Ipswitch: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Sarah Sally Bennett 1755 – 1810 unmarried 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Stephen Bennett 1758 – 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Hannah Bennett 1761 – 1829 married Enoch Burnham 1760 – 1802 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT     1733 25 Mar 
2 CONT     Holliston, Middlesex, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT     born Holliston see marriage record so either: Sarah, d. Henry, Apr. 19, 1730. CR1 or Sarah, d. Paul, bp. Mar. 25, 1733. CR1 the latter is much more likely based both on age of spouse and age at death. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Joseph Bennett
2 CONT     1754 30 Nov Age: 21
2 CONT     Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT     Morss: Sarah Mrs, of Holliston, and Joseph Bennet, int. Nov 30 1754 Ipswitch VR page 314 http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Ipswich/Images/Ipswich_M314.shtml 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death
2 CONT     1796 28 May Age: 63
2 CONT     Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT     Bennet: Sarah, wid. May 28, 1796, a. abt. 62 y. CR4 Ipswitch VR page 490
2 CONT
2 CONT In all cases Bennet spelled with one "T"
