1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~colby/colbyfam/b801.html#P3948
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne WEBSTER was born on 6 JAN 1681 in Newbury, Essex County, Massachusetts. She died about 1760 at Amesbury, Essex County, Massachusetts. She had administration granted for estate on 10 NOV 1760 in Amesbury, Essex County, Massach
2 CONC usetts. Inventory her estate Sept 30, 1760. Johathan Barnard admin her estate. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (BOOK SOURCE: "The Old Families of Salisbury and Amesbury Massachusetts" by David W. Hoyt.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: John WEBSTER and Bridget HUGGINS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Philip COLBY. Philip COLBY and Anne WEBSTER were married on 1 MAY 1703 in Amesbury, Essex County, Massachusetts. Children were: Ichabod COLBY, Tabitha COLBY, Philip COLBY, Nicholas COLBY, Stephen COLBY, Samuel COLBY.
2 CONT
