1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Webster, the fourth in this family line, is the son of John Webster and Bridget (Huggins) Webster. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Sarah Grele (aka Greeley), born October 21, 1685, at Salisbury, Massachusetts, the daughter of Andrew Grele and Sarah (Brown) Grele. The intentions of the couple to marry was published at Salisbury, Massachusetts on M
2 CONC arch 13, 1707-08. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Researcher's Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Use caution before trying to merge this profile with his elder brother Jonathan, born May 2, 1767. His brother may have died prior to this John's birth, or simply may have both a Jonathan and John in this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Webster-6735
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===John Webster IV (1683 - 1754)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John Webster IV
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 2 Nov 1683 [location unknown]
