2 CONT # Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19425920/anna-thomas: accessed August 15, 2025), memorial page for Anna Thompson Thomas (31 Dec 1689–1 Mar 1723), Find a Grave Memorial ID 19425920, citing C
2 CONC enter Cemetery, Pembroke, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA; Maintained by Denise (contributor 46820671). Shows birth as 31 Dec 1689 in Newbury, Essex County, Massachusetts
