2 CONT Brief Life History of Samuel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Samuel Thompson was born on 1 September 1691, in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Rev. Edward Thompson Sr., was 26 and his mother, Sarah Webster, was 32. He married Hannah Nor
2 CONC wood on 26 November 1716, in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 8 December 1724, in his hometown, at the age of 33, and was b
2 CONC uried in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
