2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel was born in 1691. He was the son of Edward Thompson and Sarah Webster. He passed away in 1724.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married Hannah Norwood on 26 Nov 1716 at Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay - parents of Elizabeth, Mary, Edward, Abigail and Samuel Thompson
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Thompson-50781Samuel Thompson (1691 - 1724)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Rev Samuel Thompson===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1 Sep 1691 in Newbury, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Edward Thompson and Sarah (Webster) Thompson
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Sarah (Tompson) Clark, Ann (Tompson) Thomas, Abigail (Thompson) Longfellow, Edward Tompson, William Tompson, John Thompson and Joseph Tompson
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Hannah Elizabeth (Norwood) Thompson — married 26 Nov 1716 in Newbury, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Elizabeth (Thompson) Martin and Mary (Thompson) Higley
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 8 Dec 1724 at age 33 in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
