1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT John Merrill was a house carpenter. About 1697 he moved from Newbury to Bradford, Massachusetts, 
2 CONT
2 CONT and about 1700 moved to the West Parish of Haverhill, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He left an estate valued at £152,7s., but his debts amounted to £158,12s.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Merrill-912
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.jmerrill.net/Thomas%20Merrill.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. ''''JOHN8 MERRILL 
2 CONT
2 CONT (NATHANIEL7 +MERRILL, NATHANIEL6 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 
2 CONT
2 CONT *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT was born February 16, 1663/64 in Newbury, Essex, Mass,
2 CONT
2 CONT  and died May 15, 1705 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married LUCY WEBSTER 1687 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass, 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of JOHN WEBSTER and ANNE BATT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born December 15, 1664 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, 
2 CONT
2 CONT and died Aft. 1718 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOHN MERRILL: 
2 CONT
2 CONT From " A Merrill Memorial" by Samuel Merrill, Cambridge, MA 1917-1928
2 CONT
2 CONT John(3) Merrill (Nathaniel(2)) was born 16 Feb 1662/63 in Newbury, MA, 
2 CONT
2 CONT and died 15 May 1705. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a house carpenter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT About 1697 he removed from Newbury to Bradford, MA., 
2 CONT
2 CONT and about 1700 to West Parish of Haverhill, MA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He left an estate valued at £150, 7s., but his debts amounted to £158,12s. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lucy Webster, daughter of John and Ann (Batt) Wetster. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born 15 Dec 1664, in Newbury , and was living in Haverhill in 1718. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (William M. Sargent appears to be in error in the Maine Historical 
2 CONT
2 CONT and Genealogical Recorder{Vol.III.,p.179} in saying 
2 CONT
2 CONT that John Merrill married as a second Wife "Mary???." 
2 CONT
2 CONT Administration on the estate of John Merrill was granted too "Lucy Merrill," 
2 CONT
2 CONT his widow, 9 Jul 1705.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, the first five of whom were born in Newbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of 
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN MERRILL and LUCY WEBSTER are: 46. i. NATHANIEL9 MERRILL, b. July 26, 1687, Newbury, Essex, Mass; d. August 25, 1737, Haverhill, Essex, Mass. 47. ii. ABEL MERRILL, b. 1690, Newbury, Essex, Mass; d. March 29, 1753, Newbury, Ess
