2 CONC . 1773, Concord, NH. 51. vi. HANNAH MERRILL, b. 1698, Bradford, Essex, Mass; d. June 9, 1744, Haverhill, Essex, Mass. 52. vii. STEPHEN MERRILL, b. September 11, 1700, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. April 28, 1746, Metheun, Essex, Mass
2 CONC . viii. ENOCH MERRILL, b. January 23, 1701/02, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. Unknown, Stratham, N.H.. 53. ix. NATHAN MERRILL, b. April 15, 1704, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. Unknown.
