1 CHAN
2 DATE 09 SEP 2022
3 TIME 06:02:25
0 @I6000000017719337666@ INDI
1 NAME Hannah /Merrill/
2 GIVN Hannah
2 SURN Merrill
2 _MARNM Hutchins
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1686
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bradford
3 STAE Massachusetts
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 JUN 1744
2 ADDR
3 CITY Haverhill
3 STAE Massachusetts
1 BURI
2 DATE 12 JUN 1744
2 PLAC West Parish Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Haverhill
3 STAE Massachusetts
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Do not confuse with http://www.geni.com/people/Hannah-Hutchins-of-Kittery/6000000002889496980
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Merrill born Ma in 1698. Her father was John Merrill born 1663 in Newbury Ma. Her mother was Lucy Webster born 1664 in Newbury Ma. They had the following children born in Newbury Ma. Samuel Jr born 1716, Hannah born 1717, N
2 CONC athan born 1722, Lydia born 1723, Abigail born 1724.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # on January 4, 1715/16 in Newburyport, Massachusetts to Samuel Hutchins (1682-1778).  "Samuel, s. Joseph and Johanah (Corliss), Aug. 20, 1682.". (don't confuse him with https://www.geni.com/people/Samuel-Hutchins-of-Kittery/60000
2 CONC 00002952286773?through=6000000002889496980)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # SAMUEL5 HUTCHINS, b. September 17, 1716, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts; d. December 12, 1796, Lee, New Hampshire.
2 CONT # HANNAH HUTCHINS, b. May 01, 1717, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT # NATHAN HUTCHINS1597,1598, b. April 01, 1722, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts1599,1600; d. September 26, 1811, North Hero, Vermont1600; m. MARY WHITTIER1601,1602, May 02, 1747, Haverhill, Essex County, Massachusetts1603,1604;
2 CONC  b. May 01, 1727, Methuen, Essex County, Massachusetts1605,1606; d. July 08, 1798, North Hero, Vermont1606. More About NATHAN HUTCHINS and MARY WHITTIER: Marriage: May 02, 1747, Haverhill, Essex County, Massachusetts
2 CONT # ABIGAIL HUTCHINS1609,1610, b. June 01, 1724, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts1611,1612; m. ATWOOD FALES1613,1614, May 02, 1747, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts1615,1616; b. March 10, 1722/23, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massach
2 CONC usetts1616; d. February 08, 1805, Amherst, Nova Scotia. More About ATWOOD FALES and ABIGAIL HUTCHINS: Marriage: May 02, 1747, Haverhill, Essex Co., Massachusetts1617,1618
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===comments===
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin (TAG, 73:172-174) makes the point that there is often confusion about the wives of two Samuel Hutchins, this Hannah's husband and a Samuel from Kittery Maine. He makes clear that this is the Hannah who married the local Sam
2 CONC uel Hutchins and also that there is, to date, no evidence whatsoever that Hannah, wife of the Kittery Samuel Hutchins, had the surname Merrill. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT American Genealogical-Biographical Index (AGBI), Stories, Memories & Histories: Name: Hannah Merrill Birth: 1692 - Massachusetts. Massachusetts, Marriages, 1633-1850, Birth, Marriage & Death: Name: Hannah Merrill Spouse: Samuel Hu
2 CONC tchins Marriage: 4 Jan 1716 - Newbury, Essex, Massachusetts. U.S., Sons of the American Revolution Membership Applications, 1889-1970, Birth, Marriage & Death: Name: Hannah Merrill Death: 9 Jun 1744 Civil: 2 Oct 1956.
2 CONT
