3 FORM jpg
3 TITL 1716 - Marriage of Samuel Hutchins & Hannah Merrill, both of Newbury
3 NOTE Newbury, Massachusetts vital records note the marriage of Samuel Hutchins to Hannah Merrill, both of Haverhill, on 4 January 1715/16. As we have seen, this marriage has been attributed to both Samuel and Hannah of Haverhill and Sa
4 CONC muel and Hannah of Kittery, Salisbury, and Arundel. 
4 CONT
4 CONT When the wills of these two Samuels are compared with the family record of Samuel Hutchins and Hannah "Marrill" preserved in the Haverhill Town Records, it is clear that the Samuel Hutchins who married Hannah Merrill was the son o
4 CONC f Joseph and Johannah (Corliss) Hutchins of Haverhill. 
4 CONT
4 CONT Comment source: The American Genealogist, vol. 72, pgs. 173-75.
