2 CONT Nathaniel(4) Merrill (John(3), Nathaniel(2)) was born 26 Jul 1687 in Newbury, MA and died 25 Aug 1737 in the West Parish of Haverhill, MA, whither he removed from Newbury. He was a cooper. He married, 10 Jun 1718, Ruth Wallingford
2 CONC , who survived him. She married (2), in 1744, Benjamin Wood of Drucut, MA, and removed to Chelmsford, MA. Children born in Haverhill.
