2 CONT Stephen(4) Merrill (John(3), Nathaniel(2)) was born 11 Sep 1700 in Haverhill, MA and died 28 Apr 1746 in Methuen, MA. In 1718 he was living in York, ME with his brother John, but returned to Haverhill and later removed to Methuen.
2 CONC  He married Abiah (Merrill).
