2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathan Merrill was born on April 15, 1704, in Haverhill, Essex County, Massachusetts, the son of John Merrill and Lucy/Lucie Webster.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT NATHAN9 MERRILL (JOHN8, NATHANIEL7 +MERRILL, NATHANIEL6 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born April 15, 1704 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass, and died Unknown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1) MARY GORDIN April 8, 1728 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass. She was born Abt. 1711, and died May 21, 1738. He married (2) DAMERIS LANCASTER March 24, 1741/42 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass. She was born Abt. 1704, and died Febr
2 CONC uary 29, 1743/44. He married (3) SUSANNAH STAPLES July 19, 1744 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass. She was born May 24, 1726 in Haverhill, Essex, Mass, and died Unknown.
2 CONT
