2 CONT
2 CONT ===Nathan Merrill===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 15 Apr 1704 in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Merrill Sr. and Lucy (Webster) Merrill
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Nathaniel Merrill, Abel Merrill, Lucie (Merrill) Stanly, Hannah (Merrill) Hutchins, Abigail (Merrill) Eastman, John Merrill Jr., Stephen Merrill and Enoch Merrill
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Damaris (Lancaster) Merrill — married 24 Mar 1741 in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts Bay, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Susanna (Staples) Merrill — married 19 Jul 1744 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Thomas Hazen Merrill and Damaris Merrill
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 3 May 1785 at age 81 in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT
