2 CONT The Life Summary of Nathan
2 CONT
2 CONT When Nathan Merrill was born on 15 April 1704, in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John Merrill, was 41 and his mother, Lucy Webster, was 39. He married Mary Gordon on 8 April 1728,
2 CONC  in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 3 May 1785, at the age of 81.
