1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Twin of Elizabeth
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Wood was born as a twin with Elizabeth on 5 Sep 1664 in Rowley, Massachusetts to parents Thomas Wood and Ann Hunt. He married first, in 1685 in Rowley, Massachusetts to Sarah Elithorpe. Children: Joseph. After Sarah died in
2 CONC  1689 he married second Mary Felt on 17 Oct 1689. Children: Samuel, Sarah, James, Josiah, Mary, Josiah Jr., Ruth, Elizabeth, George, Ann, Daniel. He passed away on 10 Dec 1728 in Enfield, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Wood-116
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 5 Jan 2021 | Created 14 Apr 2010
