2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Mighell-2
2 CONT
2 CONT THOMAS MILES [Mighill], (John, Thomas), was born ca. 1666 and married first at Suffield, MA 12 Dec. 1700 Abigail, b. 19 March 1675 at Wenham, MA, dau. of Robert and Joanna (Warner) McLaflin. He lived Killingly, CT in 1740 and was 
2 CONC probably dec’d by April 1745. Before 1740 he evidently married 2nd Joanna__ whom he mentioned in a deed. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT *i. Thomas Jr., b. ca. 1703; m. 1st Mary Howard, 2nd Sarah Hartshorn. 
2 CONT *3. ii. Stephen, b. ca. 1705 
2 CONT *iii. Abigail, b. 21 Aug. 1706 at Suffield. 
2 CONT *iv. Joseph, b. ca. 1708; m. Mary__. He was admitted to church at Killingly 10 Oct. 1731. 
2 CONT *v. Benjamin, b. ca. 1710; m. Sarah Holmes 1740 at Pomfret. 
2 CONT *vi. Daniel, b. ca. 1715; m. 1st Susannah Dana, and 2nd, as Daniel Miles Mrs. Abigail King(s)ley of Pomfret. 
2 CONT *4. vii. Samuel; m. Hannah__. [1]
2 CONT
