2 CONT The Life Summary of Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT >When Sarah Bliss was born on 11 October 1681, in Springfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Samuel Bliss, was 33 and her mother, Sarah Stebbins, was 27. She married Nathaniel Mighell S
2 CONC r on 15 January 1701, in Springfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. She died on 26 February 1751, in Brimfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States, 
2 CONC at the age of 69, and was buried in Brimfield Cemetery, Brimfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States.
