2 CONC ers of the Beekman Patent, Dutchess County, New York: An Historical and Genealogical Study of All the 18th Century Settlers in the Patent, ten volumes. 1990–2003).  Page 805-806.  [https://www.americanancestors.org/DB409/rd/13283/
