1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >When Nathaniel Bliss Mighill Jr was born about 1710, in Killingly, Windham, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Nathaniel Mighell, was 34 and his mother, Sarah Bliss, was 29. He had at least 
2 CONC 5 sons and 4 daughters with Anna Oren Collins. He died on 10 June 1758, in Brimfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 48.
