1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =John Warner, an early settler of Suffield=
2 CONT
2 CONT Born circa 1671, Farmington, CT; died circa 1740, Suffield, CT; son of Daniel Warner & Sarah Roe; married 1692/93, probably Suffield, CT, Elizabeth Mighel; dau. of John Mighill & Sarah Batt; born circa 1666.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # John Warner, b. 1 May 1694, Suffield, CT; m. (1) Elizabeth Trumble; m. (2) Elizabeth French.
2 CONT # Sarah Warner, b. 7 Sep 1696, Suffield, CT; m. Joseph Grimes.
2 CONT # Eleanor Warner, b. 15 Apr 1698, Suffield, CT; m. Thomas Hoskins.
2 CONT # Daniel Warner, b. 23 Jul 1700, Suffield, CT; m. Elizabeth Adams.
2 CONT # Samuel Warner, b. 3 Feb 1702/03, Suffield, CT; d. 28 Oct 1704, Suffield, CT.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Warner, b. 27 May 1705, Suffield, CT; m. Samuel Taylor.
2 CONT # Samuel Warner, b. 19 Aug 1707, Suffield, CT; m. Mehitable Sheldon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Documents: 12, 201, 223
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.suffieldhistoricalsociety.org/families/warner.htm
