2 CONT
2 CONT Obadiah Bruen, son of John Bruen Esq and Anne Fox, was born probably shortly before his baptism at Bruen-Stapleford, Tarwin, Cheshire, England, 25 December 1606.1,2,3,4,5 He died at Newark, Essex Co., New Jersey, about 1681.6
2 CONT
2 CONT Obadiah married Sarah Seeley, daughter of William Seeley, at St. Martin's, Birmingham, Warwickshire, England, 7 May 1633.7,8,6,9 Family 	Sarah Seeley b. bef. 22 Oct 1609, d. aft. 1697 Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Mary Bruen6 b. 12 Jun 1634
2 CONT     Sarah Bruen6 b. 1 May 1636
2 CONT     Rebecca Bruen6 b. say 1638, d. 15 Apr 1721
2 CONT     Hannah Bruen6 b. 9 Jan 1644
2 CONT     John Bruen+6 b. 2 Jun 1645, d. 1695
