2 CONT BURIED IN PETER PRUDDEN'S GARDEN --NO TOMBSTONE REMAINS
2 CONT Memorial ID
2 CONT 29452883 · View Source
2 CONT Mary Bruen came to America with her half-brother, Obadiah Bruen, on the "MARTIN" in 1638. She was admitted to the Milford Church on April 30, 1653, and on October 13, 1658, she married John Baldwin of Milford as his second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT __________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT This Mary was the daughter of John Bruen and his 3rd wife Margaret Allen(?), and Obadiah Bruen was the son of John Bruen and his 2nd wife Anne Fox, thus resulting in Mary being the half-sister of Obadiah. --- Obadiah's daughter, H
2 CONC annah, was born Jan 1643/4 and married John Baldwin, the son of John Baldwin of Milford who married her aunt Mary Bruen.
2 CONT
