1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 10925. Rebecca Bruen, daughter of Obadiah Bruen and Sarah Seeley. Born say 1640. Rebecca died at Norwich, CT, on 15 Apr 1721.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Sep 1663 Rebecca married Thomas Post, son of Stephen Post (ca 1596-16 Aug 1659) & Ellen Panton (-13 Nov 1670), at Saybrook, CT. Born ca 1631 at Otham, Kent. Baptized on 1 Nov 1631 at Otham, Kent. Thomas died at Norwich, CT, on 
2 CONC 5 Sep 1701.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas first married Mary Andrews, second Rebecca Bruen. Children:
2 CONT * 23275	i. Thomas (1664-)
