1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source: Families of Early Milford, Connecticut by Susan Emma Woodruff Abbott 2004, page 21.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Bruen daughter of Obadiah Bruen of New London, CT married John Baldwin Jr., son of John Baldwin and Mary Camp. Married on 13 Oct 1663.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Bruen died before 1686 because John Baldwin Jr. married a second wife, Ruth Botsford, before 1686.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by first marriage (w/Hannah Bruen):
2 CONT
2 CONT # Richard born 24 Dec 1666, probably died young
2 CONT # Sarah
2 CONT # Hannah
2 CONT # Elizabeth
2 CONT # John
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/baldwingenealogy00bald#page/300/mode/2up. The Baldwin Genealogy pg 300-301
2 CONT https://archive.org/details/baldwingenealogy00bald/page/305/mode/1up?view=theater
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mrs HANNAH BRUEN BALDWIN''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Jan. 9, 1644 New London New London County Connecticut, USA  Death:  1685 Newark Essex County New Jersey, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Obadiah b. 1606 in Tarvin, Stapleford, Chester, England d. abt 1681 in Newark, Essex, NJ  Mother: Sarah b. in England 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   John Baldwin (____ - 1706)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Unknown 
2 CONT
