1 NAME Elizabeth /Burr/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Burr
2 _MARNM Seeley
2 NICK Elizabeth (Burr) Olmstead Gilbert - Widow of Nehemiah Olmstead and Obadiah Gilbert
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 MAY 1632
2 ADDR
3 STAE Probably England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 17 OCT 1682
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fairfield
3 STAE Connecticut Colony
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NEHEMIAH OLMSTED, bap. at Fairsted, Nov. 10, 1618. Came to America with his father, and settled in Fairfield, Conn., in 1649. He married Elizabeth Burr, dau. of Jehu Burr, Sr. He was a sergeant in 1657. Died before
2 CONC  Oct. 2, 1657. His widow was appointed administratrix Aug., 1658. Mrs. Olmsted m. (2) Obadiah Gilbert, of Fairfield, Conn. 17, Sarah; m. Robert Seeley, of Fairfield, Conn.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT LDS records have birth in Wethersfield, H, CT and add Olmstead as a secondary maiden name.
2 CONT
2 CONT New England marriages prior to 1700 By Clarence Almon Torrey, Elizabeth Petty Bentley http://books.google.com/books?id=mOgK8dM9qqUC&pg=PA214&lpg=PA214&dq=Elizabeth+Gilbert+deming&source=bl&ots=ZfIodgLGRm&sig=B7I3E-2rKrFVMC6DkJ-cvW
2 CONC KgHQM&hl=en&ei=dtWwTMmaNJTmsQOc0rDwCw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=2&ved=0CBQQ6AEwATgU#v=onepage&q=Elizabeth%20Gilbert&f=false Pg.302 GILBERT, Obadiah2 (ca 1630-1674/5) & Elizabeth (BURR) OLMSTEAD, w Nehemiah, m/3 Nathan S
2 CONC EELEY; ca 1660/2; Fairfield, CT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (f/g) Elizabeth Burr Olmstead Gilbert Seeley Birth: 	1637 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA Death: 	unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT ELIZABETH, 4th known child of Johu Burr, was born say 1637. She married (1) by about 1655 Nehemiah Olmstead. She married (2) about 1660 Obadiah Gilbert. She married (3) 1674 Nathaniel Seeley (on 21 June 1688 there were recorded "s
2 CONC everal parcels of land made over by Elizabeth Seely unto her two sons Obadiah and Beniamin Gilbert as she is executor of her husband Gilbert." Source: Anderson's Great Migration Begins. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   Jehu Burr (1600 - 1692)
2 CONT   Wife Cable Burr (1600 - 1670) 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Nehemiah Olmstead (1618 - ____)
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Sarah Olmstead Seeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Unknown  Created by: Linda Mac Record added: Jul 18, 2010 Find A Grave Memorial# 55110671 -tcd
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Elizabeth Burr, born 1637; died Aft. 1688; married (1) Obadiah Gilbert Abt. 1660; born Abt. 1630; married (2) Nehemiah Olmstead Abt. 1655; married (3) Nathaniel Seeley Abt. 1674.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/b/r/y/Frank-Nicholas-Bryan/GENE1-0064.html
