3 TEXT Lord Lieutenant of Ireland from 1431 to 1436; appointed comptroller of the royal household in 1432; 1455 he was promoted to Lord Chamberlain; 1456 he was summoned to the House of Lords as Lord Stanley. A year later he was further 
4 CONC honoured when he was made a Knight of the Garter; represented Lancashire in the House of Commons between 1447 and 1451 and 1453 and 1454
