4 CONC Alswyn Martin- Rice " THE LAUNDRESS"  of family lore from which springs the Rice's of Tenby, Carew, and later NEW YORK Rices which move onto Ohio and and Nebraska.....The story was kept under wraps, never discussed in the family w
4 CONC ith we children....I only learned of the "Laundress"  and her subsequent love child in 1978 just before my 93 year old father passed at age 93.....The segment under investigation now is the Perrott ap Rice 1600 segment in which he
4 CONC  FAKED his own demise to escape personal and Financial Trouble in Wales owing the equivelant of $1.3 Million dollars in today's money unsecured....and began life anew as John Rice.....aparantly in Dedham Ma....but we don't have it
