4 CONC Alswyn Martin- Rice " THE LAUNDRESS"  of family lore from which springs the Rice's of Tenby, Carew, and later NEW YORK Rices which move onto Ohio and and Nebraska.....The story was kept under wraps, never discussed in the family w
