1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Katherine Stanley, daughter of the 1st Earl of Stanley, was the wife of Sir John Savage, KG, of Clifton, Cheshire. Of their many sons, the eldest, Sir John Savage, KG, was the commander of the left wing of Henry Tu
2 CONC dor's army at the Battle of Bosworth in 1485; another, Sir Christopher Savage of Aston-under-Edge, Gloucestershire, fell at the Battle of Flodden, and another, Thomas Savage, was Archbishop of York.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p464.htm#i13932
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Katherine Stanley (1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9)
2 CONT * '''F''', #13932, 
2 CONT * '''b'''. 1430
2 CONT * '''Father''': Sir Thomas Stanley, Lord Lieutenant of Ireland, Lord of Latham and Knowsley, 1st Lord Stanley, Constable & Justice of Chester (10,3,4,11,6,7,12,9)
2 CONT ** b. c 1405, 
2 CONT ** d. 11 Feb 1459
2 CONT * '''Mother: '''  Joan Goushill (2,3,4,11,7,12) 
2 CONT ** b. c 1401, 
2 CONT ** d. c 27 Apr 1466
2 CONT * '''Katherine Stanley was born in 1430 at of Lathom & Knowsley, Lancashire, England.(2) 
2 CONT * She married Sir John Savage, Mayor of Chester, Chamberlain of Middlewich, 
2 CONT ** son of Sir John Savage, Bailiff of the Forest of Macclesfield, Chamberlain of Middlewich and Eleanor Brereton, circa 1447 at of Clifton, Cheshire, England; 
2 CONT * They '''had 10 sons''' (Sir John; Thomas, Bishop ofRochester & London, Archbishop of York; Sir Humphrey; Sir Lawrence; James; Sir Edward; Sir Christopher; George; William; & Sir Richard) and 
2 CONT * '''5 daughters''' (Ellen, wife of Sir Peter Legh; Katherine, wife of Thomas Legh; Margaret, wife of John Honford, Esq; Alice, wife of Roger Pilkington; & Elizabeth, wife of John Leeke, Esq.). (2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9)
2 CONT * Katherine Stanley was '''buried before 22 November 1495''' at Macclesfield, Cheshire, England.(13,4,7)
2 CONT * '''Family:''' Sir John Savage, Mayor of Chester, Chamberlain of Middlewich 
2 CONT ** b. c 1423, 
2 CONT ** d. 22 Nov 1495
2 CONT * '''Children:'''
2 CONT ** Sir John Savage+ (14,13,4,15,7) b. c 1448, d. 18 Oct 1492
2 CONT ** Margaret Savage+ (13,16,4,17,7,18) b. c 1450
2 CONT ** Thomas Savage, Bishop of Rochester & London, Archbishop of York (13,7) b. c 1452, d. 3 Sep 1507
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Savage+ (19,4,6,7,9) b. c 1453
2 CONT ** Helen Savage+  b. c 1454
2 CONT ** Sir Homphrey Savage b. c 1456
2 CONT ** Lawrence Savage b. c 1458
2 CONT ** Ellen Savage+ (20,13,21,4,22,7) b. c 1460, d. 17 May 1491
2 CONT ** Katherine Savage+ (23) b. c 1462
2 CONT ** James Savage b. c 1464
2 CONT ** Alice Savage b. c 1464
2 CONT ===Citations===
