2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 491-492.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 91.
2 CONT * 6.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 296.
2 CONT * 7.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 554.
2 CONT * 8.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 28.
