2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=pjMEAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA394&lpg=PA394&dq=dorothy+hilton+1563&source=bl&ots=V957x6rW7I&sig=QTLYEYcfE7e4_bC5Kio5BoVTfyY&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwju9suQ1vfJAhVJ2GMKHbOBBcs4FBDoAQgeMAE#v=onepage&q=dalton&f=fa
