1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Darrell Wolcott: The Shropshire Walcot Family - Chart XII: Newton Family; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id106.html. (Steven Ferry, May 12, 2020.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Thomas Stanley, of Weever''' was born in 1506. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34651043268 Thomas Stanley of Weever] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34659790494 NN Leversedge]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34713698286 NN Davenport]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625576069 Thomas Stanley, Esq., of Weever]. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Only child known was Thomas, living in 1580, who married Ursula Cholomdeley.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
