1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Thomas Venables
2 CONT * Birth:	1413 - Over, Cheshire, England
2 CONT * Death:	Oct 11 1438 - Cheshire, Lancashire, England
2 CONT * Parents:	William Venables, Blanche Venables
2 CONT * Wife:	Margery Venables (born Stanley)
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Thomas de Venables of Chester, heir 16 Hen VI.  Married  Margery, dau of Sir William Stanley of Hooton in Chester 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. William de Venables of Goldborne and Kinderton, son and heir of Thomas, had the barony and lands of Kinderton settled on him by Henry Venables, 3 Edw IV, see emboldened above.
2 CONT
