1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Bromley was born 1392 in Baddington, Nantwich, Cheshire, England, and died 1430. He was the son of John Bromley and Margery (of Tatton) Massey.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Bromley, Lord Bodington b. c 1392, d. 1436 He married Margarey Mainwaring on 1408 in Baddington, Cheshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William /Bromley/ and Margarey /Mainwaring/ are:
2 CONT # Sir (Knight) John Bromley was born 1409 in Baddington, Nantwich, Cheshire, England, and died 1488
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marjorie de Massey was born circa 1372 at of Tatton, Cheshire, England. She married Sir John Bromley, son of Richard Bromley and Anne Praers, circa 1391. Marjorie de Massey married Robert Orrell, Esq., son of Nicholas Orrell and E
2 CONC llin Stanley, after 1419.
2 CONT
