1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From:  http://willisolandergenealogy.com/9568.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Margaret Bromley===
2 CONT * Born: 1410, Bromley, London, Middlesex, England
2 CONT * Marriage: William Heckstall in 1425 in East Peckham, Kent, England
2 CONT * Died: 1434, , Cheshire, England at age 24
2 CONT * Margaret married William Heckstall, son of Richard Hexstall and Anne Grovehurst, in 1425 in East Peckham, Kent, England. 
2 CONT ** (William Heckstall was born about 1408 in Baddington, Cheshire, England and died in 1449 in Baddington, Cheshire, England.)
2 CONT
2 CONT  *********************** From:  http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/i/n/Brendan-B-Finnegan/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1166.html
2 CONT ===Margaret Bromley (b. 1410, d. 1434)===
2 CONT * Margaret Bromley was born 1410 in Bromley, England, and
2 CONT *  died 1434 in Baddington, Cheshire, England. 
2 CONT * She married William Hexstall on 1434 in Baddington, Acton, Cheshire, England.
2 CONT * More About Margaret Bromley and William Hexstall:
2 CONT * Marriage: 1434, Baddington, Acton, Cheshire, England.
2 CONT * Children of Margaret Bromley and William Hexstall are:
2 CONT **	i.	+Margaret Hexstall, b. 1434, Peckham, Kent, England, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT  ************************
