1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir William Hexstall''' [1,2,3,4] 
2 CONT * M, #65808, 
2 CONT * b. circa 1405, 
2 CONT * d. after 1449
2 CONT * Father:      Richard Hexstall b. c 1375
2 CONT * MotherL     Anne Grovehurst5 b. c 1384
2 CONT *   Sir William Hexstall was born circa 1405 at of Heckstall, Staffordshire, England.[1]
2 CONT *  He married Margaret Bromley, 
2 CONT ** daughter of William Bromley, Lord Bodington and Margery Manwaring, circa 1423. 
2 CONT * Sir William Hexstall died after 1449.
2 CONT * Family:      Margaret Bromley b. c 1408
2 CONT * Children
2 CONT ** Joane Hexstall+6,3 b. c 1424
2 CONT ** Margaret Hexstall+1,2,7,4 b. c 1445, d. b 22 Dec 1499
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations'''
2 CONT * 1.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 481.
2 CONT * 2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 566.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 119.
2 CONT * 4.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 351-352.
2 CONT * 5.[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, Family History Archives, SLC.
2 CONT * 6.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 291.
2 CONT * 7.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 213.
2 CONT * From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2190.htm#i65808
2 CONT ----
