2 CONT ===William Hexstall===
2 CONT
2 CONT * was born 1408 in Baddington, Cheshire, England, and 
2 CONT * died 1449 in Baddington, Cheshire, England. 
2 CONT * He married Margaret Bromley on 1434 in Baddington, Acton, Cheshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT * More About William Hexstall and Margaret Bromley:
2 CONT ** Marriage: 1434, Baddington, Acton, Cheshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Children of William Hexstall and Margaret Bromley are:
2 CONT **	i.	+Margaret Hexstall, b. 1434, Peckham, Kent, England, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
