2 CONT *Mother     Alice Cranage
2 CONT *'''     Robert Needham was born at of Cranage, Salop, England. He married Dorothy Savage, daughter of John Savage and Margaret Daniell. Robert Needham died between 1406 and 1407.
2 CONT *'''Family      Dorothy Savage 
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Agnes Needham+
2 CONT **Thomas Needham+ b. c 1405
