2 CONC  Tho. (m. Agnes Hope & Ann Talbott), John, Robert Needham.
2 CONT *********								Tho. Needham of Shenton ob. in vita patris. = Agnes da. to . . . .  Hope. ; ch: Agnes Needham; = Ann da. to Sr John Talbott of Grafton Kt. ; ch: Robert (m. Francis Aston), John, Margrett (m. Richard Steventon), Ma
2 CONC rgery Mary (m. Geo. Conney) Agnes (m. Sr Richard Bulkley & . . . .  Cranage), Joane, Anne Needham.
2 CONT **********									Robert Needha' of Shenton [Sheriff 1565]. = Francis da. to Sr Edward Aston of Tixall Kt. ; ch: Elizab., Mawde (m. Jo. Aston), Margery Mary (m. Thomas Onslow & Sr Rob't Vernon), Ann (m. Rob't Powell), Jane (m. Ja
2 CONC mes Collyer), Thomas (m. Mary (wid. of Sr Robert Salisbury) Bagenhall), Sr Rob't (m. Ann Doyley & Joane Lacye) Needham.
2 CONT ***********										Sr Rob't Needham of Shenton Kt Viscount Kilmory in Ireland 1624 [Sheriff 1607]. = Ann da. to . . . .  Doyley widow to . . . .  Willmott. ; = Joane da. to John Lacye of Borseton in com Som'sett. ; ch: Francess 
2 CONC (m. Sr Rowland Cotton), Robert (m. Francess Andersonne & Elianor (wid. to Gilbert [Lord] Gerrard) Dutton), Elianor (m. Sr Wm Owen) Needham.
