2 CONT Sir Robert Needham of Shenton, Sheriff of Salop, 1st Viscount Kilmorey (d 26.11.1631) - continued above
2 CONT BP1934 mentions Robert's 4 marriages but is not clear which wife was mother of Robert (the only child it mentions). Lodge (who suggests that Robert d 30.04.1627) mentions his marriages to Jane Lacy & Catherine Robinson, reporting 
2 CONC that the 1st was sp and the children were Catherine's. Visitation shows the marriages to Joane Lacye & Anne Doyley, with Joane identified as mother of Robert, Frances & Elianor. TCP confirms that there were 4 marriages and shows R
2 CONC obert as of the 1st.
2 CONT m1. Jane Lacy (d 16.07.1591, dau of John Lacy of Borston or Borseton (alderman of London))
2 CONT *1.	Robert Needham, 2nd Viscount Kilmorey (d 12.09.1653)
2 CONT * 	m1. Frances Anderson (dau of Alderman Sir Henry Anderson of London)
2 CONT ** 	A.	Robert Needham, 3rd Viscount Kilmorey (dsps 01.1657)
2 CONT ** 	m. Frances Gerard (bur 25.05.1636, dau of Gilbert Gerard, 2nd Lord)
2 CONT *** 	i.	Eleanor Needham (d 1643)
2 CONT ** 	B.	Frances Needham
2 CONT ** 	m. Thomas Cotton of Combermere (d c1648)
2 CONT ** 	C.	Elianor (Ellen) Needham
2 CONT *m2. Eleanor Dutton (b c1588, d 12.03.1657, dau of Thomas Dutton of Dutton, widow of Gilbet, Lord Gerard)
2 CONT ** 	D.	Charles Needham, 4th Viscount Kilmorey (d 1660)
2 CONT ** 	m. (27.02.1654-5) Bridget Drury (bur 11.07.1696, dau of Sir William Drury of Besthorp, m2. Sir John Shaw of London)
2 CONT *** 	i.	Robert Needham, 5th Viscount Kilmorey (b 1655, d unm 29.05.1668)
2 CONT *** 	ii.	Thomas Needham, 6th Viscount Kilmorey (b c1659, d 26.11.1687)
2 CONT *** 	m. (04.12.1679) Frances Fowler (d 27.12.1723, dau of Francis Leveson Fowler of Harnage Grange (by Anne Venables), m2. Theophilus, Earl of Huntingdon, m3. Chevalier de Ligondes)
2 CONT **** 	a.	Robert Needham, 7th Viscount Kilmorey (b 04.05.1683, d 02.10.1710)
2 CONT **** 	m. (08.1701) Mary Offley (b c1685, d 1765, dau of John Offley of Crewe by Anne, dau of John Crewe of Crewe)
2 CONT *****         (1)	Robert Needham, 8th Viscount Kilmorey (b 10.1702, d unm 19.02.1716-7)
2 CONT ***** 	(2)	Thomas Needham, 9th Viscount Kilmorey (b 29.09.1703, dsp 03.02.1768)
