2 CONT *****         (3)	John Needham, 10th Viscount Kilmorey (b 01.1710/1, d 27.05.1791, Colonel, 4th son)
2 CONT ***** 	m. (11.01.1738) Anne Hurleston (b c1708, d 09.08.1786, dau/coheir of John Hurleston of Newton, widow of Geoffrey Shakerley)
2 CONT ****** 	(A)	Thomas Needham (dvp unm 19.04.1773)
2 CONT ****** 	(B)	Robert Needham, 11th Viscount Kilmorey (b 14.11.1746, dsp 30.11.1818, 4th son)
2 CONT ****** 	m. (10.01.1792) Frances Cotton (b 01.12.1769, d 26.11.1818, dau of Sir Robert Salusbury Cotton, Bart)
2 CONT ****** 	(C)	Francis Needham, 1st Earl of Kilmorey (b 05.04.1748, d 21.11.1832, General)
2 CONT ****** 	m. (20.02.1787) Anne Fisher (d 29.10.1816, dau/coheir of Thomas Fisher of Acton by Margaret, dau of Richard Pigot of Westminster)
2 CONT *******      (i)	Francis 'Black Jack' Needham, 2nd Earl of Kilmorey (b 12.12.1787, d 20.06.1880) had issue
2 CONT ******* 	m1. (07.03.1814) Jane Cuninghame (d 23.07.1867, dau of George Gun-Cuninghame of Mount Kennedy)
2 CONT ******* 	m2. (20.11.1867) Martha Foster (dsp 06.05.1908, dau of John Foster of Lenham)
2 CONT ******* 	p. Priscilla Anne Hoste (dau of Sir William Hoste, 1st Bart, by Harriet Walpole)
2 CONT ******* 	(ii)	Anna Maria Elizabeth Needham (d 29.05.1866)
2 CONT ******* 	m. (20.06.1816) Hon. Rev. Henry Cockayne Cust (of Brownlow family)
2 CONT ******* 	(iii)	Frances Elizabeth Needham (b c1792, d 22.12.1890)
2 CONT ******* 	m. (16.06.1825) George Powell Higginson (d 19.04.1866, General)
2 CONT ******* 	(iv)	Selina Needham (d 10.01.1876)
2 CONT ******* 	m. (05.07.1817) Hon. Orlando Henry Bridgeman (b 06.05.1794, d 28.08.1827, captain)
2 CONT ******* 	(v)	Alicia Mary Needham (b 05.09.1798, d 31.01.1885)
2 CONT ******* 	m. (06.07.1836) Samuel Ellis Bristowe of Beesthorpe (b 10.03.1800, d 15.06.1855)
2 CONT ******* 	(vi)	Mabella Josephine Needham (b c1801, d 16.11.1899)
2 CONT ******* 	m. (12.02.1822) Hon. John Henry Knox (d 27.08.1872)
2 CONT *******	(vii)+	other issue - Francis Henry William (b 1799, d 24.03.1868, Lt. General), Amelia (d 25.12.1860), Georgiana (d unm 03.12.1888)
2 CONT ******        (D)	Mary Needham
2 CONT ***** 	(4)+	other issue - Francis, Anne, Mary, Elizabeth, Henrietta
2 CONT *** 	iii.	Byron Needham (a 1681)
2 CONT ** 	E.	Eleanor Needham (b c1627, d 26.01.1663/4)
2 CONT ** 	m1. (1638) Peter Warburton of Arley (dsp)
2 CONT ** 	m2. (1644) Sir John Byron, 1st Lord of Rochdale (dsp 08.1652)
2 CONT ** 	F.	Susan Needham (d 08.1667)
2 CONT ** 	m. (1652) Richard Scriven of Fordsley
2 CONT ** 	G.	Penelope Needham (d 1670)
2 CONT ** 	m. (1653) Randal Egerton of Betley (d 20.10.1681)
2 CONT ** 	H.+	other issue - George (dsp 1644), Thomas, Arthur (d infant?), Anne (d infant), Catharin (d unm 11.03.1665), Mary (a 1669, d unm), Dorothy (d unm 06.1669), Elizabeth
2 CONT *2.	Frances Needham probably of this marriage
2 CONT * 	m. Sir Rowland Cotton of Alkington (dsp 1634)
2 CONT m2. (before 14.10.1594) Anne Doyley (a 06.1607, widow of _ Wilmot)
2 CONT m3. Catherine Robinson (d 08.12.1628, dau of John Robinson of London, widow of George Huxley of Wyrehall)
2 CONT *3.	Elenor (Elianor) Needham shown by 'Suffolk Manorial Families' (p314) as of this marriage
2 CONT * 	m. Sir William Owen of Condover/Shrewsbury (d 1662)
2 CONT Mentioned (only) by Lodge as of this generation, and so not clear of which marriage (but presumably not the last), were ...
2 CONT *4.+	other issue - Alexander of Newstead, Anne (d unm), Elizabeth (d unm)
2 CONT m4. Dorothy Smith (dau of Ambrose (not Humphrey) Smith of London, widow of Benedict Barnham of London then Sir John Pakington)
