2 CONT '''     Sir William Brereton was born circa 1410 at of Brereton, Cheshire, England. He married Philippa Hulse''', daughter of Sir Hugh Hulse and Margaret Domville, '''circa 1429.2,3 Sir William Brereton died in 1484.'''
