2 CONT **	BRERETON--BARON BRERETON.
2 CONT *   SIR WILLIAM BRERETON, of Brereton, m. 1st, in 1386, Angella, dau. of Hugh Venables, and by her had issue,
2 CONT **	I. WILLIAM, d. before his father having m. Alice, sister and heiress of Richard Corbett, of Leighton, and by her (who m. 2ndly, John Stretley, Esq.,) had issue,
2 CONT ***		1 WILLIAM (SIR), successor to his grandfather,
2 CONT ***		2 .... etc.
2 CONT *Sir William d. 4th HENRY VI., and was s. by his grandson.
2 CONT *   SIR WILLIAM BRERETON, of Brereton, Knt., who m. Philippa, dau. of Sir Hugh, and sister of Thomas Hulse, and had issue,
2 CONT **	I. WILLIAM, m. Katherine, dau. of Sir John Byron, and d. s. p.
2 CONT **	II. ANDREW (SIR), of whom presently.
2 CONT **	III. John (Sir), m. 1st. Katherine, dau. of Maurice Berkeley, of Beverston, and relict of John, Lord Stourton, and by her had a dau.  and heiress, .... etc.
2 CONT **	IV. Robert.
2 CONT **	V. Roger.
2 CONT **	VI. Henry.
2 CONT **	VII. Matthew.
2 CONT **'''	VIII. Hugh, of Wimbersley, m. Anne, dau. of Robert Done.
2 CONT **	I. Elizabeth, wife of John Radcliffe, of Ordeshall.
2 CONT **	II. Jane, wife of Cotton, of Rudware.
2 CONT **	III. Eleanor, m. 1st, Thomas Bulkeley, of Eyton, and 2ndly, to Hugh Cholmondeley.
2 CONT **	IV. Matilda, wife of Thomas Needham, of Shavington.
2 CONT *The eldest surviving son,
2 CONT *   SIR ANDREW BRERETON, of Brereton, Knt., m. Agnes, dau. of Robert Legh, of Adlington, and had issue, .... etc. ______________________________
2 CONT *	'Brereton02'
2 CONT *Sir William Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT *  m. Philippa Hulse (dau of Sir Hugh Hulse)
2 CONT **	1. William Brereton of Brereton (dsp)
2 CONT **	  m. Katherine Byron (dau of Sir John Byron)
2 CONT **	2. Sir Andrew Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT **	  m1. Agnes Legh (dau of Robert Legh of Adlington)
2 CONT ***		A. .... etc.
2 CONT **	  m2. Anne Done
2 CONT **	  partner(s) unknown
2 CONT ***		K. .... etc.
2 CONT **	3. Sir John Brereton 
2 CONT **	  m1. Katherine Berkeley (dau of Maurice Berkeley of Beverston)
2 CONT ***		A. .... etc.
2 CONT **	  m2. Jane Massey (dau of Geoffrey Massey of Tatton)
2 CONT ***		B. .... etc.
2 CONT **'''	4. Hugh Brereton of Wimbersley and/or Hassall Grene (8th son)
2 CONT **'''	  m. Anne Done (dau of Robert Done, brother of Sir John)
2 CONT ***		A. Hugh Brereton of The Peele
2 CONT ****			i. .... etc.
2 CONT ***		B. Ellin Brereton
2 CONT ***		  m. Charles Manwaring of Croxton
2 CONT ***		C. Jane Brereton
2 CONT ***		  m. Roger Rawson
2 CONT ***		D. Isabel Brereton
2 CONT ***		  m1. William Cooper
2 CONT ***		  m2. _ Winnington of Offerton possibly here?
2 CONT ***		E. Anne Brereton
2 CONT ***		  m. Thomas Somerford
