1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Family and Education==
2 CONT b. by 1517, 1st s. of Leonard Poole of Sapperton by Catherine, da. of Sir Giles Brydges of Coberley; bro. of Henry Poole I. m. (1) Elizabeth (d. 18 Sept. 1543), da. of Thomas Whittington of Pauntley, at least 1s. Sir Henry†; (2) E
2 CONC leanor, da. of Edward Lewknor of Kingston Buci, Suss., wid. of Sir William Wroughton (d. 4 Sept. 1559) of Broad Hinton, Wilts., ?s.p. suc. fa. 30 Sept. 1538. Kntd. 28 Sept. 1547. d. 24 Feb. 1589.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT [http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/poole-sir-giles-1517-89 History of Parliament Online]
