2 CONT MORGAN, Sir William (1567-1652), of Tredegar and Machen, Mon.
2 CONT b. 1567,1 1st s. of '''Thomas Morgan II† of Machen and Tredegar, Mon. and Elizabeth, da. of Roger Bodenham''' of Rotherwas, Herefs. educ. Hart Hall, Oxf. 1583, Staple Inn by 1585.2 m. (1) by c.1588,3 Elizabeth, da. of Sir William 
2 CONC Wynter† of Lydney, Glos. 5s. 4/5da.; (2) settlement 10 Feb. 1610, Bridget (d. 27 Feb. 1611), da. of Anthony Morgan of Heyford, Northants., wid. of Anthony Morgan of Llanfihangel Crucorney, Mon., 1s.4 kntd. 23 July 1603.5 suc. fa. 
2 CONC aft. 1604;6 d. by 29 May 1652.7 sig. Will[ia]m Morgan.
