2 CONT *****'''				1d. Sir Thomas Throckmorton, of Totworth, co. Gloucester, Sheriff of Gloucestershire''' (d. 1586), '''mar. Margaret Whittington''', dau. and cohrss. of Thomas Whittington, of Pauntley, '''and had issue:
2 CONT ******					1e. Sir Thomas Throckmorton, of Totworth, co. Gloucester, Sheriff of Gloucestershire (d. 1607), mar. (1) Elizabeth Berkeley, dau. of Sir Richard Berkeley, of Stoke, and (2) ..... Rogers, dau. of Sir Edward Rogers, and h
2 CONC ad issue by his first wife:
2 CONT *******						1f. Sir William Throckmorton, 1st Bt.
