2 CONT * Remember, remember the fifth of November 
2 CONT * The gunpowder, treason and plot 
2 CONT * I see no reason why gunpowder treason 
2 CONT * Should ever be forgot.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Guy Fawkes, twas his intent 
2 CONT * To blow up King and parliament. 
2 CONT * Three score barrels were laid below 
2 CONT * To prove old England’s overthrow.
2 CONT
2 CONT * By God’s mercy he was catched 
2 CONT * With a dark lantern and lighted match 
2 CONT * Holler boys, holler boys, let the bells ring 
2 CONT * Holler boys, holler boys, God save the King.
