2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT *''''''Anne Throckmorton1 
2 CONT *''''''F, #176484, b. circa 1548
2 CONT *Last Edited=5 Feb 2013
2 CONT *''''''     Anne Throckmorton was born circa 1548 at Tortworth, Gloucestershire, England.3 She was the daughter of Sir Thomas Throckmorton and Margaret Whittington.1,2 She married Sir John Tracy, son of John Tracy and Elizabeth Ch
2 CONC andos, circa 1569 at Gloucestershire, England.3
2 CONT *''''''     She lived Tortworth.4 Her married name became Tracy. Glos.4
2 CONT *''''''Children of Anne Throckmorton and Sir John Tracy
2 CONT ** 1.Dorothy Tracy+1 d. c Mar 1612
2 CONT ** 2.John Tracy, 1st Viscount Tracy of Rathcoole+3 b. c 1570, d. 7 May 1647
2 CONT ** 3.Mary Tracy+3 b. 18 May 1581, d. 25 Dec 1671
2 CONT *Citations
