2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Johanna Leighton''' in 1575 in Le Cotes, Shropshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =The Visitation of Shropshire; v.29 (1889) Part II.=
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://archive.org/details/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n76/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg.353
2 CONT **Mason of Minton and Diddlebury. Pg.353-355
2 CONT * .... etc.
2 CONT *Will'us Mason de Didlebury in com. Salop. = Elizabetha soror Tho. Leighton de Watlesborough mil. & da. to Jo. Leighton. ; ch: (Pg.354 Georgius (London Marchant.), Johannes (m. . . .  Jones), Richardus (Clericus executor), . . .  
2 CONC (m. Tho. Jenkes Jenkins), Thomas (haer (m. Johanna Bawdwin)), '''Edwardus (m. Margareta Needham)''', Alicia (m. Ric'i Bedos [Beddoes?]) Mason)
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/TheVisitationOfShropshireV.29/VisitationshrophshireTaken1623_treswellVol.28P2#page/n77/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg.354
2 CONT **'''Edwardus Mason 2 fil. = Margareta filia Will'i Needham de Alderley. ; ch:''' Georgius (m. Maria Baldwin), Richardus, Thomas, Elianora (m. Rich. Hide) Mason, (Pg.355 Thomas (m. Johanna Leighton), Ankareta (m. Richardi Price) M
2 CONC ason)
2 CONT ***Georgius Mason de Didlebury 2 fil. 1623. = Maria fil. Ric'i Baldwin de Didlebury.
2 CONT ***Richardus 3.
2 CONT ***Thomas 4.
2 CONT ***Eleanora vxor Rich. Hide de Hopton Wafres in com. Salop.
