2 CONT
2 CONT * "Sir William, the elder brother of John, by Mary Massey was the eighth heir of this house, and succeeded his father Sir William, in honour and estate ; and the tenth of Richard II. he married Margery the only daughter of William
2 CONC  de Hooton, of Hooton, in the hundred of Wirral, and county of Chester ; and by her had issue a son, named William; who is stiled Lord of Stanley, Stourton and Hooton, and grand ranger of Wirral, in the county of Chester.
2 CONT *''''''Sir William the son of the aforefaid Sir William, was the ninth heir male of this honourable house, and succeeded his father in honour and estate ; and the fourth of Henry VI. he married Margery the daughter of Sir John Ard
2 CONC ern of Hardin, by whom he had issue two sons, William and John."
2 CONT *From: http://www.isle-of-man.com/manxnotebook/fulltext/hs173x/p1s01.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
