1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT Apparently from an unidentified source:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Maud Stanley married Sir John Launcelyn, son of William Lancelyn (Launcelyn). Maud Stanley died at of Storeton, Cheshire, England. She was born circa 1400 at of Hayle, Buckinghamshire, England.
2 CONT >
2 CONT >Children	
2 CONT ># Roger Launcelyn
2 CONT ># Jane Lancelyn+ married William Dormer, Esq., son of Geoffrey Dormer and Margaret, circa 1478; His 1st marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Stirnet's "Stanley01" page (link below): "probably the Maud who married ... <John Launcelyn>"
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be an unspecified date in Gujarat, India <unattested, England did not have contact with India until after this Maud's lifetime>.
2 CONT
