1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Katherine Stanley was born ABT 1408 in Hooton, Wirral, Cheshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Sir William Stanley, of Hooton and Blanche.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Ralph Arderne, of Harden Hall. Married 2) 1450 to John Hyde.
