2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ELLEN AND ROBERT WERE NOT THE PARENTS OF ISABEL LEGH WHO MARRIED LAWRENCE WARREN, HER PARENTS WERE ROBERT AND ISABEL STANLEY, THIS ROBERT WAS HER BROTHER 
2 CONT
