2 CONT *Laurence Warren of Pointon. = Margery d. to Hugh Bulkley.; ch: John (m. Isabel Stanley), Margarett (m. John Stafford) Warren.
2 CONT *John Warren of Pointon. = Isabel d. to Sr John Stanley.; ch: Lawrence (m. Isabel Ligh), John (m. Ann d. of Lord Stafford) Warren.
