2 CONT *'''Sr John Warren of Pointon. = Elizabeth d. to Sr Thomas Gerrard.; ch: Sr Lawrence (m. Margrett Ligh), Rich. (m. Katherin More), Nico' (a preist), Jerome, Rafe Warren. _____________
