2 CONT * .... The line continued on through Nicholas, whose wife was Agnes de Winnington; Sir Lawrence, who, about 1394, married Margaret Bulkeley; John, born 1414, whose wife was Isabel, daughter of Sir John Stanley of Latham, Knight of
2 CONC  the Garter, to Sir Lawrence, who, by Isabel Leigh of Adlington, had William, ancestor of Sir John Borlase Warren, of recent naval celebrity, and to '''Sir John, who, about 1480, marrying Eleanor Girard, had five sons.''' ....
2 CONT *Pg.28
2 CONT *   Among the ancestor of this Sir George was Sir Lawrence, who, in 1458, married Isabel, daughter of Robert Leigh, of Adlington, in Cheshire. William, his second son, settled in Caunton, Nottinghamshire, and from his descended Si
2 CONC r John Borlase Warren,  ....
