2 CONC d January 11, 1517. John and Eleanor’s children according to Harleison MS. 1074, Laurence, Thomas and Robert; but the Poynton pedigree lists Laurence; Richard, living in 1529, who married Catherine, daughter of John Moore, of Bank
2 CONC  House, Lancashire; Nicholas, who married Catharine Mainwaring; Jerome; Ralph; and two daughters who died without issue.  Sir John married secondly Joan or Jane daughter of Ralph Arderne of Harden.  By her he had George Warren who
2 CONC  lived at Poynton.  The estate passed to Laurence.
