1 NOTE LDS RECORDS: Individual Record FamilySearch Pedigree Resource File John Warren Compact Disc #11 Pin #112054 Sex: M Event(s): Birth: 1461/0 Place: Poynton,Cheshire,England. Death: 9 Jan 1518 Place: Ashburton,Devonshire,England Pare
2 CONC nts: Father: Lawrence Warren Disc #11 Pin #112057 Mother: Isabel Legh Disc #11 Pin #112058 Marriage(s): Spouse: Eleanor Gerard Disc #11 Pin #112055 Marriage: 1480 Place: England. 
2 CONT Sir John Warryne, knight Lord of Poynton born 1461 = Baron of Stockport of Stropforde 1489,
2 CONT Master of Lichfield Guild 1489 died January 11, 1517/18 9Hen8
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Eleanor Gerrard 1480, daughter of Sir Thomas Gerrard of Bryn Com, Lancashire. He captured Bodiam Castle for King Richard 111. He was knighted by Henry V11 on St. Bartholomews Day in Rippon, Yorkshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Other Source
2 CONT He was Knighted at Ripon in Yorks by King Henry V11, 1487
2 CONT Sir John Warryne, Kt. also was married to Joan or Jane Arderne and had 1 Child George Warren b 1516
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Gerrard born 1462 of Bryn, Com, Salop, England 5 children
