2 CONT *The eldest son and heir. 
2 CONT *   SIR WILLIAM BRERETON, of Brereton, Knt.; chief Justice and lord high marshal of Ireland, m. 1st, Alice, dau. of Sir John Savage, Knt, of Clifton, and by her had a son, .... Etc.
