2 CONC gK#v=onepage&q=brereton&f=false
2 CONT *Pg.185
2 CONT **	Pedigree
2 CONT *John Savage = Dorothy Vernon; ch: '''Alice (m. William Brereton)''' Savage.
2 CONT *'''Alice Savage = William Brereton, of Brereton.; ch:''' William (m. Anne Booth) Brereton.
2 CONT *William Brereton = Anne Booth; ch: Jane (m. Richard Clive, esq.) Brereton
2 CONT *Jane Brereton, who m. Richard Clive, esq., and from this marriage lineally descended Frances Clive, who wedded Matthew Wilson, esq. of Eshton. _________________________
2 CONT *THE WILLIAM BRERETON LINKED HERE IS UNLIKELY MARGARET (BRERETON) MOSTYN'S FATHER
2 CONT *MOSTYN, William (by 1518-76), of Mostyn, Flints. and Gloddaeth, Caern.
2 CONT *b. by 1518, 1st s. of Thomas Mostyn of Mostyn and Gloddaeth by Sian, da. of Sir William Gruffydd of Penrhyn, Caern. m. (1) by 1543, Margaret, da. of Robert ap Hywel of Whittington, Salop, 3s. inc. Thomas† 2da.; (2) Margaret, da. 
2 CONC of '''Sir William Brereton of Brereton, Cheshire'''. suc. fa. 1558.4
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/mostyn-william-1518-76 _______________________
2 CONT *THE WILLIAM BRERETON LINKED HERE IS UNLIKELY MARGARET (BRERETON) MOSTYN'S FATHER
2 CONT *MOSTYN, William (by 1518-76), of Mostyn, Flints. and Gloddaeth, Caern.
2 CONT *b. by 1518, 1st s. of Thomas Mostyn of Mostyn and Gloddaeth by Jane (or Siân), da. of Sir William Gruffydd of Penrhyn, Caern. m. (1) by 1543, Margaret, da. of Robert ap Hywel of Whittington, Salop, 3s. inc. Thomas 2da.; (2) Marga
2 CONC ret, da. of '''Sir William Brereton† of Brereton, Cheshire'''. suc. fa. 1558.
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1558-1603/member/mostyn-william-1518-76 _______________________
2 CONT *           'Brereton02'
2 CONT *Sir William Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT *  m. Philippa Hulse (dau of Sir Hugh Hulse)
2 CONT **          1. William Brereton of Brereton (dsp)
2 CONT **            m. Katherine Byron (dau of Sir John Byron)
2 CONT **          2. Sir Andrew Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT **            m1. Agnes Legh (dau of Robert Legh of Adlington)
2 CONT ***'''                    A. Sir William Brereton of Brereton (b c1483, bur 04.02.1541, Chief Justice and Lord High Marshal of Ireland)
2 CONT ***'''                   m1. Alice Savage (dau of Sir John Savage of Clifton)
2 CONT ****                              i. William Brereton (b c1500, dvp 1534)
2 CONT ****                               m. Anne Booth (dau of Sir William Booth of Dunham)
2 CONT *****                                        a. .... etc.
2 CONT ****                              ii. Sir John Brereton (dsp 1549, Constable of Wexford Castle)
2 CONT ****                                m. Jocose St. Leger
2 CONT ***'''                   m2. Eleanor Brereton (d 1570, dau of Sir Ralph Brereton of Ipstones)
2 CONT ****                              iii. Randle Brereton (d unm)
2 CONT ****                              iv. Richard (not Ralph) Brereton 
2 CONT ****                              The following is supported by Visitation (Cheshire, 1580 & 1613, Brereton of Ashley).
2 CONT ****                                m. Thomasine Ashley (dau of George Ashley of Ashley)
2 CONT *****                                        a. .... etc.
2 CONT ****                              v. Henry Brereton (Captain in Ireland)
2 CONT *****                                        a.+ issue - John, Randle (a 1594, Sheriff of Dufferin, had issue)
2 CONT ***'''                    BIFR1976 reports that "It is not clear by which marriage Sir William Brereton had his daus". Visitation shows only 1 daughter, Mary, dau of Eleanor. BE1883 shows them all as Eleanor's.
2 CONT ****                              vi. Margaret Brereton
2 CONT ****                                m1. William Goodman, Mayor of Chester (d 1554)
2 CONT ****                                m2. William Mostyn 
2 CONT ****                              vii. Katherine Brereton
2 CONT ****                                m1. Edward Fullehurst of Crewe (dsp 1525)
2 CONT ****                                m2. Roger Brereton of Woolsacre (d 1559, son of Sir Randale of Malpas & Ipstones)
2 CONT ****                              viii. Elen Brereton
2 CONT ****                                m1. Robert Dokenfield of Dokenfield (d 02.09.1548) 
2 CONT ****                                m2. William Meere of Sutton (d 03.09.1548)
2 CONT ****                              ix. Anne Brereton
2 CONT ****                                m. David Kynaston of Hanney
2 CONT ****                              x. Mary Brereton
2 CONT ****                                m. Sir John Warburton of Warburton and Arley (d 1572)
2 CONT ***                    B. Ellen Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. John Fitton of Gawsworth (d 19.02.1524)
2 CONT ***                    C. Alice Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. William Moreton (Morton) of Little Moreton
2 CONT ***                    D. Elizabeth Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m1. Philip Legh of Boothes
2 CONT ***                      m2. John Carington of Carington or Carrington
2 CONT ***                    E. Catherine Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. Thomas (not John) Smith of Hagh (Hough) 
2 CONT ***                    F. Matilda (Maud) Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. John Davenport of Davenport
2 CONT ***                    G. Johanna Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. Lawrence Dutton of Marshe
2 CONT ***                    H.+ other issue - John of Leek, Andrew, Matthew
2 CONT **            m2. Anne Done
2 CONT **            partner(s) unknown
2 CONT ***                    K. Katherine Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. William Bowyer of Knipersley (d 1540-1) 
2 CONT ***                    L. Elizabeth Brereton
2 CONT ***                      m. John Smith of Oldhaugh
2 CONT **          3. .... etc. 
2 CONT *Main source(s): BE1883 (Brereton) with some support from TCP (Brereton of Laghlin or Leighlin), Visitation (Cheshire, 1580, Brereton of Brereton), BIFR1976 (Brereton)
2 CONT *From: Stirnet.com
2 CONT *http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/brereton02.php#dau5  _______________________
2 CONT *	'Brereton03'
2 CONT *Randle Brereton of Malpas
2 CONT *  m. Alice Ipstones (dau of William de Ipstones)
2 CONT **	1. Randle Brereton of Ipstones & Malpas
2 CONT **	  m. Katherine Bulkeley (dau of William Bulkeley of Eaton)
2 CONT ***		A. Randle (Randoll) Brereton
2 CONT ***		  m. Emma (heir of John Carington of Carington)
2 CONT ****			i. Sir Randle Brereton of Ipstones, Shoclach and Malpas (a 1522, Chamberlain of Chester)
2 CONT ****			  m. Eleanor Dutton (dau of Piers Dutton of Hatton)
2 CONT *****				a. .... etc.
2 CONT *****'''				f. Elenor Brereton 
2 CONT *****'''				  m(1). Sir William Brereton of Brereton
2 CONT *****'''				This may have been the Eleanor who (also) married ...
2 CONT *****				  m2. Sir Philip Egerton of Egerton and Oulton (d 1563)
2 CONT *****				g. .... etc.
2 CONT *Main source(s): BEB1841 (Brereton of Honford (both main & supplement)), Visitation (Cheshire, 1580 & 1663, Brereton of Malpas) with support/input as reported above
2 CONT *From: Stirnet.com
