2 CONT 2nd Viscount of Kilmorey, Queen's Co & 2nd Feudal Baron of Orhera, Co Armagh, Robert Needham, 2nd Viscount Kilmorey, was born about 1591, and he died at Dutton, Cheshire, on September 12th, 1653. On his father's Inquisition Post M
2 CONC ortem, taken on October 8th, 1633, he was at least 40 at that time. (The words after "quadraginta anno" are missing, having been torn off.) 
