2 CONT *'''     Dorothy Smith was the daughter of''' Ambrose Smith.2 '''She married, thirdly, Robert Needham, 1st Viscount Kilmorey''', son of Robert Needham and Frances Aston.3 '''She married, firstly, Benedict Barnham before 1598.3 She
2 CONC  married, secondly, Sir John Pakington''', son of Sir Thomas Pakington and Dorothy Kitson, '''on 1 November 1598.3 She married, fourthly, Thomas Erskine, 1st Earl of Kellie''', son of Hon. Sir Alexander Erskine of Gogar and Margar
2 CONC et Home, '''after 1621.1 She died in 1639.4
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Needham.3 She was also known as Dorothea Smith.2 From before 1598, her married name became Barnham.3 From 1 November 1598, her married name became Pakington.3 From after 1621, her married name bec
2 CONC ame Erskine.1
