1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Mackworth, Esq. was born circa 1572 at of Sutton & Betton Grange, Shropshire, England; Age 15 in 1587.1,2,3 He married Dorothy Cranage, daughter of Lawrence Cranage, Gent. and Agnes Needham, on 29 October 1600 at of Keele,
2 CONC  Staffordshire, England; They had 1 son (Col. Humphrey, Governor of Shrewsbury) & 2 daughters (Margaret; & Agnes, wife of Richard Watts, & of Col. William Crowne, Esq.).1,2,3,4 Richard Mackworth, Esq. died on 20 May 1618.1,2,3
2 CONT
