2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Vincent Corbet, 1st Baronet (13 June 1617 – 1656) was an English lawyer and politician who sat for Shropshire in the House of Commons in the Short Parliament of 1640. He fought on the Royalist side in the English Civil War.
