2 CONT John Scribner aka Scrivener,Scrivner Born October 27, 1623 in Wem, Shropshire, England Son of Thomas Scriven and Margaret (Corbet) le Corbet Died October 2, 1675 in Dover, Strafford, New Hampshire, USA
2 CONT
