2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Joseph Daniel was the second actual settler within the bounds of Medway. He was the son of Robert Daniel, of Cambridge or Watertown. He first became identified with Medfield, becoming a townsman there in 1662. His marriage to Mary
2 CONC  Fairbanks on November 16, 1665, was the first in Medway, although that of Jonathan Adams and Elizabeth Fussell occurred the same year.
