2 CONT    or Elizabeth Latham wife of Thomas Latham Burial: 14 Oct 1719 St Peter and St Paul, Ormskirk, Lancashire, England Abode: Scarisbrick  Register: Burial 1699 - 1743, Page 149, Entry 25 Source: LDS Film 1849663 also http://www.lan
