2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Leigh, 2nd Baron Leigh of Stoneleigh was baptised on 17 June 1652.1 He was the son of Thomas Leigh and Jane FitzMaurice He married, firstly, Elizabeth Brown, daughter of Richard Brown, in April 1669.1 He married, secondly, 
2 CONC Eleanor Watson, daughter of Edward Watson, 2nd Baron Rockingham, on 25 October 1679.1 He died on 12 November 1710 at age 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Leigh, 2nd Baron Leigh of Stoneleigh succeeded to the title of 3rd Baronet Leigh, of Stoneleigh, co. Warwick [E., 1611] on 22 February 16711 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Baron Leigh of Stoneleigh, co. Warwick [E., 1643]
2 CONC  on 22 February 1671. He was educated at Christ Church College, Oxford University, Oxford, Oxfordshire, England.
2 CONT
