1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:KLFZ-1P7 FamilySearch Family Tree] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 25 2016, 15:39:23 UTC''
