1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Theophilus Hastings, 9th Earl of Huntingdon (12 November 1696 – 13 October 1746) was the son of Theophilus Hastings, 7th Earl of Huntingdon and Mary Frances Fowler. He married Lady Selina Shirley, daughter of Washi
2 CONC ngton Shirley, 2nd Earl Ferrers and Mary Levinge, on 3 June 1728. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Theophilus Hastings, 9th Earl of Huntingdon and Lady Selina Shirley
2 CONT * Francis Hastings, 10th Earl of Huntingdon b. 13 Mar 1728/29, d. 2 Oct 1789
2 CONT * Elizabeth Hastings, Baroness Hastings b. 23 Mar 1731, d. 11 Apr 1808
2 CONT * Ferdinando Hastings b. 23 Jan 1732, d. c 1743
2 CONT * Selina Hastings b. Jun 1735
2 CONT * Lady Selina Hastings b. 3 Dec 1737, d. 12 May 1763
2 CONT * Henry Hastings b. 12 Dec 1739
2 CONT * George Hastings b. 29 Mar 1740, d. c 1754
