0 @I6000000003148563231@ INDI
1 NAME Lydia /Peabody/
2 GIVN Lydia
2 SURN Peabody
2 _MARNM Perley
2 NICK Lydia Peabody Perley Howlett
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 30 AUG 1640
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hampton
3 STAE New Hampshire
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 30 AUG 1640
