3 STAE New Hampshire
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 APR 1715
2 ADDR
3 CITY Boxford
3 STAE Massachusetts
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lydia Pabodie. Born ca 1640 in Hampton, NH. Lydia was baptized in Hampton, NH, on 30 Aug 1640. Lydia died on 30 Apr 1715 in Boxford, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT * daughter of Family of Lieut. Francis Peabody & Lydia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ca 1662 Lydia first married Thomas Howlett (18326) , son of Dea. Thomas Howlett (ca 1606-1677/8) & Alice French (7194) (ca 1610-26 Jun 1666). Born ca 1637 in Ipswich, MA.5 Thomas died on 22 Dec 1667[1668] in Ipswich, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT
2 CONT # 	17398 	i. 	Mary Howlett (ca 1664-24 Oct 1727)
2 CONT # 	17399 	ii. 	Alice Howlett (ca 1666-bef Dec 1696)
2 CONT
2 CONT On 8 Jul 1667 Lydia second married Thomas Perley (1888) , son of Allen Perley (549) (ca 1608-28 Dec 1675) & Susanna Bokesen (-11 Feb 1692), in Rowley, MA. Born ca 1641 in Ipswich, MA. Thomas died on 24 Sep 1709 in Boxford, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 	6830 	i. 	Thomas Perley (24 Sep 1668-13 Nov 1745)
2 CONT * 	6831 	ii. 	Lydia Perley (Died young) (25 Jul 1672-31 Aug 1689)
2 CONT * 	6832 	iii. 	Jacob Perley (27 Feb 1674/5-Apr 1751)
2 CONT * 	6833 	iv. 	Mary Perley
2 CONT * 	6834 	v. 	Hepzibah Perley (Died young) (14 Apr 1678-2 Mar 1694/5)
2 CONT * 	6835 	vi. 	Sarah Perley (ca 1684-17 Jun 1769)
2 CONT
