2 CONT
2 CONT LYDIA PEABODY bp 30 Aug 1640 Hampton NH; died 30 Apr 1715 Boxford MA; married (1) THOMAS HOWLETT born about 1638 Ipswich MA; died there 23 Dec 1667; son of Thomas Howlett and Alice French; married (2) 8 July 1668 Thomas (*) Perley
2 CONC  born about 1641 Ipswich MA; died 24 Sep 1709 Boxford MA; son of Allen Perley and Susanna Bokeson
2 CONT
2 CONT LYDIA2  PEABODY (FRANCIS1) was born August 30, 1640 in Hampton, New Hampshire, and died April 30, 1715 in Boxford, Massachusetts.  She married (1) THOMAS HOWLETT Bef. 1663, son of THOMAS HOWLETT and ALICE FRENCH.  She married (2) 
2 CONC THOMAS PERLEY July 8, 1667 in Rowley, Massachusetts, son of ALLAN PERLEY and SUSANNAH BOKESON.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of LYDIA PEABODY and THOMAS HOWLETT is:
2 CONT
