1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [http://www.noyesgenealogy.net/getperson.php?personID=I46510&tree=noyes TNG Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 22 2017, 0:21:08 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT William Peabody, son of Francis, was born in 1646, probably in Hampton, NH. He married Hannah Hale Aug. 14, 1684. She was from Newbury,MA. They resided in Boxford, MA. William was one of the soldiers in the Narragansett Fort fight
2 CONC  in Dec. 1675. He died in Mar. 1699. She died Feb. 23, 1733.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/7547435/william-peabody Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 6 2022
2 CONC , 22:37:51 UTC''
