1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6839. Sarah Peabody. Born ca 1650. Sarah died on 29 Sep 1732.
2 CONT
2 CONT * daughter of Francis Peabody & Mary Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT On 26 Mar 1678 Sarah married Abraham Howe, son of James Howe (ca 1598-17 May 1702) & Elizabeth Dane (1611-21 Jan 1693), in Ipswich, MA. Born ca 1649 in Ipswich, MA. Abraham died on 21 Jan 1717/8 in Ipswich, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Abraham and Sarah (Peabody) Howe: 
2 CONT * Love, Increase, Samson, Abraham, Abijah, Israel, and Mark.
