1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Descendant of Mayflower passengers John and Priscilla (Mullins) Alden
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Thomas Rogers Society page on Elizabeth Pabodie:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thomasrogerssociety.com/p3.htm#i89
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Pabodie[1]
2 CONT *F, b. 24 April 1647, d. between 4 May 1677 and October 1679
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Pabodie was born on 24 April 1647 at Duxbury. She was the daughter of William Pabodie and Elizabeth Alden. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Pabodie married John Rogers, son of John Rogers and Anna Churchman, in November 1666 at Duxbury. Her married name was Rogers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Pabodie died between 4 May 1677 and October 1679. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the granddaughter of Pilgrim John ALDEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Pabodie and John Rogers
2 CONT *1. Hannah Rogers+ b. 16 Nov 1668, d. Sep 1754
2 CONT *2. John Rogers b. 22 Sep 1670, d. 2 Nov 1696
2 CONT *3. Elizabeth Rogers+ b. 16 Apr 1673, d. 23 Oct 1724
2 CONT *4. Ruth Rogers b. 18 Apr 1675, d. 28 Apr 1725
2 CONT *5. Sarah Rogers+ b. 4 May 1677, d. 19 Jan 1769 or 19 Jan 1770
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S1] Ann T. [Revised by], (Originally compiled by Alice W. A. Westgate) Reeves, Mayflower Families Through Five Generations: Descendants of the Pilgrims who landed at Plymouth, Mass. December 1620: Family of Thomas Rogers (Plymout
2 CONC h, MA: General Society of Mayflower Descendants, 2000), p. 14. Hereinafter cited as Rogers-Silver.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Her mother's Grave stone clearly reads "Elisabeth Pabodie"  PERIOD THE END OF THE SUBJECT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth's married name was Elizabeth Rogers (Pabodie)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Pabodie (Alden) mother to Elizabeth Rogers (Pabodie)  spelled her name with a "S" not a "z". It is spelled that way on her grave stone. Elisabeth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter G. Ashworth 7th Great Grandson 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The inscription on the monument of Elisabeth Pabodie in the Little Compton Cemetery, is as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Elisabeth Pabodie, daughter of the Plymouth Pilgrims, John Alden and Prisilla Mullins, the first white woman born in New England."
2 CONT
2 CONT "Here lyeth the body of Elisabeth Pabodie who dyed May ye 31st, 1717 in the 94th year of her age."
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elisabeth Pabodie and John Rodgers are:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah b. November 16, 1668
2 CONT
2 CONT John b. September 22, 1670
2 CONT
2 CONT ELIZABETH b. April 16, 1673
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth b. April 18, 1676
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah b. May 4, 1677
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I421014 
2 CONT *Name: Elisabeth Pabodie 
2 CONT *Sex: F 
2 CONT *Birth: 24 APR 1647 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts 
2 CONT *Death: BEF 1707 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref.1; AFN: 5DN0-VJ
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref.2: Genealogies of Mayflower Families 1500s-1800s- CD # 171, FTM
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref.3: First Families of America, Volume V, Lineage Records, Page 609; 9- Elisabeth (b. 1647) , m 1666, John Rogers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref.4; Clarence Almon Torrey, New England Marriages Prior To 1700 (Baltimore, MD: Genealogical Publishing Company, Inc., 1985)
2 CONT
2 CONT ROGERS, John (?1640-1732) & 1/wf Elisabeth PABODIE (1647-1679?); Nov 1666; Duxbury ) 90; Hills: Mayflower Planters 132; Putnam's Mag. 5:6; Ill. Mayflower (1925) 126; MD 5:232, 9:172, 19:192, 20:1+, 34:100; Austin's Dict. 117, 141,
2 CONC  164; Rogers (#1) 20; Tingley-Meyers 275; Dixon Anc. 37; Fales 243; French Anc. 71; Pilgrim Notes 3:84-5, 4:70; Willard-Peabody 1:11; Peabody.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref; The Compendium of America Genealogy, Volume VI, Lineage Records, Page 522; 9- Elisabeth (1649 - 78), m 1666, John Rogers (1640 - 1732; John10, Thomas11, Mayf. Pil., qv);
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: William Pabodie b: 1620 in St. Albans, Hertfordshire, England 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth Alden b: BET 1622 AND 1623 in Plymouth Colony, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 John Rogers b: 1 MAR 1639/40 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts
2 CONT *Married: 16 NOV 1666 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT *1. Hannah Rogers b: 16 NOV 1668 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts
2 CONT *2. John Rogers b: 22 SEP 1670 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *3. Elizabeth Rogers b: 16 APR 1673 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., Massachusetts
2 CONT *4. Ruth Rogers b: 18 APR 1675 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *5. Sarah Rogers b: 4 MAY 1677 in Dorchester, Suffolk Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Rogers and Elizabeth Pabodie:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Rogers+ b. 16 Nov 1668, d. Sep 1754
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rogers b. 22 Sep 1670, d. 2 Nov 1696
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Rogers+ b. 16 Apr 1673, d. 23 Oct 1724
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Rogers b. 18 Apr 1675, d. 28 Apr 1725
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Rogers+ b. 4 May 1677, d. 19 Jan 1769 or 19 Jan 1770 
