2 CONT     Mary Wiswall b: 4 OCT 1680 in Duxbury, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONT     Mercy Wiswell b: 4 OCT 1680 in Duxbury, Plymouth, MA
2 CONT     Hannah Wiswall b: 22 FEB 1682 in Duxbury, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONT     Peleg Wiswall b: 5 FEB 1684 in Duxbury, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONT     Perez Wiswall b: 22 NOV 1686 in Duxbury, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONT     Priscilla Wiswall b: 25 JUL 1690 in Duxbury, Plym., Ma
2 CONT     Deborah Wiswall b: 1695 in Plymouth, Plymouth, Mass
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: William Pabodie b: 1620 in of St. Albans, Hertford, England Mother: Elizabeth Alden b: 1625 in Plymouth Massachusetts
2 CONT
