1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==William Pabodie==
2 CONT * born on 24 Nov 1664 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., MA. 
2 CONT *  died on 17 Sep 1744. 
2 CONT * buried in Little Compton, Newport Co., RI.
2 CONT * parents: Elizabeth Alden  (1) and William Pabodie (1)
2 CONT * married: Judith Tildon in 1693. After Judith died, he married Elizabeth Throope, and then Mary Morgan Starr.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1722, May 1- Admitted a freeman of Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT ==family==
2 CONT
2 CONT William Pabodie Jr. married (1) Judith Tilden on 27 Jun 1693. Judith was born on 1 Jun 1670 in Scituate, Plymouth Co., MA. She died on 28 Jul 1714 in Little Compton, Newport Co., RI. She was buried in Little Compton, Newport Co., 
2 CONC RI.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * +	146	F	i	 Elizabeth Pabody
2 CONT * +	147	M	ii	 John Pabody
2 CONT * +	148	M	iii	 William Pabodie
2 CONT * +	149	F	iv	 Rebecca Pabodie
2 CONT * +	150	F	v	 Priscilla Pabodie
2 CONT * +	151	F	vi	 Judith Pabodie
2 CONT * +	152	M	vii	 Joseph Pabodie
2 CONT * +	153	F	viii	 Mary Pabodie
2 CONT
2 CONT William married (2) Elizabeth Throope on 20 Mar 1715/1716. Elizabeth was born in 1672 in probably Barnstable, Barnstable Co., MA. She died on 14 Dec 1717 in Little Compton, Newport Co., RI. She was buried in Little Compton, Newpor
2 CONC t Co., RI.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * +	154	M	ix	 Benjamin Pabodie
