2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: John born 4 October 1645, Elizabeth born 24 April 1647, Mary born 7 August 1648, Mercy born 2 January 1649/50, Martha born 24 February 1650/51, Priscilla born 16 November 1652-died young, Priscilla born born 15 January 1
2 CONC 653/4, Sarah born 7 August 1656, Ruth born 27 June 1658, Rebecca born 16 October 1660, Hannah born 15 October 1662, and Lydia born 3 April 1667.
