2 CONT Lydia Pabodie, in [http://www.alden.org/aldengen/pafg03.htm#9456 Alden Kindred of America Genealogy Database.] "24. Lydia Pabodie (Elizabeth Alden, John) was born on 3 Apr 1667 in Duxbury, Plymouth Co., MA. She died on 13 Jul 1748
2 CONC  in Westbrook (then Saybrook), Middlesex Co., CT. "Lydia married Daniel Grinnell before 1 Jan 1687/1688. Daniel was born about 1664 in probably Portsmouth, Newport Co., RI. He died on 17 Jan 1740/1741 in Westbrook, Middlesex Co., 
2 CONC CT."
2 CONT
