2 CONT *   PEADOBY, JOHN, Duxbury; on of the proprietors of Bridgewater, 1643; made his will 1649; names his wife Isabel; eldest son Thomas; second, Francis; youngest, William; daughter '''Annis Rouse; John, son of John Rouse'''; and Joh
