2 CONT Elizabeth first married John Rouse as his second wife, and second William Carver as his second wife.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT John Rouse. was the son of John Rouse of Marshfield (1615-1683) and Annis Peabody (Paibodie).  He was born on 28 Sep 1643 in Marshfield, MA. John died in Marshfield, MA, on 3 Oct 1717; he was 74. Buried in Winslow Cemetery, Marshf
2 CONC ield.
2 CONT
2 CONT John first married Mary Rogers, second Elizabeth Doty.  John first married Mary Rogers, daughter of John Rogers (ca 1595-3 Feb 1661) & Frances [Rogers] (-1687). Born ca 1637. Mary died bef 1674.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was mentioned in her father’s will of 1660, but unmarried at that time.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 13 Jan 1675 when John was 31, he second married Elizabeth Doty, daughter of Edward Doty (-23 Aug 1655) & Faith Clarke (ca 1617-Dec 1675), in Marshfield, MA.63 “John Rowse and Elizbeth Doety were maryed y^e 13 of January [1675]”
2 CONC . Born ca 1647 in Plymouth, MA.36 Elizabeth died on 7 Apr 1742 in Marshfield, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth first married John Rouse as his second wife, and second William Carver as his second wife.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Rouse-44
2 CONT
