1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Simon Rouse. Born on 16 Jan 1645 in Marshfield, MA.  Son of John Rouse of Marshfield and Annis Paibodie.  Simon inherited land in Duxbury, Saconet 1681, kept a house of entertainment for strangers.
