1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Anna Rouse
2 CONT * Born ca 1650 in Marshfield, MA. Anna died on 30 Nov 1715 in Rochester, MA.
2 CONT * Anna married Isaac Holmes, son of William Holmes (3 Jan 1591/2-9 Nov 1678) & Elizabeth [Holmes]. Born in Scituate, MA. Isaac died bef 1 May 1724 in Rochester, MA. Isaac was baptized in the Second Church of Scituate, in Apr 1661.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Their children include:
2 CONT # Abigail (21 Oct 1680-31 Mar 1683)
2 CONT # Ebenezer (25 Apr 1683- )
2 CONT # Cornelius (10 Nov 1688- )
2 CONT # Mercy (10 Jan 1690- )
2 CONT # Isaac Jr. (15 Apr 1693-abt. 1746)
2 CONT # Josiah Holmes (23 Jul 1696-)
2 CONT
