2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Berks LANDED GENTRY, shows this line descending from the Fitz Hardings of Upcutt near Barnstable, Northampton, England. Ancestors may have be en Maurice Fitz Harding of Brimsfield, Gloucester and Robert "The Devou t" Fitz Hardin
2 CONC g of Berkeley, Gloucester. Some genealogies lists a William Harding as the father of Richard.
2 CONT
2 CONT * There are numerous inconsistencies among the various sources as to dates and places. Some of this may be attributed to the number of persons with the same given name (Abraham, John, Richard, Robert, and Stephen).
