2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Lady Joyce
2 CONT When Lady Joyce Aston was born on 6 June 1566, in Charlecote, Warwickshire, England, her father, Sir Edward Aston Esquire, was 15 and her mother, Anne Lucy, was 15. She married Martin Culpepper on 25 February 1579, in Oldbury on t
2 CONC he Hill, Gloucestershire, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 2 January 1619, in Redditch, Worcestershire, England, at the age of 52, and was buried in Redditch Circuit, W
2 CONC orcestershire, England.
2 CONT
