2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Fielding-18
2 CONT
2 CONT A pedigree in The Antiquities of Warwickshire[1] shows Sir Roger Fielding, son of Basil Fielding, ob 30 Dec 1643 married to Elizabeth Neale dau of Sir Thomas Neale Com Hant, having nine children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Basil b 24 Sep 1622;
2 CONT # George b 7 Dec 1623; 
2 CONT #Elizabeth b 21 Feb 1625; 
2 CONT #Susanna 20 Apr 1627; 
2 CONT #William b 9 Jul 1629; 
2 CONT #Brigette b 29 Sep 1631; 
2 CONT # Goodeva b 27 Apr 1633; 
2 CONT #Dorothy b 7 May 1635; 
2 CONT # Frances b 20 Jul 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT No sign of a son Edward who in any event is documented as coming from the Horton, Gloucestershire and Bristol family.
2 CONT
2 CONT But whilst this pedigree evidences that his wife was Elizabeth Neale it wasn't the Elizabeth Neale daughter of John Neale.
