1 NOTE {geni:about_me} THOMAS BOULDINGE was born about 1546 in BARFORD, WARWICK, ENGLAND. He was christened on Oct 22 1548 in BARFORD, WARWICK, ENGLAND. He died on Feb 11 1587 in BARFORD, WARWICK. He was buried on Feb 11 1587 in BARFORD,
2 CONC  WARWICK, ENGLAND. Thomas Bowlding II was born in Barford in 1546. After his fathers death in 1562 he continued to farm the family land and leaseholds, living the same simple style as did his father. Not vested with title to prope
2 CONC rty by his father's will, his brother John, the first-born was now the owner of the lands according to the laws of "primogeniture." He married in 1578 to Elinor Aston and had a son, Thomas, born about 1584 in Barford, Warwick, Eng
2 CONC land. There may have been more children born to this marriage, but records do not indicate any. He was married to ELINOR ASTON on Nov 27 1578 in STRATFORD ON AVON, WARWICK, ENGLAND.
