1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/2Z37-2D1/judith-ticken-1607-1666
2 CONT >>When Judith Ticken was born in 1607, in Colyton, Devon, England, United Kingdom, her father, Samuel Ticken, was 22 and her mother, Judith Chauncy, was 19. She married John Whicker on 16 September 1632, in Colyton, Devon, England
2 CONC . They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 19 January 1666, in her hometown, at the age of 59, and was buried in Colyton, Devon, England.
