2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 26 JUL 1704
2 PLAC Appomattox
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LCRW-4XM/thomas-oscar-whicker-1652-1704
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=b25jonesp&id=I1266:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was the first Whicker to arrive in America. He arrived 1 Dec 1685. His will dated 4 Apr 1704 and written in Westmoreland Co, VA and was proved 26 Jul 1704. He had two wives, names unknown. Wife #1 died apparently by 1690 an
2 CONC d Thomas married wife #2 in 1690 shortly after the death of wife #1. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: 1.Title: The New Wicker/Whicker Family by Richard Fenton Wicker, Jr. Gateway Press 1997 Repository:  Media: Book Page: 27 Text: #60 
