1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/48KB-4YL
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mariam
2 CONT '''
2 CONT When Mariam Bogue was born on 11 March 1716, in Perquimans, North Carolina, British Colonial America, her father, William Bogue II, was 53 and her mother, Elinor Perisho, was 42. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gideon Bundy on 6 August 1739, in Perquimans, North Carolina, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 March 1762, in Pasquotank, North Carolina, British Colonial America, at the age of 46, and was buried in Pasquotank, North Carolina, British Colonial America.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/170856362/miriam-bundy Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 4 2022, 8:07:50 UTC'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT Miriam and Gideon were married 3 Aug 1739 at Perquimans Co, NC, and they were the parents of:
2 CONT Lydia/2 Oct 1740 (Mrs Obediah Small)
2 CONT Samuel/27 Oct 1742 m. Huldah Hill
2 CONT Sarah/4 Aug 1745 (Mrs Jonathan Pearson)
2 CONT Jehu "John"/14 Jan 1748 m. Lydia Griffin
2 CONT Miriam/27 Oct 1753
2 CONT Christopher/20 Apr 1758 m. Margaret Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT Her parents were William Bogue and Eleanor Perisho.* Reference: 
