1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Edward Mayo, Jr.''' was born in 1676 in Albemarle County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-83997555 Edward Mayo] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101598 Sarah Mayo]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward married [https://www.geni.com/profile-12984156 Mary Mayo Newby] on April 3, 1709 in Perquimans, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530827 Ann Newby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-78561574 Elizabeth Wilson];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34633437945 Joseph B. Mayo, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34747092578 Elizabeth] in 1702. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 16, 1724, in Pasquotank County, North Carolina, United States, and was buried in Pasquotank, North Carolina, United States.
2 CONT
