2 CONC y Mayo Newby (Clare), (twin)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740162659 Rev. Samuel Newby] in 1729 in Perquimans County, North Carolina as his first wife. Samuel Newby was the son of Gabriel Newby and Mary Toms, and was born about 1708. Together th
2 CONC ey had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530825 Jemima Newby]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530824 Isabell Newby]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530826 Edward Newby]. 
2 CONT Ann died 1739.
