1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Joseph Newby''' was born on September 27, 1693 in Perquimans County, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-58767063 Gabriel Newby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-70530725 Mary Newby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph married [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538266 Elizabeth Newby] circa March 1, 1715 in Pasquotank County, NC, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538274 Gabriel Newby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538276 Joseph Newby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-33933777 Mary Wilson];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538277 Elizabeth Mayo];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538278 Josiah Newby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750077321 Miryam Newby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538279 Benjamin Newby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph married [https://www.geni.com/profile-12984156 Mary Mayo Newby] on May 8, 1748, in Perquimans County, North Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph married [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538094 Patience Newby] on December 15, 1749. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1768 in Perquimans County, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Joseph married [https://www.geni.com/profile-20538094 Patience Newby] on December 15, 1749. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1768 in Perquimans County, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Joseph Newby Sr., son of Gabriel Newby and Mary Ann Toms, was born 27 September 1693; died before 1777.
2 CONT
2 CONT # He was married/1 on March 1, 1715, to Elizabeth Nixon, daughter of Zachariah Nixon and Elizabeth Page. (See Nixon Family, Part II)  
2 CONT # He was married/2 Mary (Clare) Mayo;  
2 CONT # married/3 on 15 December 1749/50 Patience Jordan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The birth order of the children is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # Gabriel Newby, born in Perquimans County; married 5 December 1787, to Pleasant White (she may be the daughter of John White III and Lydia Winslow (See White 2 Family, Part VIII)
2 CONT # Joseph Newby, Jr, born about 1730
2 CONT # Benjamin Newby, married 1 March 1775, to Sarah Lily
2 CONT # Josiah Newby
2 CONT # Elizabeth Newby, married 1743 Joseph Mayo, son of Edward May and Mary Clare
2 CONT
