2 CONT Brief Life History of John'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Winslow was born on 9 December 1717, in Pasquotank, Pasquotank, North Carolina, British Colonial America, his father, Thomas Winslow, was 38 and his mother, Elizabeth Clare, was 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Ann Pearson on 20 September 1740, in Nansemond, Virginia, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He lived in Perquimans, North Carolina, United States in 1790 and Pasquo
2 CONC tank, North Carolina, United States in 1800. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 December 1754, in Pasquotank, Pasquotank, North Carolina, British Colonial America, at the age of 37.
