2 CONT Brief Life History of John'''
2 CONT
2 CONT John Perry was born about 1740, in Perquimans, North Carolina, British Colonial America as the son of Jacob Perry and Hepsabeth Perry. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Griffin in 1757, in Perquimans, North Carolina, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT William b. 1758
2 CONT Jacob b. 1759
2 CONT Mary b. 1761
2 CONT Nancy Ann b. 1762
2 CONT Sallie b. 1768
2 CONT Noah b. 1775
2 CONT John b. 1777
2 CONT Bethany b. 1780
2 CONT [Site indicates other duplicate entries for Bethany, William, and Mary that appear to be erroneous].
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in December 1789, in Martin, North Carolina, United States, at the age of 50.
2 CONT
