2 CONT * Virginia Cousins: A Study of the Ancestry and Posterity of John Goode of ... By George Brown Goode. Page 50-A & B [https://books.google.com/books?id=ojBMAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA50-IA4&lpg=PA50-IA4&dq=John+Collier+of+Porto+Bello,&source=bl
2 CONC &ots=WGwBQTROoT&sig=ACfU3U2WTa1PtWpYnnbnfz3u1iQ8N4XuMA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjM7O6V4K_hAhVGCTQIHWvkCPkQ6AEwB3oECAkQAQ#v=onepage&q=John%20Collier%20of%20Porto%20Bello%2C&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT *[https://www.myheritage.com/person-84010094_288715761_288715761/john-capt-collier-sr?ignoreFromPhone=1 MyHeritage Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 7 2018, 2:19:33 UTC''
