2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Seen as daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Isaac-Collier-Sr/6000000002348802081?through=6000000003747236415 & https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Collier/6000000002348802218?through=6000000003747236415
2 CONT
2 CONT She is listed in the will of Isaac Collier 1777:
2 CONT
2 CONT “ITEM I give to my daughter Judith Hicks one Negro Girlnamed Eady and her increases forever.”
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore, she was not the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Capt-John-Collier-of-Porto-Bello/6000000004581487480?through=6000000132834681821 & https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Collier/6000000000700974236?through=60000001328
2 CONC 34681821 as seen at https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Judith_Collier_%281%29 Citing http://www.curtisit.com/curtis/colyer/wgo3.html#I238
2 CONT
2 CONT Collier, Judith (1737 - ) - female b. 1737 father: Collier, John (1685 - 1735) mother: Eppes, Nancy Anne (1695 - 1765) spouse: Hicks, James (*1733 - )
2 CONT
2 CONT She is not listed at http://files.usgwarchives.net/nc/statewide/bibles/colier01.txt as a child of John Collier and Anne Eppes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Isaac Collier and Anne Vines
