1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.ancestry.com/boards/thread.aspx?mv=flat&m=150&p=localities.northam.usa.states.kentucky.aths
2 CONT
2 CONT >SHELTON/CHILTON. Thomas Shelton, Jr. (26 May 1763, Va. - 20 August, 1857 Brandon, Miss.) is believed to have married (1st) Sarah BARKSDALE, then (2nd) possibly [Sarah or Susan] HEWLITT or HULLETT as claimed in a DAR application, 
2 CONC though this seems unlikely, then (3) Phebe Ann Hatcher MARSHALL, widow of Peter COUSINS, in 1809 in Halifax Co., Va., then (4) Sarah CRUMP in 1834 in Franklin Co., Va.. He raised and married off most of his children in Pittsylvani
2 CONC a Co., Va., before following a son-in-law to Rankin Co. Miss, where he died a widower at age 94, naming twelve children in his will.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=177864531-1-10054&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-8bbedbb0fb9152c318d8c12bfa420d6c&mrid=98d18fea9d978b6efc491955ef722efc MyH
2 CONC eritage Family Trees] via daughter [http://www.geni.com/profile-34672205188 Martha Gardner (born Shelton)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 8 2015, 11:26:11 UTC''
2 CONT *https://www.ancestry.com/boards/thread.aspx?mv=flat&m=150&p=localities.northam.usa.states.kentucky.aths
