2 CONC d an Allen). Also named are Collier's brothers "John and Hickson Barksdale"; witnesses were William Holt & Thomas Barksdale. No indication of Sarah's maiden name. Collier Barksdale's Charlotte County will, dated 1 July 1766, was p
2 CONC roved "3 Oct 1774 & 7 Nov 1774"[5]
