2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary
2 CONT When Mary Ellis was born on 18 April 1719, in Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts, United States, her father, Eleazer Ellis Jr., was 26 and her mother, Mary Crosby, was 19. She married Ralph Day on 26 April 1739, in Dedham, Suffolk, Ma
2 CONC ssachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters.
