2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Torrey (NEHGR 120:269) says that Amos Gates was probably born in Stow about 1706 and that he married (2) '''Deborah Thayer Rockwood''', widow of John Rockwood of Mendon, Massachusetts, to whom was granted administration of his est
2 CONC ate (apparently insolvent).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of the second marriage were ...  Deborah Gates (1762-1836), who married her mother's stepson, '''Stephen Parmenter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Found as daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Capt-Ebenezer-Thayer-Sr/6000000002930991686?through=6000000003939209575 Capt. Ebenezer Thayer] who died in 1723 (before Deborah's birth).  Disconnected Feb 2014
2 CONT
