1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LVPD-ZM7 FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 22 2021, 17:27:46 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Brief Life History of Darcus===
2 CONT
2 CONT When Darcus Wood was born on 4 October 1694, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Solomon Wood, was 25 and her mother, Mary Haseltine, was 22. She married Deacon John Chapin in 1718
2 CONC , in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 22 August 1767, in her hometown, at the age of 72, and was buried in Worcester, Massac
2 CONC husetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
