2 CONT Brief Life History of Dorcas
2 CONT
2 CONT When Dorcas Chapin was born on 2 September 1720, in Mendon, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Deacon John Chapin, was 22 and her mother, Darcus Wood, was 25. She married Benjamin Thurston on 
2 CONC 15 October 1768, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States. She died on 19 August 1792, in Grafton, Grafton, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 71, and was buried in Grafton, Grafton, Worcester, Massac
2 CONC husetts, United States.
