2 CONT LC3B-9LH
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Solomon
2 CONT When Solomon Chapin was born on 4 June 1733, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Deacon John Chapin, was 35 and his mother, Darcus Wood, was 38. He married Joanna White on 28 May 1
2 CONC 754, in Mendon, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 3 daughters. He registered for military service in 1778. He died on 13 May 1813, in New Marlborough, Berks
2 CONC hire, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 79, and was buried in Old Mill River Cemetery, New Marlborough, Berkshire, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
