1 NOTE {geni:about_me} CHLOE TAFT / 1753 - 1843
2 CONT
2 CONT Born June 7, 1753 in Uxbridge (Worcester County), Massachusetts.  Chloe Taft married a cousin, Robert Taft (1749 - 1821), on February 3, 1771 in Uxbridge, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert and Chloe Taft were parents to ten children -- 1.) Hannah Taft / 1772 - 1802, 2.) Lydia Taft / 1774 - 1847, 3.) Josiah Taft / 1776 - 1845, 4.) Abigail Taft / 1778 - 1850, 5.) Jesse Taft / 1782 - 1869, 6.) Chloe Taft / 1786 
2 CONC - 1809, 7.) Robert Taft / 1788 - 1865, 8.) Maria Taft / 1791 - 1848, 9.) Bezaleel Taft / 1795 - 1866, and 10.) Chapin Taft / 1797 - 1887.
2 CONT
2 CONT Chloe Taft outlived her husband, Robert Taft, by two decades and passed away on October 17, 1843 in West Bloomfield (Ontario County), New York.
