1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LHC7-VSZ/martha-thayer-1723-1799
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Thayer
2 CONT Female
2 CONT about 1723–29 January 1799
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Martha
2 CONT
2 CONT When Martha Thayer was born about 1723, in Douglas, Worcester, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Josiah Joseph Thayer II, was 30 and her mother, Elizabeth Ingalls, was 27. She married Samuel Humes on 
2 CONC 7 December 1743, in Uxbridge, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 29 January 1799, in Douglas, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 77.
