2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of Josiah Thayer Jr. and Elizabeth (Ingalls) Keith
2 CONT Sister of John Lewis [half], Job Thayer, Elizabeth (Thayer) Archer, Martha (Thayer) Humes, Josiah Thayer and Mercy Thayer
2 CONT Wife of William Jefferson — married 1 Aug 1740 in Glocester, Providence, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Elizabeth (Jefferson) Coombs, William Jefferson, Rachel (Jepherson) Thayer, Sarah (Jepherson) Herendeen, Mary (Jepherson) Herendeen, Hannah (Jefferson) Sherman, Aaron Jepherson Sr., Mercy (Jepherson) Kelly, Moses Jephers
2 CONC on and Seth Jepherson
