1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Kingsley, son of John Kingsley and Sarah (Sabin) Kingsley, was born on 26 Feb. 1694 at Rehoboth, Bristol County, Massachusetts.[1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Bass, daughter of John Bass and Elizabeth (Neale) Bass, on 25 Dec. 1717 at Windham, Connecticut.[3][1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John and Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT # Jonathan b. 24 Dec. 1718. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT # Ebenezer. 17 Oct. 1720. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT # Jerusha. 17 Sep. 1723. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT # Abigail. b. 14 Oct. 1725. Windham, Connecticut.[3] 
2 CONT # Sarah. b. 6 Sep. 1727. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT # Joanna. b. 3 Sep. 1729. Windham, Connecticut.[3] 
2 CONT # Enock. b. 10 Oct. 1730. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT # Ann b. 9 Nov. 1731. Windham, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT
