1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Abigail Kingsley''', of Pomfret, Connecticut married as his second wife (intention dated November 6, 1762)  to Daniel, son of Thomas Mighill (born about 1710; died in 1777.) He was known in some records as '''Da
2 CONC niel Mighill.''
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Miles, widow of Daniel Miles, married, May 16, 1786, David Sanderson at Petersham. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Daniel Miles & Abigail:
2 CONT * 9. Dana, January 22, 1764. 
2 CONT * 10. Benjamin, November 1, 1768.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://books.google.com/books?lpg=PA639&dq=daniel+miles+1762+abigail+kingsley&pg=PA638&id=ofcsAAAAYAAJ&ots=0zyU-d5sAN#v=onepage&q=daniel%20miles%201762%20abigail%20kingsley&f=false New England Families, Genealogical and Mem
2 CONC orial:] A Record of the ..., Volume 2 edited by William Richard Cutter.  "Miles."  Pages 638-639
2 CONT
2 CONT He was an early settler at Nichewaug, afterward Petersham, Worcester county, Massachusetts. He was there as early as 1740, when the birth of a daughter is recorded. Daniel Miles and Nehemiah Coy, of Nichewaug, deeded to Aaron Whit
2 CONC ney a lot originally drawn by Edward Houghton in Nichewaug, October 2, 1745. Daniel Miles, of Nichewaug, John Williams, of Pomfret, and Thomas Miles, of Canterbury, Connecticut, deeded to Joseph Hinds and Silas Bennett, of Shrewsb
2 CONC ury, land at Nichewaug, being the whole of the right of Ephraim Houghton, except a house lot and two divisions laid out previously, by deed dated April 2, 1751. The mother of Daniel may have been a Houghton. Daniel Miles bought la
2 CONC nd in Petersham, March 19, 1762, of Dennis Lockley, of Templeton, Massachusetts. Daniel Miles deeded land at Petersham to his son Daniel in 1771. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His will was dated June 10, 1771, bequeathing to children, Daniel, Joab, Dana, Benjamin, Joanna, Susanna, Patience and Freedom. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * ''John2 Mighill of Mass, N.H., and Conn., by Gale Ion Harris''.  The New England Historical and Genealogical Register. Boston, MA: New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1847-. (Online database: AmericanAncestors.org, New En
2 CONC gland Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2018.). 158, July 2004.  Page 364 -[https://www.americanancestors.org/DB202/rd/11710/364/23504884 AmericanAncestors], [https://photos.geni.com/p13/31/d0/05/b0/5344485f345c56f5/family_of_da
2 CONC niel_mighill_miles_original.pdf Geni document].'' “His surname is '''Mighill''' in Pomfret records and '''Miles''' in Petersham records.”''
2 CONT
