2 CONC l and Memorial:] A Record of the Achievements of Her People in the Making of Commonwealths and the Founding of a Nation, Volume 2 (Google eBook) William Richard Cutter.  Lewis historical publishing Company, 1913 - New England.  Pa
2 CONC ge 638.  "Miles."  III) Samuel, son of John (2) Miles, was born at Swansea, or vicinity, in 1689. He removed to Pomfret. Connecticut. He married and had sons, Thomas, Daniel, mentioned below. (Wrong parents for this Daniel.)
