1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joanna KIngsley, daughter of John and Elizabeth (Bass) Kingsley was born 3 Sep. 1729 in Windham, Windham County, Connecticut.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married David Stoddard about 1750.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Nathaniel French about 1780.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna died 9 Sep. 1800 at Brattleboro, Windham County, Vermont and was buried at Locust Ridge Cemetery, Brattleboro, Vermont. Her memorial has a photo of her headstone with the Inscription: "In Memory of Mrs. Joanna, consort of M
2 CONC r. Nathaniel French, died Sept 9, 1800, age 72 yrs."[3]
2 CONT ----
