1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=9976808 '''Eldad Kingsley'''] Find A Grave Memorial# 9976808 Eldad Kingsley was born on 8 January 1707 at Windham, Windham County, Connecticut. He was the so
2 CONC n of John Kingsley and Sarah Sabin. Eldad Kingsley married Priscilla Bass on 20 June 1733 at Windham, Windham County, Connecticut. Eldad Kingsley died on 20 January 1787 at Lebanon, New London County, Connecticut, at age 80. [From
2 CONC  MF] John Bass of Windham CT, in his will written 16 Apr 1752, probated 15 Oct 1753, named Priscilla wife of Eldad Kingsley as one of his daughters. Priscilla Kingsley was admitted to the Scotland Cong'l Church 1 Nov 1741 and chil
2 CONC dren Oliver, Eunice and Lydia were bapt. there 8 Nov 1741. No probate record for Eldad or Priscilla appears in Windham CT District, which included Lebanon in 1787. Both Eldad & his wife Priscilla are buried in Scoville and Bucking
2 CONC ham Cemetery, Lebanon, CT. The first five of their children were born in Windham, CT, the others in Lebanon, CT. 
