2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Draper was born 29 Oct 1703 In Roxbury, Massachusetts. He is the son of Jonathan Draper and Sarah Jackson [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He Married Mary Darling (Daughter of John Darling and Elizabeth Morse) 29 May 1828 in Bellingham, Massachusetts [3] They had the following children: Jonathan Draper b. 1730, Mary Draper b. 1735 and Rachel Draper b. 1739 [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Died in 1764 Bellingham, Mass[5]
