1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Samuel Smith was born in either Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts or Needham, Suffolk, Massachusetts to John Smith 1655 – 1722 and Abigail Day Smith 1661-1725. Samuel married Zepporah Morse May 30, 1722 and they had t
2 CONC hree documented children, Samuel, Lydia Smith Dexter 1735-1825, and Joshua 1743-1764. Wyndam County records in Ashford show both Samuel and Zepporah as buried in the Old Ashford Cemetery, Ashford, Windham County, Connecticut.
