1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elijah Esq., son of Henry and Jemima (Morse) Adams, b. in Medfield, Nov. 14, 1743; m. 1766, Abigail Chenery, b. March 12, 1747, d. May 12, 1824. He inherited the homestead in Medfield, Mass.; was selectman, justice
2 CONC  of the peace and a prominent citizen; d. April 4, 1823. (A genealogical history of Henry Adams, of Braintree, Mass., 1898) 
