2 CONT Ruth (Hill) Holbrook (abt. 1696 - 1747)
2 CONT Born about 1696 [uncertain] in Sherborn, Middlesex, Province of Massachusetts Bay  [uncertain]
2 CONT Died 12 May 1747 at about age 51 in Grafton, Worcester, Province of Massachusetts Bay 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Tree of Ruth (Hill) Holbrook
2 CONT
2 CONT RUTH
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Holbrook formerly Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Eleazer Hill and Sarah (Breck) Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Eleazer Hill, Sarah Hill, Solomon Hill, Nathaniel Hill and Moses Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Holbrook Jr. — married 13 Mar 1718 in Sherborn, Massachusetts  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of William Holbrook, Silence (Holbrook) Goodale, Ruth (Holbrook) Eames and Sarah (Holbrook) Mellen
