1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Love was the daughter of Martha (Morse) and Jonathan Perry. She married John Phillips, also of Sturbridge, on May 19, 1785 when she was 17. They farmed 185 acres of land and had a two-story building that confirmed 
2 CONC the Phillips's status among the respectably prosperous. By 1830 the farm boasted a sawmill, 3 horses, two pair of working oxen, 1 milk cow, 49 sheep, and a carriage.  Love had 9 children, 7 of whom survived to adulthood. She and h
2 CONC er husband were married for 64 years. She was 82 years old.
2 CONT Their known children were:
2 CONT Edwardus, John Jr., Harvey(Hervey), Jonathan Perry Phillips, Daniel, Eldridge, Mary and Adeline.
