2 CONT -------
2 CONT Parents: John Cutter and Rachel Powers<br/>
2 CONT John' (Ephraim', Richard', Elizabeth'), b. Watertown, July 23, 1700;d. Nov. 20, 1747 ; m. Rachel Powers, who survived him and married Barnabas Davis of Littleton, Mass. John followed his father's trade of a glazier, and lived at L
2 CONC exington and at Woburn. Four of his nine children settled in New Ipswich.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Susanna Hastings Nov 16, 1749<br/>
2 CONT '''*She survived him and married Simeon Gould (2), and died at Jaffrey, Aug. 5, 1827'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: John, Joseph, Moses, Benjamin, Susanna, Moses, David, Rachel, Sarah, Rachel, Benoni.
