2 CONT ----
2 CONT Bethia Williams was born on 1 November 1716 at Taunton. She was the daughter of Nathaniel Williams and Lydia King. Bethia Williams married Noah Williams, son of Samuel Williams, on 23 March 1737 at Taunton. Bethia Williams died be
2 CONC tween 26 May 1742 and 21 January 1746. Children of Bethia Williams and Noah Williams
2 CONT
2 CONT # Noah Williams
2 CONT # Bethia Williams
