1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She married, first, on May 23,1751, Col.Ebenezer Battelle Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, second, as his second wife at Dedham,MA on Jul 3,1777, Joshua Whiting.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, third, as his third wife on Sep 1,1784 at Dedham,MA, Major Jonathan Day, and they removed to Oxford,MA. He died in Oxford,MA on Jan 4,1802. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by first marriage): Prudence Battelle, Ebenezer Battelle III, Prudence Battelle Stow, Abigail Battelle, Sarah Battelle Newell, Joseph Battelle, Lucy Battelle Everett, and Anna "Dolly" Battelle Fisher.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by second marriage): Hannah Whiting.
2 CONT
