1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hill-39022
2 CONT Samuel Hill (1707 - abt. 1789)
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Hill
2 CONT Born 11 Jan 1707 in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of Samuel Hill and Rachel (Adams) Hill
2 CONT Brother of Joshua Hill and Experience (Hill) Harding
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Fisher) Hill — married 1 Mar 1733 in medway, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Miriam (Hill) Ellis
2 CONT Died about Nov 1789 at about age 82 in Medfield, Suffolk, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Halsey Bullen private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 3 Aug 2021 | Created 4 Jul 2020
2 CONT This page has been accessed 117 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel was born to Samuel and Rachel Adams Hill in Medfield on 11 Jan 1706-7[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Hill married Mary Fisher in Medway 1 Mar 1732-3.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel died in Medway in Feb 1789. His wife Mary had died on 7 Mar 1774.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel and Mary Hill had, in Medway:[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, b. 15 Feb 1733-4, m. John (or David?) Brick, 20 apr 1758
2 CONT Samuel, b. 10 May 1736, d. 25 May 1815, a. 79, m. Abigail Richardson in 1766, then Kezia Wheeler in 1772.
2 CONT Timothy, b. 16 Dec 1740, d. 28 Nov 1812, in 72 y, m. Mary Bullard in 1766, then Edene Pond in 1799
2 CONT Keziah, b. 2 Feb 1742-3, m. Daniel Hobbs, 26 Dec 1763
2 CONT Miriam, b. 27 Feb 1745-6, perhaps m. Jesse Ellis 15 Dec 1779
2 CONT Moses, b. 25 Jan 1748, m. Katherine Holbrook, 14 Sep 1775
2 CONT Silence, b. 16 Feb 1752
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Norfolk, Vital Records of Medfield, Massachusetts, to the year 1850, Births, p. 61-62
