2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Morse was born in 1765. He is the son of Henry Morse and Esther Pidge. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He first married Susanna Fish on Dec 31, 1789. [1] They were married in Swanzey. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Second he married the widow of Benjamin Frost of Marlborough (b. 1772; died April 28, 1835). [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry died on August 2, 1825. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mrs. Frost: [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles
2 CONT Charlotte
2 CONT Phebe
2 CONT Mrs and Mrs. Morse had: [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry
2 CONT Susanna
2 CONT Harriet
