2 CONC e of three others who paid him to serve in thier places. He served in NC,SC and Ga. and was in the Battle of Slippery Ridge. He widow claimed and received a widow's pension when she was in her 70's. This info comes from Robert Lee
2 CONC  Bullard . [Note from Shirley Mofield James Bullard born England and his wife Sarah Pittman Bullard according to family records for this Bullard family had a son William Bullard born about 1787] •  Death: Apr 1832 in Robeson, Nort
2 CONC h Carolina, United States  •  Birth: 1750 in Ire, North Carolina, United States  •  Name: James Bullard 
