2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mary Barber was born on 23 September 1740, in Worcester, Massachusetts, United States, her father, John Barber, was 26 and her mother, Lydia Stimpson, was 18. She married Jonathan Bullard Jr on 16 November 1761. They were the
2 CONC  parents of at least 7 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 31 December 1834, in Hancock, Hillsborough, New Hampshire, United States, at the age of 94, and was buried in Pine Ridge Cemetery, Hancock, Hillsborough, New Hampshire, Unit
2 CONC ed States.
