2 CONT Samuel Daniels (1720 - 1809)
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Daniels
2 CONT Born 8 Jun 1720 in Medway, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of Samuel Daniel and Experience (Adams) Daniel
2 CONT Brother of Timothy Daniels, Nathan Daniel, John Daniels, Simeon Daniels, Reuben Daniels [half], Sarah (Daniels) Force [half], Mary Daniels [half], Japheth Daniels [half] and Abijah Daniels [half]
2 CONT Husband of Hannah (Hill) Daniels — married 7 Jan 1743 (to 23 Nov 1809) in Medway, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Aaron T. Daniels
2 CONT Died 23 Nov 1809 at age 89 in Keene, Cheshire, New Hampshire, USAmap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Kevin Daniel private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 2 Oct 2020 | Created 11 Sep 2011
2 CONT This page has been accessed 564 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Daniels was born in Medway, Massachusetts on June 8, 1720. He was son of Samuel and Experience. [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah Hill in Medway, Massachusetts on 7 Jan 1743. [3] The marriage intention is also recorded in Sherborn, Massachusetts on 7 Jan 1742. [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT They moved to Keene, New Hampshire, date unknown, and there are two children listed in the Keene records. [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethia Feb 14, 1762
2 CONT Aaron Dec 10, 1765
2 CONT Samuel died in Keene, New Hampshire on Nov 23, 1809. He was 89 years old. [6]
2 CONT
