2 CONT 21.  SHEFFIELD DANIELS was born August 21, 1787 in Keeney, Cheshire Co. NH, and died 1855 in White Plains, NY.  He married ABIGAIL WARREN 1815 in Springfield, MO., daughter of DANIEL WARREN and SARAH LORD.  She was born February 2
2 CONC 3, 1800 in New Gloucestor, Cumberland Co. ME., and died February 25, 1881 in Wanship. Summit Co. Utah.
