1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Stephen Bennett 1681 – 1747 and Mercy Merrifield 1700 – 1775.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Before   1731 9 May 
2 CONT     Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT     Bp date 1731 Bennet: Joseph s Stephen and Mercy bp 9 May 1731; Ipswith VR page 37 (Note the younger Joseph died 1731)
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism
2 CONT     1731 9 May 
2 CONT     Ipswich, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Sarah Morse
2 CONT     1754 30 Nov Age: 23
2 CONT     Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT     Morss: Sarah Mrs, of Holliston, and Joseph Bennet, int. Nov 30 1754 Ipswitch VR page 314 http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Ipswich/Images/Ipswich_M314.shtml 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Morse was the daughter of Paul Morse 1700 – 1760 and Sarah Sheffield 1708 – 1806. She married Joseph Bennett 1731 –. They had three children recorded in Ipswitch:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Sarah Sally Bennett 1755 – 1810 unmarried
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Stephen Bennett 1758 –
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Hannah Bennett 1761 – 1829 married Enoch Burnham 1760 – 1802
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Morse Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT 1733 25 Mar Holliston, Middlesex, Massachusetts, USA born Holliston see marriage record so either: Sarah, d. Henry, Apr. 19, 1730. CR1 or Sarah, d. Paul, bp. Mar. 25, 1733. CR1 the latter is much more likely based both on age of s
2 CONC pouse and age at death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Morse Marriage to Joseph Bennett
2 CONT
2 CONT 1754 30 Nov Age: 21 Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, USA Morss: Sarah Mrs, of Holliston, and Joseph Bennet, int. Nov 30 1754 Ipswitch VR page 314 http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Ipswich/Images/Ipswich_M314.shtml
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Morse Death
2 CONT
2 CONT 1796 28 May Age: 63 Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts, USA Bennet: Sarah, wid. May 28, 1796, a. abt. 62 y. CR4 Ipswitch VR page 490
2 CONT
2 CONT In all cases Bennet spelled with one "T"
