1 CONC URSTON and Mary WOOD. She was born 23 Jan 1674/75 in MEDFIEL D, NORFOLK CO., MASSACHUSETTS, and died 10 Mar 1755. He married Rachel FIS HER 17 Nov 1698 in MEDFIELD, NORFOLK CO., MASSACHUSETTS, daughter of Jo hn FISHER and Hannah A
1 CONC DAMS. She was born 24 Mar 1679/80 in MEDFIELD, NORFO LK CO., MASSACHUSETTS, and died 31 Mar 1712 in Medfield, Massachusetts.
