0 @N6000000003796319458@ NOTE Hyde Family Genealogy
1 CONT http://www.renderplus.com/hartgen/htm/hyde.htm
1 CONT 13.Robert Hyde - was born in 1522 in Norbury, Cheshire, England and died after 1523 . He was the son of Hamnet Hyde and Margaret Warren.
1 CONT Robert married Jane Davenport in 1542. Jane was born after 1527, lived in Bramhall, Cheshire, England. She was the daughter of William Davenport and Blanch Warburton. She died after 1566 in Cheshire, England .
1 CONT Children: (Quick Family Chart)
1 CONT i. Robert Hyde was born in 1543, lived in Denton, Lancashire, England and died on 22 Mar 1614 in Stockport, England . See #14. below.
1 CONT ii. Hamnet Hyde was born about 1545 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT iii. William Hyde was born about 1547 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT iv. Edward Hyde was born about 1549 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT v. Richard Hyde was born about 1555 in Norbury, Cheshire, England and died after 1560 .
1 CONT vi. Randall Hyde was born about 1555 in Norbury, Cheshire, England and died after 1625 .
1 CONT vii. Dorothy Hyde was born about 1557 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT viii. Anne Hyde was born about 1561 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT ix. Thomas Hyde was born about 1563 in Norbury, Cheshire, England and was buried on 9 Dec 1618 in Wiltshire, England.
1 CONT x. Ellen Hyde was born in 1561 in Norbury, Cheshire, England.
1 CONT
1 CONT
